window.COURSE = {"slug": "deep-learning", "title": "深度學習完整教學", "shortTitle": "深度學習", "updated": "2026-10-30", "baseline": "PyTorch 2.15.0 · Python 3.11 · CPU verified", "footerLabel": "THE DEEP LEARNING FIELD GUIDE", "exampleBundle": "examples.zip", "searchHint": "搜尋梯度、CNN、Attention 或 Diffusion…", "groups": [{"id": "foundations", "number": "01", "title": "從表示與數學開始", "description": "環境、向量、導數、機率與第一個神經元。"}, {"id": "networks", "number": "02", "title": "神經網路如何反向學習", "description": "MLP、forward、手算與矩陣反向傳播、梯度檢查。"}, {"id": "objectives", "number": "03", "title": "損失、資料與學習問題", "description": "回歸與分類目標、資料邊界、標籤與模型容量。"}, {"id": "optimization", "number": "04", "title": "讓深層模型學得動", "description": "SGD、AdamW、排程、初始化與梯度訊號。"}, {"id": "regularization", "number": "05", "title": "泛化、正則化與正規化", "description": "過擬合、Dropout、BatchNorm、LayerNorm與資料增強。"}, {"id": "vision", "number": "06", "title": "卷積與殘差架構", "description": "卷積運算、感受野、CNN、shortcut與遷移學習。"}, {"id": "sequence", "number": "07", "title": "有時間與順序的資料", "description": "RNN、BPTT、LSTM／GRU、Embedding與變長序列。"}, {"id": "attention", "number": "08", "title": "Attention與表示學習", "description": "Q／K／V、mask、multi-head、Transformer橋接與自監督。"}, {"id": "generative", "number": "09", "title": "生成模型的共同問題", "description": "AE、VAE、GAN、Diffusion與Flow Matching的低維實驗。"}, {"id": "reliability", "number": "10", "title": "診斷、可靠性與模型壓縮", "description": "失敗定位、重現、校準、解釋、穩健性與蒸餾。"}, {"id": "projects", "number": "11", "title": "把原理組成完整專題", "description": "表格、影像、序列與生成實驗的驗收及交付。"}, {"id": "synthesis", "number": "12", "title": "整合、習題與持續學習", "description": "實驗設計、架構地圖、手算解答、實作挑戰與速查。"}], "lessons": [{"id": "01-representations", "group": "foundations", "title": "深度學習全貌：讓特徵也成為可以學習的表示", "summary": "從神經元到層次表示，先看清楚資料、架構、目標與最佳化的關係。", "tags": ["deep learning", "representation", "architecture", "overview"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">深度學習全貌：讓特徵也成為可以學習的表示</h1>\n<p>從神經元到層次表示，先看清楚資料、架構、目標與最佳化的關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">模型同時學什麼</h2>\n<p>手工特徵讓人先決定要看哪些變化；深度網路把多層可調轉換串起來，讓中間表示也依目標學習。影像的局部模式、序列的上下文與表格的非線性交互，都可能透過不同架構表達。更多層或參數本身不保證更準，還需要資料、適合目標及可行最佳化。</p>\n<p>本課以2026-10-30查核的最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0實作，先使用CPU小型資料。重點從數學與架構一路連到可檢查實驗；PyTorch操作細節可與既有工程課互讀。Transformer、影像辨識及LLM微調仍保留各自完整課程，這裡建立所需共同原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">四個互相影響的選擇</h2>\n<p>資料決定可學訊號，架構決定函數族，loss決定偏好的解，optimizer決定如何找解。模型評估另看未見資料、任務成本與使用條件。只改optimizer不能補回不存在的標籤；換更大架構也不能修正未來資料洩漏。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nh_0=x,\\qquad h_l=\\phi_l(W_lh_{l-1}+b_l),\\qquad \\hat y=g(h_L)\n$$</div>\n<p>此為單筆column-vector記號；批次實作稍後用row形式並明確寫shape。各層可以是全連接、卷積、遞迴或Attention，而非永遠相同矩陣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">如何驗證你真的理解</h2>\n<p>先手算一個神經元，再手算兩層chain rule，對照Autograd；用已知生成規則檢查模型能否學；再加入train/val/test與完整產物。42個入口使用真正Torch，網頁六個實驗使用JavaScript數學，兩者角色清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">主線與成果</h2>\n<p>72章由必要數學、MLP、loss、最佳化、泛化、CNN、序列、Attention到生成與診斷。會實際訓練表格MLP、線條CNN、變長GRU、AE、VAE、低維GAN、1D Diffusion與Flow Matching。這些是運作機制實驗，沒有把合成成績外推為真實影像、語言或生成品質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若模型能將train完全記住，是否已學到可靠規則？答案：尚不足，需要合理未見評估與分布假設。若小型XOR網路能擬合四點，只證明這組非線性表示與訓練流程可用，還不是任意新點的泛化證據。每次實驗都先寫它想驗證哪項主張。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html\">官方基本流程</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0\">2.15正式發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html\">深度前饋網路</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 深度學習全貌：讓特徵也成為可以學習的表示\n\n從神經元到層次表示，先看清楚資料、架構、目標與最佳化的關係。\n\n## 模型同時學什麼\n\n手工特徵讓人先決定要看哪些變化；深度網路把多層可調轉換串起來，讓中間表示也依目標學習。影像的局部模式、序列的上下文與表格的非線性交互，都可能透過不同架構表達。更多層或參數本身不保證更準，還需要資料、適合目標及可行最佳化。\n\n本課以2026-10-30查核的最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0實作，先使用CPU小型資料。重點從數學與架構一路連到可檢查實驗；PyTorch操作細節可與既有工程課互讀。Transformer、影像辨識及LLM微調仍保留各自完整課程，這裡建立所需共同原理。\n\n## 四個互相影響的選擇\n\n資料決定可學訊號，架構決定函數族，loss決定偏好的解，optimizer決定如何找解。模型評估另看未見資料、任務成本與使用條件。只改optimizer不能補回不存在的標籤；換更大架構也不能修正未來資料洩漏。\n\n$$\nh_0=x,\\qquad h_l=\\phi_l(W_lh_{l-1}+b_l),\\qquad \\hat y=g(h_L)\n$$\n\n此為單筆column-vector記號；批次實作稍後用row形式並明確寫shape。各層可以是全連接、卷積、遞迴或Attention，而非永遠相同矩陣。\n\n## 如何驗證你真的理解\n\n先手算一個神經元，再手算兩層chain rule，對照Autograd；用已知生成規則檢查模型能否學；再加入train/val/test與完整產物。42個入口使用真正Torch，網頁六個實驗使用JavaScript數學，兩者角色清楚。\n\n## 主線與成果\n\n72章由必要數學、MLP、loss、最佳化、泛化、CNN、序列、Attention到生成與診斷。會實際訓練表格MLP、線條CNN、變長GRU、AE、VAE、低維GAN、1D Diffusion與Flow Matching。這些是運作機制實驗，沒有把合成成績外推為真實影像、語言或生成品質。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若模型能將train完全記住，是否已學到可靠規則？答案：尚不足，需要合理未見評估與分布假設。若小型XOR網路能擬合四點，只證明這組非線性表示與訓練流程可用，還不是任意新點的泛化證據。每次實驗都先寫它想驗證哪項主張。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [官方基本流程](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html)\n- [2.15正式發布](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0)\n- [深度前饋網路](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "深度學習全貌：讓特徵也成為可以學習的表示", "html": "深度學習全貌：讓特徵也成為可以學習的表示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "模型同時學什麼", "html": "模型同時學什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "四個互相影響的選擇", "html": "四個互相影響的選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "如何驗證你真的理解", "html": "如何驗證你真的理解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "主線與成果", "html": "主線與成果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "02-environment", "group": "foundations", "title": "最新版實作環境：CPU、版本與可重現入口", "summary": "先確認解譯器與套件，再開始不需模型下載的實驗。", "tags": ["install", "2.15.0", "CPU", "environment"], "html": "<h1 id=\"cpu\">最新版實作環境：CPU、版本與可重現入口</h1>\n<p>先確認解譯器與套件，再開始不需模型下載的實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">查核與實測分開記錄</h2>\n<p>官方release與PyPI確認PyTorch2.15.0為查核日最新穩定版，Python套件需求&gt;=3.11。本課在Python3.11.6、Torch2.15.0+cpu實測。安裝版本固定是為了重現製作時的最新版，下次更新再查核與驗證，不以本機舊版代替最新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"windows\">Windows安裝</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">venv</span> <span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-upgrade</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"n\">-r</span> <span class=\"n\">deep-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">requirements</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">txt</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-index-url</span> <span class=\"n\">https</span><span class=\"p\">://</span><span class=\"n\">download</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">org</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">whl</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">cpu</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">deep-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">01_neuron</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>macOS／Linux對應.venv/bin/python，平台套件以官方選擇器為準。解壓ZIP並進入examples時，需求檔與入口改同層名稱。直接指定venv解譯器，避免IDE或pip選到另一環境；網站閱讀不需Python。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">執行前確認</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">executable</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__version__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>CPU顯示CUDA不可用正常，仍可完成主線。若要GPU另選符合driver的build與硬體測試，沒有把CPU結果當GPU驗證。基礎例子設單執行緒是為小工作降低開銷，不是一般模型的最佳效能設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">範例的依賴與資料</h2>\n<p>只需Torch及其必要依賴，不加torchvision／預訓練模型／外部資料下載。資料為自製數值、線條影像、token序列與低維生成分布。core模組含完整共用實作，與編號入口一起保留；固定JSON推論樣本依__file__定位，從另一cwd也能執行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">驗證與錯誤分類</h2>\n<p>import失敗先查環境與wheel；shape錯誤查資料契約；loss為NaN查數值與目標；GPU問題查裝置與build。先在CPU建立可手算小例，不一開始加入混合精度、編譯與多程序，使每次失敗可定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>記錄Python、Torch、device與實際入口命令，再執行第3例梯度對照。解答：安裝成功只是起點，真的forward/backward才能確認可執行。若更新Torch，重跑數值、mask、生成與產物測試，再改查核日期；不要只換顯示版本號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/\">官方安裝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/\">套件版本</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 最新版實作環境：CPU、版本與可重現入口\n\n先確認解譯器與套件，再開始不需模型下載的實驗。\n\n## 查核與實測分開記錄\n\n官方release與PyPI確認PyTorch2.15.0為查核日最新穩定版，Python套件需求>=3.11。本課在Python3.11.6、Torch2.15.0+cpu實測。安裝版本固定是為了重現製作時的最新版，下次更新再查核與驗證，不以本機舊版代替最新。\n\n## Windows安裝\n\n```powershell\npython -m venv .venv\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install --upgrade pip\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install -r deep-learning/examples/requirements.txt --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe deep-learning/examples/01_neuron.py\n```\n\nmacOS／Linux對應.venv/bin/python，平台套件以官方選擇器為準。解壓ZIP並進入examples時，需求檔與入口改同層名稱。直接指定venv解譯器，避免IDE或pip選到另一環境；網站閱讀不需Python。\n\n## 執行前確認\n\n```python\nimport sys,torch\nprint(sys.executable)\nprint(torch.__version__)\nprint(torch.cuda.is_available())\n```\n\nCPU顯示CUDA不可用正常，仍可完成主線。若要GPU另選符合driver的build與硬體測試，沒有把CPU結果當GPU驗證。基礎例子設單執行緒是為小工作降低開銷，不是一般模型的最佳效能設定。\n\n## 範例的依賴與資料\n\n只需Torch及其必要依賴，不加torchvision／預訓練模型／外部資料下載。資料為自製數值、線條影像、token序列與低維生成分布。core模組含完整共用實作，與編號入口一起保留；固定JSON推論樣本依__file__定位，從另一cwd也能執行。\n\n## 驗證與錯誤分類\n\nimport失敗先查環境與wheel；shape錯誤查資料契約；loss為NaN查數值與目標；GPU問題查裝置與build。先在CPU建立可手算小例，不一開始加入混合精度、編譯與多程序，使每次失敗可定位。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n記錄Python、Torch、device與實際入口命令，再執行第3例梯度對照。解答：安裝成功只是起點，真的forward/backward才能確認可執行。若更新Torch，重跑數值、mask、生成與產物測試，再改查核日期；不要只換顯示版本號。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [官方安裝](https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/)\n- [套件版本](https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cpu", "name": "最新版實作環境：CPU、版本與可重現入口", "html": "最新版實作環境：CPU、版本與可重現入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "查核與實測分開記錄", "html": "查核與實測分開記錄", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "windows", "name": "Windows安裝", "html": "Windows安裝", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "執行前確認", "html": "執行前確認", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "範例的依賴與資料", "html": "範例的依賴與資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "驗證與錯誤分類", "html": "驗證與錯誤分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "03-linear-algebra", "group": "foundations", "title": "必要線性代數：shape、內積與批次矩陣", "summary": "把每個符號對到實際維度，讓之後的forward與backward有清楚契約。", "tags": ["matrix", "shape", "Jacobian", "linear algebra"], "html": "<h1 id=\"shape\">必要線性代數：shape、內積與批次矩陣</h1>\n<p>把每個符號對到實際維度，讓之後的forward與backward有清楚契約。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">樣本與特徵軸</h2>\n<p>X[N,d]每列是一筆，W[d,h]將d個輸入映射h個輸出，b[h]沿batch廣播。Z=XW+b得到[N,h]。PyTorch nn.Linear的weight儲存[h,d]，forward用其轉置；本課手算採W[d,h]，對照實作時明確分別，不混用兩種記號。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nZ_{i,j}=\\sum_{k=1}^{d}X_{i,k}W_{k,j}+b_j\n$$</div>\n<p>若N=3,d=2,h=4，Z有12個數，W有8個參數，b有4個。batch大小改變不應改參數數量，因為相同規則套到每筆樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">逐元素與矩陣運算</h2>\n<p><code>*</code>常表示逐元素，<code>@</code>是矩陣乘積；ReLU對每個值作用，softmax則需指定哪個軸正規化。若把分類dim設成batch軸，就讓不同樣本互相競爭。assert shape只能查結構，也要為每個軸寫名字，確定數值含義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jacobian\">Jacobian與向量積</h2>\n<p>向量輸出對向量輸入的導數是Jacobian。反向傳播通常不完整建立大Jacobian，而計算上游梯度與局部Jacobian的乘積。這能以與forward相近的運算結構傳導導數，也是大模型可訓練的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nJ_{j,k}=\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial x_k},\\qquad\n\\nabla_x L=J^T\\nabla_f L\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">廣播的危險</h2>\n<p>回歸pred[N,1]與target[N]相減，可能擴成[N,N]。程式能算不表示逐樣本配對正確。mean、sum與keepdim也會影響之後廣播與梯度縮放。先列每步shape，loss前明確要求一致；類別索引[N]則有不同契約。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>X[5,4]→W1[4,6]→ReLU→W2[6,2]得到[5,2]；參數含bias為4×6+6+6×2+2=44。若X乘上一個不相容[5,6]矩陣，不能靠reshape掩蓋。解答：重新確認樣本軸與feature軸，保持相同數量元素不等於保持資料意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">Linear與張量</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html\">Broadcasting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/linear_algebra.html\">數學基礎</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 必要線性代數：shape、內積與批次矩陣\n\n把每個符號對到實際維度，讓之後的forward與backward有清楚契約。\n\n## 樣本與特徵軸\n\nX[N,d]每列是一筆，W[d,h]將d個輸入映射h個輸出，b[h]沿batch廣播。Z=XW+b得到[N,h]。PyTorch nn.Linear的weight儲存[h,d]，forward用其轉置；本課手算採W[d,h]，對照實作時明確分別，不混用兩種記號。\n\n$$\nZ_{i,j}=\\sum_{k=1}^{d}X_{i,k}W_{k,j}+b_j\n$$\n\n若N=3,d=2,h=4，Z有12個數，W有8個參數，b有4個。batch大小改變不應改參數數量，因為相同規則套到每筆樣本。\n\n## 逐元素與矩陣運算\n\n`*`常表示逐元素，`@`是矩陣乘積；ReLU對每個值作用，softmax則需指定哪個軸正規化。若把分類dim設成batch軸，就讓不同樣本互相競爭。assert shape只能查結構，也要為每個軸寫名字，確定數值含義。\n\n## Jacobian與向量積\n\n向量輸出對向量輸入的導數是Jacobian。反向傳播通常不完整建立大Jacobian，而計算上游梯度與局部Jacobian的乘積。這能以與forward相近的運算結構傳導導數，也是大模型可訓練的關鍵。\n\n$$\nJ_{j,k}=\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial x_k},\\qquad\n\\nabla_x L=J^T\\nabla_f L\n$$\n\n## 廣播的危險\n\n回歸pred[N,1]與target[N]相減，可能擴成[N,N]。程式能算不表示逐樣本配對正確。mean、sum與keepdim也會影響之後廣播與梯度縮放。先列每步shape，loss前明確要求一致；類別索引[N]則有不同契約。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nX[5,4]→W1[4,6]→ReLU→W2[6,2]得到[5,2]；參數含bias為4×6+6+6×2+2=44。若X乘上一個不相容[5,6]矩陣，不能靠reshape掩蓋。解答：重新確認樣本軸與feature軸，保持相同數量元素不等於保持資料意義。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Linear與張量](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n- [Broadcasting](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html)\n- [數學基礎](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/linear_algebra.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "shape", "name": "必要線性代數：shape、內積與批次矩陣", "html": "必要線性代數：shape、內積與批次矩陣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "樣本與特徵軸", "html": "樣本與特徵軸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "逐元素與矩陣運算", "html": "逐元素與矩陣運算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "jacobian", "name": "Jacobian與向量積", "html": "Jacobian與向量積", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "廣播的危險", "html": "廣播的危險", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "04-calculus", "group": "foundations", "title": "導數、梯度與Chain Rule：從局部變化到整個模型", "summary": "用標量與向量的連鎖關係，理解反向傳播不是神秘黑盒。", "tags": ["chain rule", "gradient", "partial derivative", "calculus"], "html": "<h1 id=\"chain-rule\">導數、梯度與Chain Rule：從局部變化到整個模型</h1>\n<p>用標量與向量的連鎖關係，理解反向傳播不是神秘黑盒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">導數回答局部問題</h2>\n<p>導數描述輸入小幅變動時輸出的一階近似，梯度收集對每個參數的偏導。它不是整段曲線平均，也不保證一個大步長後仍下降。訓練沿負梯度走，步幅與目標曲率一樣重要。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL(\\theta+\\Delta)\\approx L(\\theta)+\\nabla L(\\theta)^T\\Delta\n$$</div>\n<p>例如L=(w-3)²，w=1時梯度-4；lr=.1更新1.4，loss下降；lr=2更新9，loss反而增加。梯度正確與最佳化穩定是兩項不同檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">逐段相乘</h2>\n<p>若a=wx+b、h=σ(a)、ŷ=vh+c、L=.5(ŷ-t)²，對w的導數是各段局部導數的乘積。先算forward中間值，再由L往回傳，避免重複求整個式子。分支時，同一變數透過多條路影響L，梯度要相加。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=(\\hat y-t)\\,v\\,h(1-h)\\,x\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">方向與尺度</h2>\n<p>某個參數gradient很小，可能是局部已接近解，也可能因activation飽和、長鏈乘積縮小或loss縮放。不能只看到0就判斷模型學會。矩陣網路還要看Jacobian方向與奇異值，單一標量範數不能描述所有訊號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">高階導數與計算圖</h2>\n<p>一般backward用於第一階導數；需要對梯度再微分時，必須保留可微分的梯度計算。retain_graph與create_graph目的不同，前者保留同一圖重用，後者建立導數的圖。主線先第一階，不用兩個開關作為所有錯誤的萬用修復。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>L=(wx-t)²，x=2,w=1,t=3，梯度是2(2-3)×2=-4；若loss前加.5，梯度變-2。解答：記住sum／mean與常數因子會改梯度尺度。第9章會完整手算含sigmoid的兩層，再逐參數與Autograd比對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd mechanics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/numerical.html\">數值計算與梯度</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 導數、梯度與Chain Rule：從局部變化到整個模型\n\n用標量與向量的連鎖關係，理解反向傳播不是神秘黑盒。\n\n## 導數回答局部問題\n\n導數描述輸入小幅變動時輸出的一階近似，梯度收集對每個參數的偏導。它不是整段曲線平均，也不保證一個大步長後仍下降。訓練沿負梯度走，步幅與目標曲率一樣重要。\n\n$$\nL(\\theta+\\Delta)\\approx L(\\theta)+\\nabla L(\\theta)^T\\Delta\n$$\n\n例如L=(w-3)²，w=1時梯度-4；lr=.1更新1.4，loss下降；lr=2更新9，loss反而增加。梯度正確與最佳化穩定是兩項不同檢查。\n\n## 逐段相乘\n\n若a=wx+b、h=σ(a)、ŷ=vh+c、L=.5(ŷ-t)²，對w的導數是各段局部導數的乘積。先算forward中間值，再由L往回傳，避免重複求整個式子。分支時，同一變數透過多條路影響L，梯度要相加。\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=(\\hat y-t)\\,v\\,h(1-h)\\,x\n$$\n\n## 方向與尺度\n\n某個參數gradient很小，可能是局部已接近解，也可能因activation飽和、長鏈乘積縮小或loss縮放。不能只看到0就判斷模型學會。矩陣網路還要看Jacobian方向與奇異值，單一標量範數不能描述所有訊號。\n\n## 高階導數與計算圖\n\n一般backward用於第一階導數；需要對梯度再微分時，必須保留可微分的梯度計算。retain_graph與create_graph目的不同，前者保留同一圖重用，後者建立導數的圖。主線先第一階，不用兩個開關作為所有錯誤的萬用修復。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nL=(wx-t)²，x=2,w=1,t=3，梯度是2(2-3)×2=-4；若loss前加.5，梯度變-2。解答：記住sum／mean與常數因子會改梯度尺度。第9章會完整手算含sigmoid的兩層，再逐參數與Autograd比對。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [數值計算與梯度](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/numerical.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "chain-rule", "name": "導數、梯度與Chain Rule：從局部變化到整個模型", "html": "導數、梯度與Chain Rule：從局部變化到整個模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "導數回答局部問題", "html": "導數回答局部問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "逐段相乘", "html": "逐段相乘", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "方向與尺度", "html": "方向與尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "高階導數與計算圖", "html": "高階導數與計算圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "05-probability", "group": "foundations", "title": "機率與最大概似：為什麼這些loss合理", "summary": "將回歸、分類與生成目標連回機率模型，分清密度與機率。", "tags": ["likelihood", "MLE", "entropy", "cross entropy", "probability"], "html": "<h1 id=\"loss\">機率與最大概似：為什麼這些loss合理</h1>\n<p>將回歸、分類與生成目標連回機率模型，分清密度與機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">模型估計什麼</h2>\n<p>分類可估P(Y=c|X=x)，回歸可描述條件分布的均值／尺度，生成模型研究資料分布。輸出一個分數並不自動是機率；softmax／sigmoid提供合法範圍，但是否與現實頻率一致仍需校準與分布驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">從似然到損失</h2>\n<p>假設樣本在模型下獨立，最大化各筆機率／密度的乘積，等價於最小化負對數和。取log使乘法變加法，也有較穩定數值。資料若有時間或群組依賴，要在問題與切分中處理，不用公式的獨立寫法假裝它不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat\\theta=\\arg\\max_\\theta\\prod_i p_\\theta(y_i\\mid x_i)\n=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\left[-\\sum_i\\log p_\\theta(y_i\\mid x_i)\\right]\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">回歸與分類的連結</h2>\n<p>固定變異Gaussian的負log likelihood，除常數後是平方誤差的縮放；Bernoulli對二元目標導出BCE，categorical導出CE。若variance也學，不能只留下MSE而忘記log variance項。loss選擇等於對誤差與輸出分布做假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kl\">熵、交叉熵與KL</h2>\n<p>熵描述分布不確定性，交叉熵用模型q編碼真實p的平均負log，KL比較分布差異且方向通常不對稱。對固定p，最小cross entropy等同最小KL，差一個與q無關的熵。KL不是一般對稱距離，不能直接代替L2做任何幾何推論。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nH(p,q)=-\\sum_c p_c\\log q_c=H(p)+D_{KL}(p\\Vert q)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"gaussian\">用一個Gaussian看清假設</h2>\n<p>若固定σ=2，一筆誤差為4，忽略常數的NLL是誤差平方／(2σ²)=16/8=2；σ改成1時同一誤差貢獻8。這表示噪音尺度決定偏好及梯度尺度。若讓模型自己輸出σ，就還必須加log σ，否則它只要把σ無限放大就能降低平方項。分類也類似：目標不是單純把正確類分數加大，而是提高相對於所有候選的機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>真類機率從.5升.9，單筆CE由約.693降.105；若對錯類自信.99，loss大。連續密度可大於1，不能因某點density&gt;1就說機率不合法；區間積分才是機率。這些區分會在VAE與Flow章再次使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/prob.html\">機率與資訊理論</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions\">Loss functions</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 機率與最大概似：為什麼這些loss合理\n\n將回歸、分類與生成目標連回機率模型，分清密度與機率。\n\n## 模型估計什麼\n\n分類可估P(Y=c|X=x)，回歸可描述條件分布的均值／尺度，生成模型研究資料分布。輸出一個分數並不自動是機率；softmax／sigmoid提供合法範圍，但是否與現實頻率一致仍需校準與分布驗證。\n\n## 從似然到損失\n\n假設樣本在模型下獨立，最大化各筆機率／密度的乘積，等價於最小化負對數和。取log使乘法變加法，也有較穩定數值。資料若有時間或群組依賴，要在問題與切分中處理，不用公式的獨立寫法假裝它不存在。\n\n$$\n\\hat\\theta=\\arg\\max_\\theta\\prod_i p_\\theta(y_i\\mid x_i)\n=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\left[-\\sum_i\\log p_\\theta(y_i\\mid x_i)\\right]\n$$\n\n## 回歸與分類的連結\n\n固定變異Gaussian的負log likelihood，除常數後是平方誤差的縮放；Bernoulli對二元目標導出BCE，categorical導出CE。若variance也學，不能只留下MSE而忘記log variance項。loss選擇等於對誤差與輸出分布做假設。\n\n## 熵、交叉熵與KL\n\n熵描述分布不確定性，交叉熵用模型q編碼真實p的平均負log，KL比較分布差異且方向通常不對稱。對固定p，最小cross entropy等同最小KL，差一個與q無關的熵。KL不是一般對稱距離，不能直接代替L2做任何幾何推論。\n\n$$\nH(p,q)=-\\sum_c p_c\\log q_c=H(p)+D_{KL}(p\\Vert q)\n$$\n\n## 用一個Gaussian看清假設\n\n若固定σ=2，一筆誤差為4，忽略常數的NLL是誤差平方／(2σ²)=16/8=2；σ改成1時同一誤差貢獻8。這表示噪音尺度決定偏好及梯度尺度。若讓模型自己輸出σ，就還必須加log σ，否則它只要把σ無限放大就能降低平方項。分類也類似：目標不是單純把正確類分數加大，而是提高相對於所有候選的機率。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n真類機率從.5升.9，單筆CE由約.693降.105；若對錯類自信.99，loss大。連續密度可大於1，不能因某點density>1就說機率不合法；區間積分才是機率。這些區分會在VAE與Flow章再次使用。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [機率與資訊理論](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/prob.html)\n- [Loss functions](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "loss", "name": "機率與最大概似：為什麼這些loss合理", "html": "機率與最大概似：為什麼這些loss合理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "模型估計什麼", "html": "模型估計什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "從似然到損失", "html": "從似然到損失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "回歸與分類的連結", "html": "回歸與分類的連結", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "kl", "name": "熵、交叉熵與KL", "html": "熵、交叉熵與KL", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gaussian", "name": "用一個Gaussian看清假設", "html": "用一個Gaussian看清假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "06-neuron", "group": "foundations", "title": "第一個神經元：仿射、非線性與輸出含義", "summary": "用一筆兩維輸入手算forward，建立每一層都可追蹤的習慣。", "tags": ["neuron", "affine", "activation", "Linear"], "example": "01_neuron.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">第一個神經元：仿射、非線性與輸出含義</h1>\n<p>用一筆兩維輸入手算forward，建立每一層都可追蹤的習慣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一個小型運算單元</h2>\n<p>神經元先計算加權和加bias，再套activation。它是數學模型，不需把生物神經細節當實作依據。多輸入單輸出是內積，多輸出就是一組神經元，批次則把相同參數套到多列。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nz=w^Tx+b,\\qquad h=\\phi(z)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">手算數字</h2>\n<p>x=[1,2]、w=[.5,-1]、b=.2，z=.5-2+.2=-1.3。ReLU輸出0，sigmoid約.2142。相同線性分數經不同activation會改值、導數與後續可表示關係；不能只因輸出落0..1就說已學到有校準的機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參數與超參數</h2>\n<p>w與b由資料fit；activation類型、層數、寬度與學習率由設計／選模決定。bias使分隔面可以平移，沒有它時某些結構被限制通過原點。若所有參數初始化相同，後續神經元可能學相同東西，所以隨機打破對稱性很重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"torch\">連到Torch介面</h2>\n<p>nn.Linear(2,1)保存weight[1,2]與bias[1]，輸入[1,2]是batch1、feature2。F.linear(x,w,b)明確使用這個儲存布局。本章直接給固定weights核對結果；之後才讓optimizer學習，不把隨機初值輸出誤當已訓練預測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將第二個feature改1，z=.5-1+.2=-.3，ReLU仍0；若改0，z=.7，ReLU=.7。解答：ReLU負區域對輸入的局部導數為0，但weight改變仍可能讓值跨到正區，是否能學到取決於整個網路的訊號路徑。下一章用XOR展示非線性組合的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/01_neuron.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;One affine neuron and its activation, with hand-checkable numbers.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;x&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;linear_score&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relu&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relu</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sigmoid&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sigmoid</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;an affine score is not automatically a probability&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">Linear與activation</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 第一個神經元：仿射、非線性與輸出含義\n\n用一筆兩維輸入手算forward，建立每一層都可追蹤的習慣。\n\n## 一個小型運算單元\n\n神經元先計算加權和加bias，再套activation。它是數學模型，不需把生物神經細節當實作依據。多輸入單輸出是內積，多輸出就是一組神經元，批次則把相同參數套到多列。\n\n$$\nz=w^Tx+b,\\qquad h=\\phi(z)\n$$\n\n## 手算數字\n\nx=[1,2]、w=[.5,-1]、b=.2，z=.5-2+.2=-1.3。ReLU輸出0，sigmoid約.2142。相同線性分數經不同activation會改值、導數與後續可表示關係；不能只因輸出落0..1就說已學到有校準的機率。\n\n## 參數與超參數\n\nw與b由資料fit；activation類型、層數、寬度與學習率由設計／選模決定。bias使分隔面可以平移，沒有它時某些結構被限制通過原點。若所有參數初始化相同，後續神經元可能學相同東西，所以隨機打破對稱性很重要。\n\n## 連到Torch介面\n\nnn.Linear(2,1)保存weight[1,2]與bias[1]，輸入[1,2]是batch1、feature2。F.linear(x,w,b)明確使用這個儲存布局。本章直接給固定weights核對結果；之後才讓optimizer學習，不把隨機初值輸出誤當已訓練預測。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將第二個feature改1，z=.5-1+.2=-.3，ReLU仍0；若改0，z=.7，ReLU=.7。解答：ReLU負區域對輸入的局部導數為0，但weight改變仍可能讓值跨到正區，是否能學到取決於整個網路的訊號路徑。下一章用XOR展示非線性組合的能力。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/01_neuron.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"One affine neuron and its activation, with hand-checkable numbers.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.tensor([[1.,2.]])\n    w=torch.tensor([[.5,-1.]])\n    b=torch.tensor([.2])\n    z=F.linear(x,w,b)\n    result={'x':x,'linear_score':z,'relu':F.relu(z),'sigmoid':z.sigmoid(),\n            'note':'an affine score is not automatically a probability'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Linear與activation](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "第一個神經元：仿射、非線性與輸出含義", "html": "第一個神經元：仿射、非線性與輸出含義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一個小型運算單元", "html": "一個小型運算單元", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "手算數字", "html": "手算數字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參數與超參數", "html": "參數與超參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "torch", "name": "連到Torch介面", "html": "連到Torch介面", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "07-mlp", "group": "networks", "title": "MLP與XOR：非線性如何改變可表示的規則", "summary": "理解隱藏層的功能，再實際訓練一個可擬合四個角點的小網路。", "tags": ["MLP", "XOR", "nonlinearity", "expressivity"], "example": "02_xor.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"mlpxor\">MLP與XOR：非線性如何改變可表示的規則</h1>\n<p>理解隱藏層的功能，再實際訓練一個可擬合四個角點的小網路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">線性層堆疊仍是線性</h2>\n<p>若中間沒有非線性，W2(W1x+b1)+b2仍可合併成單一仿射映射。層數增加了參數形式，沒有自動增加這類函數的非線性表達。activation讓不同區域有不同反應，這才使多層組合能形成更複雜邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"xor\">XOR的四個點</h2>\n<p>(0,0)與(1,1)標0，(0,1)與(1,0)標1，單一線性分隔無法同時將對角類分開。若b&lt;0且兩個單1角點正，則w1+w2+b&gt;-b&gt;0，與(1,1)要負矛盾。這個小問題能具體展示非線性需要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">可執行網路</h2>\n<p>Linear(2,8)→Tanh→Linear(8,1)，輸出raw logit，BCEWithLogitsLoss學二元target。例子反覆使用四個training points，測試核對最後類別[0,1,1,0]與loss下降。它是表示與更新的sanity check，不是對新資料的真實泛化評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">隱藏表示如何幫忙</h2>\n<p>第一層可將原空間轉成新的特徵，第二層在這個表示上分開類別。它不必剛好學成你手工想像的兩條線，也可能有多組不同weights得到相同四點結果。參數非唯一性是解釋與比較網路時要記住的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>移除Tanh只保留兩個Linear，四點不應能被單一線性決策完美分開；增大寬度也不改這項限制。若保留非線性但學不會，先查loss／target契約、梯度與更新，再檢查seed與步長。多參數只提供可能性，optimizer仍需找到適合解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/02_xor.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a nonlinear MLP on all four XOR corners; training sanity only.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tanh</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Adam</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binary_cross_entropy_with_logits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">350</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binary_cross_entropy_with_logits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inference_mode</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sigmoid</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_bce&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;final_bce&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;predictions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">long</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;four training points, no generalization claim&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html\">Deep feedforward networks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">BCE與模組</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# MLP與XOR：非線性如何改變可表示的規則\n\n理解隱藏層的功能，再實際訓練一個可擬合四個角點的小網路。\n\n## 線性層堆疊仍是線性\n\n若中間沒有非線性，W2(W1x+b1)+b2仍可合併成單一仿射映射。層數增加了參數形式，沒有自動增加這類函數的非線性表達。activation讓不同區域有不同反應，這才使多層組合能形成更複雜邊界。\n\n## XOR的四個點\n\n(0,0)與(1,1)標0，(0,1)與(1,0)標1，單一線性分隔無法同時將對角類分開。若b<0且兩個單1角點正，則w1+w2+b>-b>0，與(1,1)要負矛盾。這個小問題能具體展示非線性需要。\n\n## 可執行網路\n\nLinear(2,8)→Tanh→Linear(8,1)，輸出raw logit，BCEWithLogitsLoss學二元target。例子反覆使用四個training points，測試核對最後類別[0,1,1,0]與loss下降。它是表示與更新的sanity check，不是對新資料的真實泛化評估。\n\n## 隱藏表示如何幫忙\n\n第一層可將原空間轉成新的特徵，第二層在這個表示上分開類別。它不必剛好學成你手工想像的兩條線，也可能有多組不同weights得到相同四點結果。參數非唯一性是解釋與比較網路時要記住的事。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n移除Tanh只保留兩個Linear，四點不應能被單一線性決策完美分開；增大寬度也不改這項限制。若保留非線性但學不會，先查loss／target契約、梯度與更新，再檢查seed與步長。多參數只提供可能性，optimizer仍需找到適合解。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/02_xor.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a nonlinear MLP on all four XOR corners; training sanity only.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.tensor([[0.,0.],[0.,1.],[1.,0.],[1.,1.]])\n    y=torch.tensor([[0.],[1.],[1.],[0.]])\n    model=nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(2,8),nn.Tanh(),nn.Linear(8,1))\n    optimizer=torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(),lr=.05)\n    initial=F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(model(x),y).item()\n    for _ in range(350):\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n        loss=F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(model(x),y)\n        loss.backward();optimizer.step()\n    with torch.inference_mode():probability=model(x).sigmoid()\n    result={'initial_bce':initial,'final_bce':loss.item(),'probabilities':probability,\n            'predictions':(probability>=.5).long(),'scope':'four training points, no generalization claim'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Deep feedforward networks](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html)\n- [BCE與模組](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "mlpxor", "name": "MLP與XOR：非線性如何改變可表示的規則", "html": "MLP與XOR：非線性如何改變可表示的規則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "線性層堆疊仍是線性", "html": "線性層堆疊仍是線性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "xor", "name": "XOR的四個點", "html": "XOR的四個點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "可執行網路", "html": "可執行網路", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "隱藏表示如何幫忙", "html": "隱藏表示如何幫忙", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "08-forward", "group": "networks", "title": "Forward與參數帳本：每一層到底計算什麼", "summary": "用固定維度追蹤中間表示、共享參數與記憶體成本。", "tags": ["forward", "parameter count", "shape", "activation memory"], "html": "<h1 id=\"forward\">Forward與參數帳本：每一層到底計算什麼</h1>\n<p>用固定維度追蹤中間表示、共享參數與記憶體成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">將網路寫成資料流</h2>\n<p>本課表格MLP為4→24→24→2，每個hidden之後ReLU。輸入X[N,4]，中間[N,24]兩次，最後logits[N,2]。模型每層參數共享於batch所有樣本，不會因N變大就產生新weights。forward回傳logits，loss在訓練流程外計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參數數量</h2>\n<p>Linear(d,h)有dh+h個參數。三層分別4×24+24=120，24×24+24=600，24×2+2=50，總770。ReLU沒有可學參數，但對表示與梯度至關重要。沒有參數不等於沒有計算或記憶體成本。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP=\\sum_l(d_{l-1}d_l+d_l)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"weights\">記憶體不只weights</h2>\n<p>訓練需中間activation供backward、grad與optimizer狀態；Adam額外維護一階／二階估計。batch與sequence length主要增加activation，參數數未必改變。只用模型參數×4bytes估GPU需求，會漏掉重要部分。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">MLP</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">state_dict</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">tuple</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>在examples資料夾執行，預期參數數770。state_dict也可能含buffer，不能把每個Tensor都一律叫可訓練參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常見錯誤</h2>\n<p>每次forward新建Linear會重新初始化且不在原optimizer；普通list放層未正確註冊；無參數squeeze可在N=1時刪batch；Flatten將batch也合併會把不同樣本混在一起。這些都可能讓loss看似能算，學習含義卻改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>寬度改6，4→6→6→2總參數為30+42+14=86。解答：少參數不保證一定比較快，也需看運算大小與批次；第60章蒸餾會比較這兩個架構的固定小型實驗。每次改尺寸先畫帳本，再跑一個batch核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Modules與狀態</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">Linear API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Forward與參數帳本：每一層到底計算什麼\n\n用固定維度追蹤中間表示、共享參數與記憶體成本。\n\n## 將網路寫成資料流\n\n本課表格MLP為4→24→24→2，每個hidden之後ReLU。輸入X[N,4]，中間[N,24]兩次，最後logits[N,2]。模型每層參數共享於batch所有樣本，不會因N變大就產生新weights。forward回傳logits，loss在訓練流程外計算。\n\n## 參數數量\n\nLinear(d,h)有dh+h個參數。三層分別4×24+24=120，24×24+24=600，24×2+2=50，總770。ReLU沒有可學參數，但對表示與梯度至關重要。沒有參數不等於沒有計算或記憶體成本。\n\n$$\nP=\\sum_l(d_{l-1}d_l+d_l)\n$$\n\n## 記憶體不只weights\n\n訓練需中間activation供backward、grad與optimizer狀態；Adam額外維護一階／二階估計。batch與sequence length主要增加activation，參數數未必改變。只用模型參數×4bytes估GPU需求，會漏掉重要部分。\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import MLP\nmodel=MLP()\nprint(sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\nfor name,value in model.state_dict().items():\n    print(name,tuple(value.shape))\n```\n\n在examples資料夾執行，預期參數數770。state_dict也可能含buffer，不能把每個Tensor都一律叫可訓練參數。\n\n## 常見錯誤\n\n每次forward新建Linear會重新初始化且不在原optimizer；普通list放層未正確註冊；無參數squeeze可在N=1時刪batch；Flatten將batch也合併會把不同樣本混在一起。這些都可能讓loss看似能算，學習含義卻改變。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n寬度改6，4→6→6→2總參數為30+42+14=86。解答：少參數不保證一定比較快，也需看運算大小與批次；第60章蒸餾會比較這兩個架構的固定小型實驗。每次改尺寸先畫帳本，再跑一個batch核對。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Modules與狀態](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n- [Linear API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "forward", "name": "Forward與參數帳本：每一層到底計算什麼", "html": "Forward與參數帳本：每一層到底計算什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "將網路寫成資料流", "html": "將網路寫成資料流", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參數數量", "html": "參數數量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "weights", "name": "記憶體不只weights", "html": "記憶體不只weights", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常見錯誤", "html": "常見錯誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "09-scalar-backprop", "group": "networks", "title": "手算反向傳播：一個隱藏神經元的四個梯度", "summary": "將forward數值保存，再沿每條依賴路徑回傳導數。", "tags": ["backpropagation", "chain rule", "manual gradients"], "example": "03_scalar_backprop.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">手算反向傳播：一個隱藏神經元的四個梯度</h1>\n<p>將forward數值保存，再沿每條依賴路徑回傳導數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">固定網路與數字</h2>\n<p>x=2，w1=.3、b1=-.1，a=w1x+b1=.5，h=sigmoid(a)；輸出ŷ=w2h+b2，w2=-.7、b2=.2，target=.8。loss=.5(ŷ-target)²。先列這些中間值，再算導數，比直接展開所有指數更容易核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">從輸出往回</h2>\n<p>令e=ŷ-target，則dL/dŷ=e。輸出層dL/dw2=eh，dL/db2=e；對hidden傳回eh的係數需注意是e×w2，不是再次乘h。sigmoid的局部導數h(1-h)，最後乘x得到w1梯度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\delta_a=e\\,w_2\\,h(1-h),\\quad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w_1}=\\delta_a x,\\quad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial b_1}=\\delta_a\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"autograd\">手算與Autograd對照</h2>\n<p>第3例以Python標量公式產生manual結果，再用double Tensor重算同一個圖，逐一比w1、b1、w2、b2。最大誤差應接近浮點精度。測的是導數，不拿「訓練有下降」代替梯度正確性證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"forward\">為何要保存forward中間值</h2>\n<p>h已包含sigmoid結果，backward可直接用h(1-h)。大網路也會保存必要中間量；釋放或重新計算它們是記憶體策略，不改chain rule。若在backward前用in-place改掉需要的值，可能觸發版本錯誤，不能用.data繞過後假裝梯度仍可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若w2=0，第一層透過這條路的梯度為0，但w2梯度eh仍可非零；下一步w2更新後又能傳訊號。若把loss的.5移除，全部導數乘2。解答：常數因子、mean分母與每條路徑都需一致，否則手算對照會整體差一倍或一個N。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/03_scalar_backprop.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Compare hand-derived chain-rule gradients with real Autograd.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">manual_chain</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">manual_chain</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">w2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b2</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sigmoid</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w1</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">b2</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;w1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">w1</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;b1&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;w2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">w2</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;b2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b2</span><span class=\"p\">)]}</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;manual&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;autograd&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_gradient_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd mechanics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html\">Back-propagation原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 手算反向傳播：一個隱藏神經元的四個梯度\n\n將forward數值保存，再沿每條依賴路徑回傳導數。\n\n## 固定網路與數字\n\nx=2，w1=.3、b1=-.1，a=w1x+b1=.5，h=sigmoid(a)；輸出ŷ=w2h+b2，w2=-.7、b2=.2，target=.8。loss=.5(ŷ-target)²。先列這些中間值，再算導數，比直接展開所有指數更容易核對。\n\n## 從輸出往回\n\n令e=ŷ-target，則dL/dŷ=e。輸出層dL/dw2=eh，dL/db2=e；對hidden傳回eh的係數需注意是e×w2，不是再次乘h。sigmoid的局部導數h(1-h)，最後乘x得到w1梯度。\n\n$$\n\\delta_a=e\\,w_2\\,h(1-h),\\quad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w_1}=\\delta_a x,\\quad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial b_1}=\\delta_a\n$$\n\n## 手算與Autograd對照\n\n第3例以Python標量公式產生manual結果，再用double Tensor重算同一個圖，逐一比w1、b1、w2、b2。最大誤差應接近浮點精度。測的是導數，不拿「訓練有下降」代替梯度正確性證據。\n\n## 為何要保存forward中間值\n\nh已包含sigmoid結果，backward可直接用h(1-h)。大網路也會保存必要中間量；釋放或重新計算它們是記憶體策略，不改chain rule。若在backward前用in-place改掉需要的值，可能觸發版本錯誤，不能用.data繞過後假裝梯度仍可靠。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若w2=0，第一層透過這條路的梯度為0，但w2梯度eh仍可非零；下一步w2更新後又能傳訊號。若把loss的.5移除，全部導數乘2。解答：常數因子、mean分母與每條路徑都需一致，否則手算對照會整體差一倍或一個N。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/03_scalar_backprop.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Compare hand-derived chain-rule gradients with real Autograd.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import manual_chain\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    manual=manual_chain()\n    w1,b1,w2,b2=[torch.tensor(v,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True) for v in [.3,-.1,-.7,.2]]\n    hidden=torch.sigmoid(w1*2+b1)\n    loss=.5*(w2*hidden+b2-.8).square();loss.backward()\n    automatic={name:value.grad.item() for name,value in [('w1',w1),('b1',b1),('w2',w2),('b2',b2)]}\n    result={'manual':manual,'autograd':automatic,\n            'maximum_gradient_error':max(abs(manual[k]-automatic[k]) for k in automatic)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [Back-propagation原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "手算反向傳播：一個隱藏神經元的四個梯度", "html": "手算反向傳播：一個隱藏神經元的四個梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "固定網路與數字", "html": "固定網路與數字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "從輸出往回", "html": "從輸出往回", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "autograd", "name": "手算與Autograd對照", "html": "手算與Autograd對照", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "forward", "name": "為何要保存forward中間值", "html": "為何要保存forward中間值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "10-matrix-backprop", "group": "networks", "title": "矩陣反向傳播：一個batch如何一起求梯度", "summary": "由softmax CE的輸出梯度，推回兩層MLP並核對shape。", "tags": ["vectorized backprop", "Jacobian", "softmax gradient"], "example": "04_matrix_backprop.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"batch\">矩陣反向傳播：一個batch如何一起求梯度</h1>\n<p>由softmax CE的輸出梯度，推回兩層MLP並核對shape。</p>\n<h2 id=\"row-vector\">固定row-vector記號</h2>\n<p>X[N,d]，A1=XW1+b1，H=ReLU(A1)，Z=HW2+b2。W1[d,h]、W2[h,C]；CE對N筆mean。不要混淆PyTorchLinear儲存的轉置形狀，本章手工矩陣與實際公式完全對齊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">輸出層的簡潔梯度</h2>\n<p>CE把softmax與log合併後，對logits梯度為(P-Y)/N，其中Y為one-hot。這只對此處未加權、每筆一個類別的mean契約成立；若有class weights或有效token mask，分母要重新推導。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nD_Z=\\frac{P-Y}{N},\\quad\nD_{W_2}=H^TD_Z,\\quad D_{b_2}=\\sum_iD_{Z,i}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"relu\">經過ReLU再回第一層</h2>\n<p>先傳D_H=D_ZW2ᵀ，再逐元素乘A1&gt;0的導數。weights梯度是輸入轉置乘local delta，bias是batch加總。這些式子的shape本身提供檢查，若需要隨意reshape才能相乘，多半記號已錯位。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nD_{A_1}=(D_ZW_2^T)\\odot1[A_1&gt;0],\\quad\nD_{W_1}=X^TD_{A_1},\\quad D_{b_1}=\\sum_iD_{A_1,i}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">實驗與驗收</h2>\n<p>第4例使用N3、d2、h3、C2與double，計算全部manual矩陣再與Autograd.grad比。不是建立龐大完整Jacobian，而是直接用相同的向量積結構。ReLU在0處不可微，本例選非邊界值，PyTorch對0的約定會在activation章說明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若loss使用sum，D_Z不除N；其他推導相同。若W2有共享分支，對它的貢獻需相加。解答：反向傳播的核心是局部Jacobian乘上游訊號與共享節點累加，不是每種新架構都重寫完整微積分。新層仍需知道局部運算與數值穩定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/04_matrix_backprop.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Vectorized two-layer backward, checked against Autograd.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">softmax_gradient</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w1</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w2</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">b2</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"nd\">@w1</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relu</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"nd\">@w2</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">b2</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dz</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">softmax_gradient</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">da</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dz</span><span class=\"nd\">@w2</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">())</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"nd\">@da</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">da</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"nd\">@dz</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dz</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">errors</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">g</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">w1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">w2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b2</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;manual_gradient_shapes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">g</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">errors</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html\">CrossEntropyLoss</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 矩陣反向傳播：一個batch如何一起求梯度\n\n由softmax CE的輸出梯度，推回兩層MLP並核對shape。\n\n## 固定row-vector記號\n\nX[N,d]，A1=XW1+b1，H=ReLU(A1)，Z=HW2+b2。W1[d,h]、W2[h,C]；CE對N筆mean。不要混淆PyTorchLinear儲存的轉置形狀，本章手工矩陣與實際公式完全對齊。\n\n## 輸出層的簡潔梯度\n\nCE把softmax與log合併後，對logits梯度為(P-Y)/N，其中Y為one-hot。這只對此處未加權、每筆一個類別的mean契約成立；若有class weights或有效token mask，分母要重新推導。\n\n$$\nD_Z=\\frac{P-Y}{N},\\quad\nD_{W_2}=H^TD_Z,\\quad D_{b_2}=\\sum_iD_{Z,i}\n$$\n\n## 經過ReLU再回第一層\n\n先傳D_H=D_ZW2ᵀ，再逐元素乘A1>0的導數。weights梯度是輸入轉置乘local delta，bias是batch加總。這些式子的shape本身提供檢查，若需要隨意reshape才能相乘，多半記號已錯位。\n\n$$\nD_{A_1}=(D_ZW_2^T)\\odot1[A_1>0],\\quad\nD_{W_1}=X^TD_{A_1},\\quad D_{b_1}=\\sum_iD_{A_1,i}\n$$\n\n## 實驗與驗收\n\n第4例使用N3、d2、h3、C2與double，計算全部manual矩陣再與Autograd.grad比。不是建立龐大完整Jacobian，而是直接用相同的向量積結構。ReLU在0處不可微，本例選非邊界值，PyTorch對0的約定會在activation章說明。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若loss使用sum，D_Z不除N；其他推導相同。若W2有共享分支，對它的貢獻需相加。解答：反向傳播的核心是局部Jacobian乘上游訊號與共享節點累加，不是每種新架構都重寫完整微積分。新層仍需知道局部運算與數值穩定性。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/04_matrix_backprop.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Vectorized two-layer backward, checked against Autograd.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import softmax_gradient\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.randn(3,2,dtype=torch.double)\n    w1=torch.randn(2,3,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True)\n    b1=torch.randn(3,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True)\n    w2=torch.randn(3,2,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True)\n    b2=torch.randn(2,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True)\n    labels=torch.tensor([0,1,0])\n    a=x@w1+b1;hidden=F.relu(a);logits=hidden@w2+b2\n    loss=F.cross_entropy(logits,labels);loss.backward()\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        dz=softmax_gradient(logits,labels)\n        da=(dz@w2.t())*(a>0)\n        manual=[x.t()@da,da.sum(0),hidden.t()@dz,dz.sum(0)]\n        errors=[(p.grad-g).abs().max().item() for p,g in zip([w1,b1,w2,b2],manual)]\n    result={'manual_gradient_shapes':[list(g.shape) for g in manual],'maximum_error':max(errors)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [CrossEntropyLoss](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "batch", "name": "矩陣反向傳播：一個batch如何一起求梯度", "html": "矩陣反向傳播：一個batch如何一起求梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "row-vector", "name": "固定row-vector記號", "html": "固定row-vector記號", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "輸出層的簡潔梯度", "html": "輸出層的簡潔梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "relu", "name": "經過ReLU再回第一層", "html": "經過ReLU再回第一層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "實驗與驗收", "html": "實驗與驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "11-gradient-check", "group": "networks", "title": "梯度檢查：有限差分、double與不可微邊界", "summary": "用第二種計算方式發現符號、分母或圖被切斷的錯誤。", "tags": ["gradcheck", "finite difference", "autograd", "double"], "example": "05_gradcheck.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"double\">梯度檢查：有限差分、double與不可微邊界</h1>\n<p>用第二種計算方式發現符號、分母或圖被切斷的錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"loss\">不只看loss是否下降</h2>\n<p>錯的梯度也可能在小步長偶然降低loss。有限差分直接對輸入小幅正負擾動，近似導數；與解析／Autograd梯度一致，提供另一種證據。只適合小張量與可控制函數，不是每個大型訓練step都做。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w_j}\\approx\\frac{L(w+\\epsilon e_j)-L(w-\\epsilon e_j)}{2\\epsilon}\n$$</div>\n<p>epsilon過大有截斷誤差，過小有浮點相減誤差；double通常更適合此檢查，不能把float16的差分結果當可靠基準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">可微條件與隨機性</h2>\n<p>ReLU折點、max相等分支與硬threshold不適合用平滑導數期待核對。Dropout或隨機採樣若每次變，數值差分可能在比較不同函數。固定隨機來源或關閉隨機分支，先用平滑確定性小例，再回原模型定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"logsumexp\">本章的logsumexp</h2>\n<p>logsumexp的解析梯度是softmax，能同時檢查穩定運算與向量梯度。第5例用torch.autograd.gradcheck，再手寫第一座標差分。沒有先exp大數再log，而用穩定的現成算子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">常見斷圖</h2>\n<p>item轉Python數字、detach、NumPy計算後重新torch.tensor，都可能讓值仍合理但失去原來依賴。對新Tensor設requires_grad不能把已斷的路接回去。先檢查is_leaf、grad_fn與loss是否連到目標參數，區分grad=None與正確零導數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>在第4例manual梯度忘除N，gradcheck式對照會差固定倍數；若只一層不同，沿chain rule找最早偏差。解答：先最小化問題、固定輸入、用double與合理容許值，不直接增加retain_graph或把全部參數requires_grad=True來掩蓋錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/05_gradcheck.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Double-precision finite differences for logsumexp.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.8</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">passed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">autograd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gradcheck</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">lambda</span> <span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logsumexp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">gradient</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">autograd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logsumexp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1e-6</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-=</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">finite_difference</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logsumexp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logsumexp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;gradcheck&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">passed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">gradient</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_coordinate_difference&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">gradient</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">finite_difference</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">())}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html\">Gradcheck mechanics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd mechanics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度檢查：有限差分、double與不可微邊界\n\n用第二種計算方式發現符號、分母或圖被切斷的錯誤。\n\n## 不只看loss是否下降\n\n錯的梯度也可能在小步長偶然降低loss。有限差分直接對輸入小幅正負擾動，近似導數；與解析／Autograd梯度一致，提供另一種證據。只適合小張量與可控制函數，不是每個大型訓練step都做。\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w_j}\\approx\\frac{L(w+\\epsilon e_j)-L(w-\\epsilon e_j)}{2\\epsilon}\n$$\n\nepsilon過大有截斷誤差，過小有浮點相減誤差；double通常更適合此檢查，不能把float16的差分結果當可靠基準。\n\n## 可微條件與隨機性\n\nReLU折點、max相等分支與硬threshold不適合用平滑導數期待核對。Dropout或隨機採樣若每次變，數值差分可能在比較不同函數。固定隨機來源或關閉隨機分支，先用平滑確定性小例，再回原模型定位。\n\n## 本章的logsumexp\n\nlogsumexp的解析梯度是softmax，能同時檢查穩定運算與向量梯度。第5例用torch.autograd.gradcheck，再手寫第一座標差分。沒有先exp大數再log，而用穩定的現成算子。\n\n## 常見斷圖\n\nitem轉Python數字、detach、NumPy計算後重新torch.tensor，都可能讓值仍合理但失去原來依賴。對新Tensor設requires_grad不能把已斷的路接回去。先檢查is_leaf、grad_fn與loss是否連到目標參數，區分grad=None與正確零導數。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n在第4例manual梯度忘除N，gradcheck式對照會差固定倍數；若只一層不同，沿chain rule找最早偏差。解答：先最小化問題、固定輸入、用double與合理容許值，不直接增加retain_graph或把全部參數requires_grad=True來掩蓋錯誤。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/05_gradcheck.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Double-precision finite differences for logsumexp.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.tensor([.2,-.4,.8],dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True)\n    passed=torch.autograd.gradcheck(lambda v:torch.logsumexp(v,0),(x,))\n    gradient=torch.autograd.grad(torch.logsumexp(x,0),x)[0]\n    epsilon=1e-6\n    plus=x.detach().clone();minus=x.detach().clone();plus[0]+=epsilon;minus[0]-=epsilon\n    finite_difference=(torch.logsumexp(plus,0)-torch.logsumexp(minus,0))/(2*epsilon)\n    result={'gradcheck':passed,'gradient':gradient,'first_coordinate_difference':abs(gradient[0].item()-finite_difference.item())}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Gradcheck mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html)\n- [Autograd mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "double", "name": "梯度檢查：有限差分、double與不可微邊界", "html": "梯度檢查：有限差分、double與不可微邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "loss", "name": "不只看loss是否下降", "html": "不只看loss是否下降", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "可微條件與隨機性", "html": "可微條件與隨機性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "logsumexp", "name": "本章的logsumexp", "html": "本章的logsumexp", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "常見斷圖", "html": "常見斷圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "12-activations", "group": "networks", "title": "Activation：Sigmoid、Tanh、ReLU、GELU與梯度", "summary": "比較函數值、飽和區與導數，理解選擇對表示及最佳化的影響。", "tags": ["sigmoid", "tanh", "ReLU", "GELU", "SiLU"], "example": "06_activations.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"activationsigmoidtanhrelugelu\">Activation：Sigmoid、Tanh、ReLU、GELU與梯度</h1>\n<p>比較函數值、飽和區與導數，理解選擇對表示及最佳化的影響。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">非線性也改變梯度</h2>\n<p>Sigmoid輸出0..1、導數最高.25；Tanh輸出-1..1、中心附近導數較大；兩者大絕對值區都可能飽和。ReLU保留正值，負區輸出0且局部導數0。它們沒有哪個在所有任務都最佳，要配合初始化、深度與架構。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\sigma&#x27;(x)=\\sigma(x)(1-\\sigma(x)),\\qquad\n\\tanh&#x27;(x)=1-\\tanh^2(x)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"reludead-unit\">ReLU邊界與dead unit</h2>\n<p>0點不可微，框架採某個subgradient約定；PyTorch在0給0。若某單元長期在負區，這條路可能沒有梯度，稱dead ReLU的常見現象。LeakyReLU保留負斜率是候選解法，但也改函數族與尺度，不保證修復資料或步長問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">平滑選項</h2>\n<p>GELU為xΦ(x)，SiLU為xσ(x)，負區仍可能有平滑反應。GELU可有近似實作，本課預設F.gelu的確切設定。模型中間activation與最後輸出activation要分清：分類CE接受raw logits，不在最後再加GELU或softmax當固定模板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">觀察值與導數</h2>\n<p>第6例在[-3,-1,0,1,3]比較四種函數與Autograd導數。sigmoid在0為.25、GELU在0為.5、ReLU在0為0，可直接核對。不要只看曲線範圍，還要看多層連乘後梯度如何傳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>連續20層sigmoid是否必然梯度等於.25²⁰？答案：不是，還乘weights與不同activation導數；這只是局部導數上界的一部分直覺。第23章會用精確標量鏈展示乘積，再說明不能直接代替所有矩陣網路定律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/06_activations.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Activation values and derivatives at fixed inputs.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">activation</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sigmoid&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sigmoid</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tanh&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tanh</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relu&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relu</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;gelu&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gelu</span><span class=\"p\">)]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">activation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;values&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;derivatives&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#non-linear-activations-weighted-sum-nonlinearity\">Activation functions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.functional.html\">Functional activation</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Activation：Sigmoid、Tanh、ReLU、GELU與梯度\n\n比較函數值、飽和區與導數，理解選擇對表示及最佳化的影響。\n\n## 非線性也改變梯度\n\nSigmoid輸出0..1、導數最高.25；Tanh輸出-1..1、中心附近導數較大；兩者大絕對值區都可能飽和。ReLU保留正值，負區輸出0且局部導數0。它們沒有哪個在所有任務都最佳，要配合初始化、深度與架構。\n\n$$\n\\sigma'(x)=\\sigma(x)(1-\\sigma(x)),\\qquad\n\\tanh'(x)=1-\\tanh^2(x)\n$$\n\n## ReLU邊界與dead unit\n\n0點不可微，框架採某個subgradient約定；PyTorch在0給0。若某單元長期在負區，這條路可能沒有梯度，稱dead ReLU的常見現象。LeakyReLU保留負斜率是候選解法，但也改函數族與尺度，不保證修復資料或步長問題。\n\n## 平滑選項\n\nGELU為xΦ(x)，SiLU為xσ(x)，負區仍可能有平滑反應。GELU可有近似實作，本課預設F.gelu的確切設定。模型中間activation與最後輸出activation要分清：分類CE接受raw logits，不在最後再加GELU或softmax當固定模板。\n\n## 觀察值與導數\n\n第6例在[-3,-1,0,1,3]比較四種函數與Autograd導數。sigmoid在0為.25、GELU在0為.5、ReLU在0為0，可直接核對。不要只看曲線範圍，還要看多層連乘後梯度如何傳。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n連續20層sigmoid是否必然梯度等於.25²⁰？答案：不是，還乘weights與不同activation導數；這只是局部導數上界的一部分直覺。第23章會用精確標量鏈展示乘積，再說明不能直接代替所有矩陣網路定律。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/06_activations.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Activation values and derivatives at fixed inputs.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result={}\n    for name,activation in [('sigmoid',torch.sigmoid),('tanh',torch.tanh),('relu',F.relu),('gelu',F.gelu)]:\n        x=torch.tensor([-3.,-1.,0.,1.,3.],requires_grad=True)\n        output=activation(x);output.sum().backward()\n        result[name]={'values':output,'derivatives':x.grad}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Activation functions](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#non-linear-activations-weighted-sum-nonlinearity)\n- [Functional activation](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.functional.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "activationsigmoidtanhrelugelu", "name": "Activation：Sigmoid、Tanh、ReLU、GELU與梯度", "html": "Activation：Sigmoid、Tanh、ReLU、GELU與梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "非線性也改變梯度", "html": "非線性也改變梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "reludead-unit", "name": "ReLU邊界與dead unit", "html": "ReLU邊界與dead unit", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "平滑選項", "html": "平滑選項", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "觀察值與導數", "html": "觀察值與導數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "13-regression-loss", "group": "objectives", "title": "回歸損失：MSE、MAE與Huber的梯度偏好", "summary": "將相同殘差送入不同目標，觀察大誤差受到多少懲罰。", "tags": ["MSE", "MAE", "Huber", "SmoothL1", "regression"], "example": "07_regression_losses.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"msemaehuber\">回歸損失：MSE、MAE與Huber的梯度偏好</h1>\n<p>將相同殘差送入不同目標，觀察大誤差受到多少懲罰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">殘差與單位</h2>\n<p>e=prediction-target，MSE平均平方、MAE平均絕對值。MSE的梯度隨誤差變大，MAE除了零點約定外為符號。目標單位、尺度與outlier來源都會影響選擇，不能只說一個loss永遠較穩健。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_{MSE}=\\frac1N\\sum_i e_i^2,\\qquad L_{MAE}=\\frac1N\\sum_i|e_i|\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"huber\">Huber的折衷</h2>\n<p>小殘差用平方，大殘差用線性增長，delta控制切換尺度。delta也有target單位，資料改單位需重新考慮。SmoothL1與Huber在某些參數下有縮放關係，不把API不同名稱當完全相同公式。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\ell_\\delta(e)=\\begin{cases}\\frac12e^2,&amp;|e|\\le\\delta\\\\\\delta(|e|-\\frac12\\delta),&amp;|e|&gt;\\delta\\end{cases}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">手算同一批</h2>\n<p>pred=[0,2,5]、target=[1,2,3]，殘差[-1,0,2]。MSE=5/3，MAE=1，Huber(delta1)=2/3。第7例同時輸出每個prediction的梯度，核對mean分母。大錯誤會在不同目標中有不同更新影響。</p>\n<h2 id=\"loss\">Loss與評估指標</h2>\n<p>用Huber訓練仍可報MAE、RMSE與signed residual。只報train loss無法判斷未見表現；若target有log變換，最後仍需在原單位評估。權重、missing target或多輸出會改reduction分母，先定義契約再算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把全部target與prediction乘100，MAE乘100、MSE乘10000；Huber若delta不變，部分樣本會跨分段，不能只說乘固定倍數。解答：loss、梯度、學習率與單位要一起考慮。若pred[N,1]對target[N]，先修shape，不用換loss掩蓋廣播錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/07_regression_losses.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;MSE, MAE and Huber on the same residuals.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">criterion</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mse&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mse_loss</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mae&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">l1_loss</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;huber&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">huber_loss</span><span class=\"p\">)]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">criterion</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions\">Regression loss functions</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 回歸損失：MSE、MAE與Huber的梯度偏好\n\n將相同殘差送入不同目標，觀察大誤差受到多少懲罰。\n\n## 殘差與單位\n\ne=prediction-target，MSE平均平方、MAE平均絕對值。MSE的梯度隨誤差變大，MAE除了零點約定外為符號。目標單位、尺度與outlier來源都會影響選擇，不能只說一個loss永遠較穩健。\n\n$$\nL_{MSE}=\\frac1N\\sum_i e_i^2,\\qquad L_{MAE}=\\frac1N\\sum_i|e_i|\n$$\n\n## Huber的折衷\n\n小殘差用平方，大殘差用線性增長，delta控制切換尺度。delta也有target單位，資料改單位需重新考慮。SmoothL1與Huber在某些參數下有縮放關係，不把API不同名稱當完全相同公式。\n\n$$\n\\ell_\\delta(e)=\\begin{cases}\\frac12e^2,&|e|\\le\\delta\\\\\\delta(|e|-\\frac12\\delta),&|e|>\\delta\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n## 手算同一批\n\npred=[0,2,5]、target=[1,2,3]，殘差[-1,0,2]。MSE=5/3，MAE=1，Huber(delta1)=2/3。第7例同時輸出每個prediction的梯度，核對mean分母。大錯誤會在不同目標中有不同更新影響。\n\n## Loss與評估指標\n\n用Huber訓練仍可報MAE、RMSE與signed residual。只報train loss無法判斷未見表現；若target有log變換，最後仍需在原單位評估。權重、missing target或多輸出會改reduction分母，先定義契約再算。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把全部target與prediction乘100，MAE乘100、MSE乘10000；Huber若delta不變，部分樣本會跨分段，不能只說乘固定倍數。解答：loss、梯度、學習率與單位要一起考慮。若pred[N,1]對target[N]，先修shape，不用換loss掩蓋廣播錯誤。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/07_regression_losses.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"MSE, MAE and Huber on the same residuals.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    target=torch.tensor([1.,2.,3.]);result={}\n    for name,criterion in [('mse',F.mse_loss),('mae',F.l1_loss),('huber',F.huber_loss)]:\n        prediction=torch.tensor([0.,2.,5.],requires_grad=True)\n        loss=criterion(prediction,target);loss.backward()\n        result[name]={'loss':loss.item(),'gradient':prediction.grad}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Regression loss functions](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "msemaehuber", "name": "回歸損失：MSE、MAE與Huber的梯度偏好", "html": "回歸損失：MSE、MAE與Huber的梯度偏好", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "殘差與單位", "html": "殘差與單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "huber", "name": "Huber的折衷", "html": "Huber的折衷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "手算同一批", "html": "手算同一批", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "loss", "name": "Loss與評估指標", "html": "Loss與評估指標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "14-classification-loss", "group": "objectives", "title": "分類損失：Logits、BCE、Softmax CE與加權分母", "summary": "分清單選與多標籤的資料格式，再推導正確輸出梯度。", "tags": ["BCEWithLogitsLoss", "CrossEntropyLoss", "logits", "reduction"], "example": "08_classification_losses.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"logitsbcesoftmax-ce\">分類損失：Logits、BCE、Softmax CE與加權分母</h1>\n<p>分清單選與多標籤的資料格式，再推導正確輸出梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">單選與多標籤</h2>\n<p>多類單選logits[N,C]配long target[N]；二元可用logits[N,1]配float target[N,1]與BCEWithLogits；多標籤兩者[N,C]、每欄可同時成立。不要把每個task一律做softmax，因為多標籤不要求各欄機率合計1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">不先手寫不穩定機率</h2>\n<p>CE與BCEWithLogits結合必要的穩定log運算。先softmax再CE會改輸入含義；先sigmoid再BCEWithLogits也重複轉換。推論只取argmax時不用先softmax；若需要機率，再轉換並檢查校準。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log\\frac{e^{z_{i,y_i}}}{\\sum_c e^{z_{i,c}}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_{i,c}}=\\frac{p_{i,c}-1[c=y_i]}{N}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"reduction\">正確的reduction</h2>\n<p>未加權、每樣本一項時mean除N。class weight的索引目標CE則按target對應weights合計作分母，並非一律除N；token mask又按有效位置與規則處理。範例10以weights[1,3]實際核對，避免梯度累積或日誌權重出錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"soft-targetlabel-smoothing\">Soft target與label smoothing</h2>\n<p>soft target可描述mixup或平滑標籤，但需要合法分布與相同[N,C]契約；框架不替你證明人造目標合理。label smoothing可限制極端信心，同時改訓練目標，不能拿來代替真實label品質檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>二元單輸出[N,1]若argmax(dim1)，永遠回0，因為只有一欄；應依logit0或sigmoid門檻判斷。對單選兩欄則argmax可用。解答：先寫明輸出含義、shape、dtype及reduction，再讓loss與metric一致，不能只以程式未報錯驗收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/08_classification_losses.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Logits-based CE/BCE and the exact softmax CE gradient.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">softmax_gradient</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">softmax_gradient</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">binary_logits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">binary_targets</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;cross_entropy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">softmax</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_gradient_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;bce_with_logits&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binary_cross_entropy_with_logits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">binary_logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_targets</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html\">CrossEntropyLoss</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions\">BCE與其他loss</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 分類損失：Logits、BCE、Softmax CE與加權分母\n\n分清單選與多標籤的資料格式，再推導正確輸出梯度。\n\n## 單選與多標籤\n\n多類單選logits[N,C]配long target[N]；二元可用logits[N,1]配float target[N,1]與BCEWithLogits；多標籤兩者[N,C]、每欄可同時成立。不要把每個task一律做softmax，因為多標籤不要求各欄機率合計1。\n\n## 不先手寫不穩定機率\n\nCE與BCEWithLogits結合必要的穩定log運算。先softmax再CE會改輸入含義；先sigmoid再BCEWithLogits也重複轉換。推論只取argmax時不用先softmax；若需要機率，再轉換並檢查校準。\n\n$$\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log\\frac{e^{z_{i,y_i}}}{\\sum_c e^{z_{i,c}}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial z_{i,c}}=\\frac{p_{i,c}-1[c=y_i]}{N}\n$$\n\n## 正確的reduction\n\n未加權、每樣本一項時mean除N。class weight的索引目標CE則按target對應weights合計作分母，並非一律除N；token mask又按有效位置與規則處理。範例10以weights[1,3]實際核對，避免梯度累積或日誌權重出錯。\n\n## Soft target與label smoothing\n\nsoft target可描述mixup或平滑標籤，但需要合法分布與相同[N,C]契約；框架不替你證明人造目標合理。label smoothing可限制極端信心，同時改訓練目標，不能拿來代替真實label品質檢查。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n二元單輸出[N,1]若argmax(dim1)，永遠回0，因為只有一欄；應依logit0或sigmoid門檻判斷。對單選兩欄則argmax可用。解答：先寫明輸出含義、shape、dtype及reduction，再讓loss與metric一致，不能只以程式未報錯驗收。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/08_classification_losses.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Logits-based CE/BCE and the exact softmax CE gradient.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import softmax_gradient\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    logits=torch.tensor([[2.,0.,-1.],[-1.,0.,2.]],requires_grad=True)\n    labels=torch.tensor([0,2]);loss=F.cross_entropy(logits,labels);loss.backward()\n    manual=softmax_gradient(logits.detach(),labels)\n    binary_logits=torch.tensor([[2.],[-1.]])\n    binary_targets=torch.tensor([[1.],[0.]])\n    result={'cross_entropy':loss.item(),'probabilities':logits.softmax(1),\n            'maximum_gradient_error':(manual-logits.grad).abs().max().item(),\n            'bce_with_logits':F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(binary_logits,binary_targets).item()}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [CrossEntropyLoss](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html)\n- [BCE與其他loss](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "logitsbcesoftmax-ce", "name": "分類損失：Logits、BCE、Softmax CE與加權分母", "html": "分類損失：Logits、BCE、Softmax CE與加權分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "單選與多標籤", "html": "單選與多標籤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "不先手寫不穩定機率", "html": "不先手寫不穩定機率", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "reduction", "name": "正確的reduction", "html": "正確的reduction", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "soft-targetlabel-smoothing", "name": "Soft target與label smoothing", "html": "Soft target與label smoothing", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "15-data-boundaries", "group": "objectives", "title": "資料與前處理：深度模型也需要訓練邊界", "summary": "把標籤時間、群組、標準化與增強的角色納入完整資料設計。", "tags": ["data split", "leakage", "preprocessing", "train validation test"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">資料與前處理：深度模型也需要訓練邊界</h1>\n<p>把標籤時間、群組、標準化與增強的角色納入完整資料設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先定義未見的是什麼</h2>\n<p>隨機樣本、全新用戶、未來時間與新來源有不同評估需求。深度網路能記住細節，更需要避免同文件切塊、同原圖增強版或同人紀錄跨split。切分在資料來源與label定義之後，在fit前處理及隨機增強之前。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本課可知答案的資料</h2>\n<p>表格480筆四個feature，target依x0×x1+.25x2-.1x3是否正生成；shuffle後288train、96val、96test。mean／population std只fit train，套同一規則到其餘。影像及序列是另外生成與切分，沒有暗中下載真實資料。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mu_j=\\frac1{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,j},\\qquad\n\\tilde x_{i,j}=\\frac{x_{i,j}-\\mu_j}{\\max(\\sigma_j,\\epsilon)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">不同階段的轉換</h2>\n<p>train可有符合label不變性的隨機增強；val/test通常固定，以免指標加入不可控隨機性。驗證不能各自重新fit scaler來讓平均0。預訓練模型還有固定tokenizer／影像前處理契約，使用時一併保存與版本化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">樣本支援與分布</h2>\n<p>固定比例不是普遍規則，稀有事件需確認各集合有足夠正例。時間標籤未成熟者不能直接當負例；高維特徵可包含答案捷徑，需檢查可用時間。合成資料獨立切分能驗證流程，不能自動代表現實分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">樣本的單位決定切分的單位</h2>\n<p>如果同一使用者有很多序列，按「列」隨機切分可能讓同一人同時出現在train和test；模型可能學身分訊號，分數卻被誤讀為對新使用者的效果。若要預測未來，時間順序與特徵可取得的時間也要保留。split不是只有三個比例，而是對部署時會遇到什麼資料做假設。合成範例彼此獨立只是教學簡化，不是所有資料的通用切分方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>train均值接近0是否證明沒洩漏？答案：不足，還要比保存mean是否確實只由train算、group／time是否合理、特徵有無未來資訊。測試套件會核對split交集與train統計；真實專案仍要加入自己的來源與域值規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">Dataset與DataLoader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">資料洩漏背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料與前處理：深度模型也需要訓練邊界\n\n把標籤時間、群組、標準化與增強的角色納入完整資料設計。\n\n## 先定義未見的是什麼\n\n隨機樣本、全新用戶、未來時間與新來源有不同評估需求。深度網路能記住細節，更需要避免同文件切塊、同原圖增強版或同人紀錄跨split。切分在資料來源與label定義之後，在fit前處理及隨機增強之前。\n\n## 本課可知答案的資料\n\n表格480筆四個feature，target依x0×x1+.25x2-.1x3是否正生成；shuffle後288train、96val、96test。mean／population std只fit train，套同一規則到其餘。影像及序列是另外生成與切分，沒有暗中下載真實資料。\n\n$$\n\\mu_j=\\frac1{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,j},\\qquad\n\\tilde x_{i,j}=\\frac{x_{i,j}-\\mu_j}{\\max(\\sigma_j,\\epsilon)}\n$$\n\n## 不同階段的轉換\n\ntrain可有符合label不變性的隨機增強；val/test通常固定，以免指標加入不可控隨機性。驗證不能各自重新fit scaler來讓平均0。預訓練模型還有固定tokenizer／影像前處理契約，使用時一併保存與版本化。\n\n## 樣本支援與分布\n\n固定比例不是普遍規則，稀有事件需確認各集合有足夠正例。時間標籤未成熟者不能直接當負例；高維特徵可包含答案捷徑，需檢查可用時間。合成資料獨立切分能驗證流程，不能自動代表現實分布。\n\n## 樣本的單位決定切分的單位\n\n如果同一使用者有很多序列，按「列」隨機切分可能讓同一人同時出現在train和test；模型可能學身分訊號，分數卻被誤讀為對新使用者的效果。若要預測未來，時間順序與特徵可取得的時間也要保留。split不是只有三個比例，而是對部署時會遇到什麼資料做假設。合成範例彼此獨立只是教學簡化，不是所有資料的通用切分方法。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ntrain均值接近0是否證明沒洩漏？答案：不足，還要比保存mean是否確實只由train算、group／time是否合理、特徵有無未來資訊。測試套件會核對split交集與train統計；真實專案仍要加入自己的來源與域值規則。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Dataset與DataLoader](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [資料洩漏背景](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "資料與前處理：深度模型也需要訓練邊界", "html": "資料與前處理：深度模型也需要訓練邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先定義未見的是什麼", "html": "先定義未見的是什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本課可知答案的資料", "html": "本課可知答案的資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "不同階段的轉換", "html": "不同階段的轉換", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "樣本支援與分布", "html": "樣本支援與分布", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "樣本的單位決定切分的單位", "html": "樣本的單位決定切分的單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "16-training-evaluation", "group": "objectives", "title": "訓練與評估的角色：梯度、模式與選模", "summary": "先讓每個step做正確的事，再讓validation與test回答不同問題。", "tags": ["train loop", "eval", "inference_mode", "metrics"], "example": "09_training_loop.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">訓練與評估的角色：梯度、模式與選模</h1>\n<p>先讓每個step做正確的事，再讓validation與test回答不同問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一次更新的生命週期</h2>\n<p>model.train設定模組行為；zero_grad清緩衝；forward計算logits；loss.backward累積導數；optimizer.step更新參數。它們彼此不互相代辦。每批日誌使用detach後Python值，避免容器長期保留計算圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">未加權分類的整輪平均</h2>\n<p>batch mean需乘該批實際筆數，再除總筆數。尾批較小，不能直接平均batch means；accuracy同樣累加correct與count。若class weight或token loss，改用符合該目標的分母，不直接套每樣本契約。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\bar L=\\frac{\\sum_b n_b\\bar L_b}{\\sum_b n_b}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"autograd\">模式與Autograd是兩個開關</h2>\n<p>eval關閉Dropout及調整BatchNorm等行為，不自動關梯度；no_grad／inference_mode控制記錄，不自動eval。驗證通常同時使用eval與不記錄區塊。core.evaluate會還原原本整體模式；刻意混合子模組模式時需更細緻管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"validationfinal-test\">Validation選擇與final test</h2>\n<p>本課每輪看val loss，clone最佳weights，結束才用該模型評估test。保存best_state不是直接留state_dict的live引用，需detach、CPU、clone。調架構、early stopping或threshold都屬選擇，不能再說同一份test從未參與開發。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實作與診斷</h2>\n<p>第9例在非線性表格任務走6輪，印train／val；test仍保留。先核對loss有限、grad存在、step後weights變、samples符合預期，再看是否泛化。GPU、AMP與多程序可連回PyTorch工程課，先保持CPU基準清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>batch大小4與2，mean loss1與3，整體是(4+6)/6=1.6667，而不是2。eval後忘記train，後續Dropout不再隨機，可能改變學習方案。解答：train_epoch入口明確train，evaluate用try/finally，並測模式與grad沒有意外改動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/09_training_loop.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A genuine CPU train/validation loop on a nonlinear synthetic target.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">train_epoch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tabular&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">loaders</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.02</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">history</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">epoch</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">training</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_epoch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">history</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;epoch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">epoch</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">training</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">)})</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;history&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">history</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;synthetic data; test reserved&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd模式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html\">Optimization入門</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 訓練與評估的角色：梯度、模式與選模\n\n先讓每個step做正確的事，再讓validation與test回答不同問題。\n\n## 一次更新的生命週期\n\nmodel.train設定模組行為；zero_grad清緩衝；forward計算logits；loss.backward累積導數；optimizer.step更新參數。它們彼此不互相代辦。每批日誌使用detach後Python值，避免容器長期保留計算圖。\n\n## 未加權分類的整輪平均\n\nbatch mean需乘該批實際筆數，再除總筆數。尾批較小，不能直接平均batch means；accuracy同樣累加correct與count。若class weight或token loss，改用符合該目標的分母，不直接套每樣本契約。\n\n$$\n\\bar L=\\frac{\\sum_b n_b\\bar L_b}{\\sum_b n_b}\n$$\n\n## 模式與Autograd是兩個開關\n\neval關閉Dropout及調整BatchNorm等行為，不自動關梯度；no_grad／inference_mode控制記錄，不自動eval。驗證通常同時使用eval與不記錄區塊。core.evaluate會還原原本整體模式；刻意混合子模組模式時需更細緻管理。\n\n## Validation選擇與final test\n\n本課每輪看val loss，clone最佳weights，結束才用該模型評估test。保存best_state不是直接留state_dict的live引用，需detach、CPU、clone。調架構、early stopping或threshold都屬選擇，不能再說同一份test從未參與開發。\n\n## 實作與診斷\n\n第9例在非線性表格任務走6輪，印train／val；test仍保留。先核對loss有限、grad存在、step後weights變、samples符合預期，再看是否泛化。GPU、AMP與多程序可連回PyTorch工程課，先保持CPU基準清楚。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nbatch大小4與2，mean loss1與3，整體是(4+6)/6=1.6667，而不是2。eval後忘記train，後續Dropout不再隨機，可能改變學習方案。解答：train_epoch入口明確train，evaluate用try/finally，並測模式與grad沒有意外改動。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/09_training_loop.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A genuine CPU train/validation loop on a nonlinear synthetic target.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import MLP,make_loaders,train_epoch,evaluate\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    loaders,_=make_loaders('tabular');train,validation,_=loaders\n    model=MLP();optimizer=torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(),lr=.02)\n    initial=evaluate(model,validation);history=[]\n    for epoch in range(6):\n        training=train_epoch(model,train,optimizer)\n        history.append({'epoch':epoch+1,'training':training,'validation':evaluate(model,validation)})\n    result={'initial_validation':initial,'history':history,'scope':'synthetic data; test reserved'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd模式](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [Optimization入門](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "訓練與評估的角色：梯度、模式與選模", "html": "訓練與評估的角色：梯度、模式與選模", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一次更新的生命週期", "html": "一次更新的生命週期", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "未加權分類的整輪平均", "html": "未加權分類的整輪平均", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "autograd", "name": "模式與Autograd是兩個開關", "html": "模式與Autograd是兩個開關", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "validationfinal-test", "name": "Validation選擇與final test", "html": "Validation選擇與final test", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實作與診斷", "html": "實作與診斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "17-labels", "group": "objectives", "title": "標籤、權重與不平衡：訊號品質先於網路大小", "summary": "檢查答案來源，再明確推導加權目標與決策成本。", "tags": ["label quality", "class weight", "imbalance", "weighted loss"], "example": "10_imbalance.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">標籤、權重與不平衡：訊號品質先於網路大小</h1>\n<p>檢查答案來源，再明確推導加權目標與決策成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">標籤不是完美真理</h2>\n<p>人工標註可能歧異、事件追蹤可能未成熟、資料蒐集可能只看部分人。高容量網路可學到錯標或蒐集捷徑，更多epochs不會自動修正。保存label定義、時間與不確定性，必要時人工抽查與版本化修標，不只修模型剛好猜錯的樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">不平衡的三個不同選擇</h2>\n<p>class weights改loss，抽樣改訓練樣本分布，threshold改固定模型的決策。它們影響不同部分。使用weighted loss後機率不一定直接對應現實先驗，需要校準／評估；提高recall不是只挑一個參數就保證成本合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ce\">加權CE的分母</h2>\n<p>labels[0,0,0,1]、weights[1,3]時，mean weighted CE按3×1+1×3=6除，不是4。第10例回傳逐樣本weighted loss與sum/6，對照官方實際結果。若做gradient accumulation，群組分母也應是對應weights合計。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL=\\frac{\\sum_i w_{y_i}\\,[-\\log p_{i,y_i}]}{\\sum_i w_{y_i}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">抽樣與評估分布</h2>\n<p>只在train或每fold train抽樣，不能先複製少數樣本再分train/val。評估保留符合部署的分布與group/time；報每類support、precision/recall、機率品質與成本，不只整體accuracy。極少正例的估計不確定性需揭露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>如果一類完全沒有train樣本，設超大weight不能創造缺少訊號。解答：先檢查label與資料代表性、增加合適樣本或調整問題，不能用更深模型補不存在的資訊。若更改FP/FN成本，可以先在獨立validation調門檻；不要反覆以test挑最好的設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/10_imbalance.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Weighted CE normalizes by target weights, not the unweighted row count.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">per_row</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">reduction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;none&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">per_row</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weighted_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;manual_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;denominator&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;class weighting changes the training objective, not just the decision threshold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html\">Weighted CrossEntropy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html\">決策門檻背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 標籤、權重與不平衡：訊號品質先於網路大小\n\n檢查答案來源，再明確推導加權目標與決策成本。\n\n## 標籤不是完美真理\n\n人工標註可能歧異、事件追蹤可能未成熟、資料蒐集可能只看部分人。高容量網路可學到錯標或蒐集捷徑，更多epochs不會自動修正。保存label定義、時間與不確定性，必要時人工抽查與版本化修標，不只修模型剛好猜錯的樣本。\n\n## 不平衡的三個不同選擇\n\nclass weights改loss，抽樣改訓練樣本分布，threshold改固定模型的決策。它們影響不同部分。使用weighted loss後機率不一定直接對應現實先驗，需要校準／評估；提高recall不是只挑一個參數就保證成本合理。\n\n## 加權CE的分母\n\nlabels[0,0,0,1]、weights[1,3]時，mean weighted CE按3×1+1×3=6除，不是4。第10例回傳逐樣本weighted loss與sum/6，對照官方實際結果。若做gradient accumulation，群組分母也應是對應weights合計。\n\n$$\nL=\\frac{\\sum_i w_{y_i}\\,[-\\log p_{i,y_i}]}{\\sum_i w_{y_i}}\n$$\n\n## 抽樣與評估分布\n\n只在train或每fold train抽樣，不能先複製少數樣本再分train/val。評估保留符合部署的分布與group/time；報每類support、precision/recall、機率品質與成本，不只整體accuracy。極少正例的估計不確定性需揭露。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n如果一類完全沒有train樣本，設超大weight不能創造缺少訊號。解答：先檢查label與資料代表性、增加合適樣本或調整問題，不能用更深模型補不存在的資訊。若更改FP/FN成本，可以先在獨立validation調門檻；不要反覆以test挑最好的設定。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/10_imbalance.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Weighted CE normalizes by target weights, not the unweighted row count.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    logits=torch.tensor([[2.,0.],[1.,0.],[0.,1.],[0.,2.]])\n    labels=torch.tensor([0,0,0,1]);weight=torch.tensor([1.,3.])\n    per_row=F.cross_entropy(logits,labels,weight=weight,reduction='none')\n    actual=F.cross_entropy(logits,labels,weight=weight)\n    manual=per_row.sum()/weight[labels].sum()\n    result={'weighted_loss':actual,'manual_loss':manual,'denominator':weight[labels].sum(),\n            'note':'class weighting changes the training objective, not just the decision threshold'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Weighted CrossEntropy](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html)\n- [決策門檻背景](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "標籤、權重與不平衡：訊號品質先於網路大小", "html": "標籤、權重與不平衡：訊號品質先於網路大小", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "標籤不是完美真理", "html": "標籤不是完美真理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "不平衡的三個不同選擇", "html": "不平衡的三個不同選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "ce", "name": "加權CE的分母", "html": "加權CE的分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "抽樣與評估分布", "html": "抽樣與評估分布", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "18-capacity", "group": "objectives", "title": "容量、深度與可學性：能表示不等於能學到", "summary": "區分函數族的可能性、最佳化結果與未見資料表現。", "tags": ["capacity", "universal approximation", "inductive bias", "generalization"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">容量、深度與可學性：能表示不等於能學到</h1>\n<p>區分函數族的可能性、最佳化結果與未見資料表現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">三個不同問題</h2>\n<p>架構能否表示目標？optimizer能否在資料與預算中找到？找到後是否泛化到未見分布？普遍逼近等理論在特定條件下描述表示存在性，不保證有限樣本、任意初始化與固定步數能找到好解。不能把存在定理當訓練保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">深度與寬度</h2>\n<p>加寬可增加可用特徵，加深可重用多層組合；某些函數以組合結構較有效，但深度也增加梯度與最佳化難度。參數數量與表示能力不是單調等價的一個數字，同樣參數預算的不同結構可能有不同偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"inductive-bias\">Inductive bias</h2>\n<p>CNN利用局部與權重共享，RNN用時間遞迴，Attention用內容相依加權。這些是對問題的結構假設，不是誰永遠取代誰。若資料與假設不合，模型可以很大但仍需要更多訊號或不同表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">資料量與有效複雜度</h2>\n<p>同一網路在不同資料、augmentation、正則化與訓練時間下，會有不同泛化。深度模型在過參數區也可能有複雜現象，不能只靠「參數大於樣本一定失敗」或「更大永遠更好」兩句話推論。以固定切分與受控實驗比較，報支持量與變異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">實務選擇</h2>\n<p>先有dummy、簡單線性／樹或直接規則基準；神經模型若增加成本，說明換來什麼。序列專題的label是last token&gt;=5，直接規則已完美，GRU用來教序列運算，不能因此宣稱它是較好解法。這個誠實基準有助分辨教學與生產主張。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">用控制實驗分清楚原因</h2>\n<p>假設增加寬度後train loss沒變，不能直接說「容量足夠」。先確認更新真的發生、學習率合理且訓練步數足夠；也可在同一乾淨小批次檢查能否擬合。若train明顯下降、validation反而變差，再研究泛化、資料量與正則化。反過來，特徵中根本沒有決定標籤的訊息，再大的網路也只能記住訓練資料的偶然關係。把可表達、可找到及可泛化三件事分開，才能讓下一次實驗有明確方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>train loss一直很高，是否一定容量不足？答案：也可能loss契約、資料、初始化、步長或梯度斷路。train近0而val差，是否一定只需Dropout？答案：先查split／分布與label，再比較正則化或較簡單模型。下篇用具體最佳化與梯度實驗逐一拆解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html\">Deep feedforward表示</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html\">學習與泛化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 容量、深度與可學性：能表示不等於能學到\n\n區分函數族的可能性、最佳化結果與未見資料表現。\n\n## 三個不同問題\n\n架構能否表示目標？optimizer能否在資料與預算中找到？找到後是否泛化到未見分布？普遍逼近等理論在特定條件下描述表示存在性，不保證有限樣本、任意初始化與固定步數能找到好解。不能把存在定理當訓練保證。\n\n## 深度與寬度\n\n加寬可增加可用特徵，加深可重用多層組合；某些函數以組合結構較有效，但深度也增加梯度與最佳化難度。參數數量與表示能力不是單調等價的一個數字，同樣參數預算的不同結構可能有不同偏好。\n\n## Inductive bias\n\nCNN利用局部與權重共享，RNN用時間遞迴，Attention用內容相依加權。這些是對問題的結構假設，不是誰永遠取代誰。若資料與假設不合，模型可以很大但仍需要更多訊號或不同表示。\n\n## 資料量與有效複雜度\n\n同一網路在不同資料、augmentation、正則化與訓練時間下，會有不同泛化。深度模型在過參數區也可能有複雜現象，不能只靠「參數大於樣本一定失敗」或「更大永遠更好」兩句話推論。以固定切分與受控實驗比較，報支持量與變異。\n\n## 實務選擇\n\n先有dummy、簡單線性／樹或直接規則基準；神經模型若增加成本，說明換來什麼。序列專題的label是last token>=5，直接規則已完美，GRU用來教序列運算，不能因此宣稱它是較好解法。這個誠實基準有助分辨教學與生產主張。\n\n## 用控制實驗分清楚原因\n\n假設增加寬度後train loss沒變，不能直接說「容量足夠」。先確認更新真的發生、學習率合理且訓練步數足夠；也可在同一乾淨小批次檢查能否擬合。若train明顯下降、validation反而變差，再研究泛化、資料量與正則化。反過來，特徵中根本沒有決定標籤的訊息，再大的網路也只能記住訓練資料的偶然關係。把可表達、可找到及可泛化三件事分開，才能讓下一次實驗有明確方向。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ntrain loss一直很高，是否一定容量不足？答案：也可能loss契約、資料、初始化、步長或梯度斷路。train近0而val差，是否一定只需Dropout？答案：先查split／分布與label，再比較正則化或較簡單模型。下篇用具體最佳化與梯度實驗逐一拆解。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Deep feedforward表示](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/mlp.html)\n- [學習與泛化](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "容量、深度與可學性：能表示不等於能學到", "html": "容量、深度與可學性：能表示不等於能學到", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "三個不同問題", "html": "三個不同問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "深度與寬度", "html": "深度與寬度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "inductive-bias", "name": "Inductive bias", "html": "Inductive bias", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "資料量與有效複雜度", "html": "資料量與有效複雜度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "實務選擇", "html": "實務選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "用控制實驗分清楚原因", "html": "用控制實驗分清楚原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "19-sgd-momentum", "group": "optimization", "title": "SGD與Momentum：沿梯度走，還要記住方向", "summary": "以同一個二次函數追蹤更新，理解batch雜訊與動量狀態。", "tags": ["SGD", "momentum", "optimization", "learning rate"], "example": "11_sgd_momentum.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"sgdmomentum\">SGD與Momentum：沿梯度走，還要記住方向</h1>\n<p>以同一個二次函數追蹤更新，理解batch雜訊與動量狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">更新規則的起點</h2>\n<p>SGD用當前batch估計梯度，沿負方向走。不同batch帶來雜訊，可能有助探索也可能使收斂不穩；它不是保證逃離所有壞解的魔法。full-batch、mini-batch與單筆SGD是資料估計粒度，與網路架構是不同選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\ng_t=\\nabla_\\theta L_B(\\theta_t),\\qquad\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta g_t\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"momentum\">Momentum累積方向</h2>\n<p>簡化形式v_t=μv_(t-1)+g_t，θ更新減ηv_t。它在方向一致時累積、震盪方向時可能抵消，但也會過衝。PyTorch其他選項如dampening與Nesterov有額外語意，本章固定最基本momentum=.9，先對照可手算結果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nv_t=\\mu v_{t-1}+g_t,\\qquad\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta v_t\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">三步手算</h2>\n<p>L=w²，w0=1，lr=.1。無動量依序.8、.64、.512；μ=.9時第一步.8，第二步g=1.6、v=3.4，w=.46，第三步v=.9×3.4+.92=3.98，w=.062。例子印step前梯度與step後權重，避免時間點混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">雜訊、尺度與收斂</h2>\n<p>同lr在sum／mean loss、不同batch與特徵尺度下不一定相同。Momentum有歷史狀態，續訓只載weights會改軌跡。比較optimizer需固定資料、預算與調參方式，不從一次玩具曲線宣稱任何方法普遍更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若目前g=0，momentum buffer非零，weight仍可能移動。解答：zero_grad只清新梯度緩衝，不清optimizer內的動量；想重新開始需明確重建或重設相應狀態。訓練突然發散先查lr、資料與grad，再決定是否改optimizer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/11_sgd_momentum.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Trace scalar SGD and momentum updates on w squared.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">momentum</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.9</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parameter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">gradient</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;gradient_before_step&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">gradient</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weight_after_step&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()})</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html\">Optimizer API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/optimization.html\">深度模型最佳化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# SGD與Momentum：沿梯度走，還要記住方向\n\n以同一個二次函數追蹤更新，理解batch雜訊與動量狀態。\n\n## 更新規則的起點\n\nSGD用當前batch估計梯度，沿負方向走。不同batch帶來雜訊，可能有助探索也可能使收斂不穩；它不是保證逃離所有壞解的魔法。full-batch、mini-batch與單筆SGD是資料估計粒度，與網路架構是不同選擇。\n\n$$\ng_t=\\nabla_\\theta L_B(\\theta_t),\\qquad\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta g_t\n$$\n\n## Momentum累積方向\n\n簡化形式v_t=μv_(t-1)+g_t，θ更新減ηv_t。它在方向一致時累積、震盪方向時可能抵消，但也會過衝。PyTorch其他選項如dampening與Nesterov有額外語意，本章固定最基本momentum=.9，先對照可手算結果。\n\n$$\nv_t=\\mu v_{t-1}+g_t,\\qquad\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta v_t\n$$\n\n## 三步手算\n\nL=w²，w0=1，lr=.1。無動量依序.8、.64、.512；μ=.9時第一步.8，第二步g=1.6、v=3.4，w=.46，第三步v=.9×3.4+.92=3.98，w=.062。例子印step前梯度與step後權重，避免時間點混淆。\n\n## 雜訊、尺度與收斂\n\n同lr在sum／mean loss、不同batch與特徵尺度下不一定相同。Momentum有歷史狀態，續訓只載weights會改軌跡。比較optimizer需固定資料、預算與調參方式，不從一次玩具曲線宣稱任何方法普遍更好。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若目前g=0，momentum buffer非零，weight仍可能移動。解答：zero_grad只清新梯度緩衝，不清optimizer內的動量；想重新開始需明確重建或重設相應狀態。訓練突然發散先查lr、資料與grad，再決定是否改optimizer。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/11_sgd_momentum.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Trace scalar SGD and momentum updates on w squared.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result={}\n    for momentum in [0.,.9]:\n        w=nn.Parameter(torch.tensor(1.));optimizer=torch.optim.SGD([w],lr=.1,momentum=momentum)\n        rows=[]\n        for _ in range(3):\n            optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True);loss=w.square();loss.backward()\n            gradient=w.grad.item();optimizer.step()\n            rows.append({'gradient_before_step':gradient,'weight_after_step':w.item()})\n        result[str(momentum)]=rows\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Optimizer API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html)\n- [深度模型最佳化](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/optimization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "sgdmomentum", "name": "SGD與Momentum：沿梯度走，還要記住方向", "html": "SGD與Momentum：沿梯度走，還要記住方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "更新規則的起點", "html": "更新規則的起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "momentum", "name": "Momentum累積方向", "html": "Momentum累積方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "三步手算", "html": "三步手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "雜訊、尺度與收斂", "html": "雜訊、尺度與收斂", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "20-adamw", "group": "optimization", "title": "Adam與AdamW：自適應尺度與解耦衰減", "summary": "理解一階、二階估計與weight decay，避免把不同更新混稱L2。", "tags": ["Adam", "AdamW", "weight decay", "bias correction"], "example": "12_adamw.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"adamadamw\">Adam與AdamW：自適應尺度與解耦衰減</h1>\n<p>理解一階、二階估計與weight decay，避免把不同更新混稱L2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">平滑梯度與平方梯度</h2>\n<p>Adam維護m與v的指數移動估計，再做bias correction，用每個座標的尺度調整更新。它不是直接把learning rate改成所有參數相同的新值；各座標歷史不同。epsilon避免分母過小，也有數值作用，不是可以無條件忽略的裝飾。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nm_t=\\beta_1m_{t-1}+(1-\\beta_1)g_t,\\quad\nv_t=\\beta_2v_{t-1}+(1-\\beta_2)g_t^2\n$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta\\frac{\\hat m_t}{\\sqrt{\\hat v_t}+\\epsilon}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">偏差校正如何手算</h2>\n<p>初始m與v為0，第一步會偏向0。校正使用m̂_t=m_t/(1−β₁ᵗ)、v̂_t=v_t/(1−β₂ᵗ)。例如第一步g=2、β₁=.9、β₂=.999，m=.2、v=.004；校正後m̂=2、v̂=4。在忽略epsilon的簡化下，該座標資料梯度更新量約為lr，而不是2lr。這並不表示Adam永遠只看符號，後續歷史會改變兩個估計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"adamwdecay\">為什麼AdamW分開decay</h2>\n<p>將λθ加進gradient會經過自適應縮放；解耦decay則在更新中直接對weight收縮。一般SGD的某些形式可對應L2，但Adam下兩者不等價。選API時記錄Adam／AdamW及decay規則，不只寫「用了Adam加正則化」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=(1-\\eta\\lambda)\\theta_t\n-\\eta\\frac{\\hat m_t}{\\sqrt{\\hat v_t}+\\epsilon}\n$$</div>\n<p>此為解耦衰減的概念式，g不含L2懲罰梯度；若有參數群組或不同步長，分別依各群設定。比較舊程式時也要確認Adam是否明確啟用其他decay選項，本課第12例採其L2型預設與AdamW比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可手算的零資料梯度</h2>\n<p>w=2、lr=.1、AdamW decay=.2、當前資料grad=0時，解耦項使w變2×(1-.02)=1.96。第12例同時列Adam以L2型weight_decay的第一步，結果不同。若grad為None，optimizer是否跳過該參數也需按API理解，不把None與零Tensor混為一談。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">參數分組與續訓</h2>\n<p>bias、norm參數是否decay依訓練方案決定；常見排除策略不是所有模型必然正確。恢復訓練需要optimizer狀態，推論產物不必含它。本課生成與監督例子使用明確固定小預算，不以同lr比較一次就替所有任務選贏家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把AdamW換Adam並保留weight_decay，是否只改名字？答案：更新語意可改，重新跑數值與驗證。若模型效果變了，也可能是調參預算與schedule不合，需受控比較。第60章會再討論為何壓縮／蒸餾也需固定完整學習流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/12_adamw.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Compare decoupled decay with Adam L2 at a zero data gradient.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">kind</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;Adam&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Adam</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;AdamW&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">)]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parameter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">kind</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">weight_decay</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros_like</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weight_after_zero_data_gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n                      <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;nonzero weight decay can move weights despite a zero data gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980\">Adam原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101\">AdamW原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html\">Torch optim</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Adam與AdamW：自適應尺度與解耦衰減\n\n理解一階、二階估計與weight decay，避免把不同更新混稱L2。\n\n## 平滑梯度與平方梯度\n\nAdam維護m與v的指數移動估計，再做bias correction，用每個座標的尺度調整更新。它不是直接把learning rate改成所有參數相同的新值；各座標歷史不同。epsilon避免分母過小，也有數值作用，不是可以無條件忽略的裝飾。\n\n$$\nm_t=\\beta_1m_{t-1}+(1-\\beta_1)g_t,\\quad\nv_t=\\beta_2v_{t-1}+(1-\\beta_2)g_t^2\n$$\n\n$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta\\frac{\\hat m_t}{\\sqrt{\\hat v_t}+\\epsilon}\n$$\n\n## 偏差校正如何手算\n\n初始m與v為0，第一步會偏向0。校正使用m̂_t=m_t/(1−β₁ᵗ)、v̂_t=v_t/(1−β₂ᵗ)。例如第一步g=2、β₁=.9、β₂=.999，m=.2、v=.004；校正後m̂=2、v̂=4。在忽略epsilon的簡化下，該座標資料梯度更新量約為lr，而不是2lr。這並不表示Adam永遠只看符號，後續歷史會改變兩個估計。\n\n## 為什麼AdamW分開decay\n\n將λθ加進gradient會經過自適應縮放；解耦decay則在更新中直接對weight收縮。一般SGD的某些形式可對應L2，但Adam下兩者不等價。選API時記錄Adam／AdamW及decay規則，不只寫「用了Adam加正則化」。\n\n$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=(1-\\eta\\lambda)\\theta_t\n-\\eta\\frac{\\hat m_t}{\\sqrt{\\hat v_t}+\\epsilon}\n$$\n\n此為解耦衰減的概念式，g不含L2懲罰梯度；若有參數群組或不同步長，分別依各群設定。比較舊程式時也要確認Adam是否明確啟用其他decay選項，本課第12例採其L2型預設與AdamW比較。\n\n## 可手算的零資料梯度\n\nw=2、lr=.1、AdamW decay=.2、當前資料grad=0時，解耦項使w變2×(1-.02)=1.96。第12例同時列Adam以L2型weight_decay的第一步，結果不同。若grad為None，optimizer是否跳過該參數也需按API理解，不把None與零Tensor混為一談。\n\n## 參數分組與續訓\n\nbias、norm參數是否decay依訓練方案決定；常見排除策略不是所有模型必然正確。恢復訓練需要optimizer狀態，推論產物不必含它。本課生成與監督例子使用明確固定小預算，不以同lr比較一次就替所有任務選贏家。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把AdamW換Adam並保留weight_decay，是否只改名字？答案：更新語意可改，重新跑數值與驗證。若模型效果變了，也可能是調參預算與schedule不合，需受控比較。第60章會再討論為何壓縮／蒸餾也需固定完整學習流程。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/12_adamw.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Compare decoupled decay with Adam L2 at a zero data gradient.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result={}\n    for name,kind in [('Adam',torch.optim.Adam),('AdamW',torch.optim.AdamW)]:\n        w=nn.Parameter(torch.tensor(2.));optimizer=kind([w],lr=.1,weight_decay=.2)\n        w.grad=torch.zeros_like(w);optimizer.step()\n        result[name]={'weight_after_zero_data_gradient':w.item(),\n                      'note':'nonzero weight decay can move weights despite a zero data gradient'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Adam原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980)\n- [AdamW原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101)\n- [Torch optim](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "adamadamw", "name": "Adam與AdamW：自適應尺度與解耦衰減", "html": "Adam與AdamW：自適應尺度與解耦衰減", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "平滑梯度與平方梯度", "html": "平滑梯度與平方梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "偏差校正如何手算", "html": "偏差校正如何手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "adamwdecay", "name": "為什麼AdamW分開decay", "html": "為什麼AdamW分開decay", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可手算的零資料梯度", "html": "可手算的零資料梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "參數分組與續訓", "html": "參數分組與續訓", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "21-schedules", "group": "optimization", "title": "學習率與排程：warmup、下降、early stopping", "summary": "先決定更新的時間單位，再設計能比較的訓練預算。", "tags": ["scheduler", "warmup", "cosine", "early stopping"], "example": "13_schedules.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"warmupearly-stopping\">學習率與排程：warmup、下降、early stopping</h1>\n<p>先決定更新的時間單位，再設計能比較的訓練預算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">步長影響探索與收斂</h2>\n<p>較大lr可以較快改參數，也可能震盪或破壞表示；較小lr可能穩但很慢。warmup逐步提高lr，常用於某些大模型配置，但不是所有小模型都需；cosine、step或plateau各有不同觸發邏輯。先問它想解決哪個問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stepbatchepoch\">step是batch還是epoch</h2>\n<p>StepLR的step_size與呼叫scheduler.step的頻率一起決定含義。若原本每epoch一次卻改成每batch，下降快很多。一般先optimizer.step，再scheduler.step；ReduceLROnPlateau依完成的validation指標呼叫。AMP跳過更新時還要處理與有效step對應的排程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"trace\">本章五輪trace</h2>\n<p>SGD lr=.1，StepLR每2輪乘.5，實際使用lr為[.1,.1,.05,.05,.025]。第13例印當輪用的lr及更新後weight，避免把下一輪lr當本輪。這個小例不等於推薦所有模型使用此排程，只驗證時間與狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"early-stopping\">Early stopping也是選擇</h2>\n<p>設定validation loss、min_delta、patience；改善時保存獨立best快照，結束回載再test。不能在看到test後決定停哪一輪。本課完整supervised實驗保存val最低weights，固定epochs完成後才評估test，沒有宣稱推論artifact可精確接續訓練。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">預算與比較</h2>\n<p>比較模型要記epochs、optimizer updates、處理樣本／tokens與時間。batch大小改變使每epoch更新數改變，因此「都20epoch」不一定同更新預算。更大資料也使epoch含義改變，不能直接拿同lr schedule無條件搬用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>訓練100批／epoch，scheduler每batch走一次，而T_max原設100epoch，會發生什麼？答案：單位錯配，週期在很少epoch完成。將lr曲線與global_step記錄，先在短程檢查，再跑長訓練。排程只能調整步長，不能修正錯標與斷圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/13_schedules.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Learning-rate schedules run after optimizer updates.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parameter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">scheduler</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lr_scheduler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">StepLR</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">step_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">gamma</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">epoch</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">used_lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">param_groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">scheduler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;epoch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">epoch</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr_used&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">used_lr</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weight&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()})</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;trace&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html#how-to-adjust-learning-rate\">Learning-rate scheduling</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 學習率與排程：warmup、下降、early stopping\n\n先決定更新的時間單位，再設計能比較的訓練預算。\n\n## 步長影響探索與收斂\n\n較大lr可以較快改參數，也可能震盪或破壞表示；較小lr可能穩但很慢。warmup逐步提高lr，常用於某些大模型配置，但不是所有小模型都需；cosine、step或plateau各有不同觸發邏輯。先問它想解決哪個問題。\n\n## step是batch還是epoch\n\nStepLR的step_size與呼叫scheduler.step的頻率一起決定含義。若原本每epoch一次卻改成每batch，下降快很多。一般先optimizer.step，再scheduler.step；ReduceLROnPlateau依完成的validation指標呼叫。AMP跳過更新時還要處理與有效step對應的排程。\n\n## 本章五輪trace\n\nSGD lr=.1，StepLR每2輪乘.5，實際使用lr為[.1,.1,.05,.05,.025]。第13例印當輪用的lr及更新後weight，避免把下一輪lr當本輪。這個小例不等於推薦所有模型使用此排程，只驗證時間與狀態。\n\n## Early stopping也是選擇\n\n設定validation loss、min_delta、patience；改善時保存獨立best快照，結束回載再test。不能在看到test後決定停哪一輪。本課完整supervised實驗保存val最低weights，固定epochs完成後才評估test，沒有宣稱推論artifact可精確接續訓練。\n\n## 預算與比較\n\n比較模型要記epochs、optimizer updates、處理樣本／tokens與時間。batch大小改變使每epoch更新數改變，因此「都20epoch」不一定同更新預算。更大資料也使epoch含義改變，不能直接拿同lr schedule無條件搬用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n訓練100批／epoch，scheduler每batch走一次，而T_max原設100epoch，會發生什麼？答案：單位錯配，週期在很少epoch完成。將lr曲線與global_step記錄，先在短程檢查，再跑長訓練。排程只能調整步長，不能修正錯標與斷圖。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/13_schedules.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Learning-rate schedules run after optimizer updates.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    w=nn.Parameter(torch.tensor(2.));optimizer=torch.optim.SGD([w],lr=.1)\n    scheduler=torch.optim.lr_scheduler.StepLR(optimizer,step_size=2,gamma=.5)\n    rows=[]\n    for epoch in range(5):\n        used_lr=optimizer.param_groups[0]['lr']\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True);w.square().backward();optimizer.step();scheduler.step()\n        rows.append({'epoch':epoch+1,'lr_used':used_lr,'weight':w.item()})\n    result={'trace':rows}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Learning-rate scheduling](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html#how-to-adjust-learning-rate)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "warmupearly-stopping", "name": "學習率與排程：warmup、下降、early stopping", "html": "學習率與排程：warmup、下降、early stopping", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "步長影響探索與收斂", "html": "步長影響探索與收斂", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "stepbatchepoch", "name": "step是batch還是epoch", "html": "step是batch還是epoch", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "trace", "name": "本章五輪trace", "html": "本章五輪trace", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "early-stopping", "name": "Early stopping也是選擇", "html": "Early stopping也是選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "預算與比較", "html": "預算與比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "22-initialization", "group": "optimization", "title": "初始化：對稱性、Xavier、He與訊號尺度", "summary": "以second moment核對ReLU初始化，而非將所有方差近似混為一談。", "tags": ["initialization", "Xavier", "He", "fan_in", "variance"], "example": "14_initialization.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"xavierhe\">初始化：對稱性、Xavier、He與訊號尺度</h1>\n<p>以second moment核對ReLU初始化，而非將所有方差近似混為一談。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼不能全部一樣</h2>\n<p>同層神經元若weights與bias完全相同，forward相同、反向訊號相同，容易持續學相同特徵。隨機初始化打破對稱性，尺度又決定activation與梯度是否快速放大或縮小。不是亂數越大越能學。</p>\n<h2 id=\"xavierhe_1\">Xavier與He的假設</h2>\n<p>Xavier考慮fan_in／fan_out平衡，常連到近似對稱activation的訊號；He針對ReLU類正區保留的比例推導尺度。這些是在獨立、分布等近似假設下的設計原則，不是任何深度與資料都精確維持方差。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathrm{Var}(W)\\approx\\frac{2}{\\mathrm{fan}_{in}+\\mathrm{fan}_{out}}\\quad\\text{(Xavier)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}(W)\\approx\\frac{2}{\\mathrm{fan}_{in}}\\quad\\text{(He)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"second-momentvariance\">Second moment與variance</h2>\n<p>ReLU輸出有正均值，E[h²]與Var(h)=E[h²]-E[h]²不同。He常見訊號分析需明確指出在維持哪項近似。第14例用128fan-in與1024個隨機樣本，列weight variance、input／ReLU second moment及中心化variance，預期ReLU second moment約1而variance較小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api\">API方向與模型結構</h2>\n<p>nn.init.kaiming_normal_的mode、nonlinearity與實際運算布局要對應。nn.Linear的weight[out,in]與手工W[in,out]不同，對手工矩陣直接套init時需查fan定義。bias常用零是可行起點，但不代表weights全零也一樣可行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將所有weights標準差乘10，深層activation可能迅速爆大；除以10可能訊號消失。解答：記錄每層activation mean／second moment與grad norm，固定資料比較初始化，而不只看最後loss是否有限。初始化、norm與residual互相影響，下一章繼續看梯度鏈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/14_initialization.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;He initialization preserves a ReLU second moment approximately.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">128</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">128</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">init</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kaiming_normal_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mode</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fan_in&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">nonlinearity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relu&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1024</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">128</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relu</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weight_variance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">unbiased</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;input_second_moment&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;relu_second_moment&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;relu_centered_variance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">unbiased</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;second moment and centered variance differ because ReLU has a positive mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v9/glorot10a.html\">Xavier原始研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.01852\">He initialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.init.html\">Torch init</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 初始化：對稱性、Xavier、He與訊號尺度\n\n以second moment核對ReLU初始化，而非將所有方差近似混為一談。\n\n## 為什麼不能全部一樣\n\n同層神經元若weights與bias完全相同，forward相同、反向訊號相同，容易持續學相同特徵。隨機初始化打破對稱性，尺度又決定activation與梯度是否快速放大或縮小。不是亂數越大越能學。\n\n## Xavier與He的假設\n\nXavier考慮fan_in／fan_out平衡，常連到近似對稱activation的訊號；He針對ReLU類正區保留的比例推導尺度。這些是在獨立、分布等近似假設下的設計原則，不是任何深度與資料都精確維持方差。\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Var}(W)\\approx\\frac{2}{\\mathrm{fan}_{in}+\\mathrm{fan}_{out}}\\quad\\text{(Xavier)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}(W)\\approx\\frac{2}{\\mathrm{fan}_{in}}\\quad\\text{(He)}\n$$\n\n## Second moment與variance\n\nReLU輸出有正均值，E[h²]與Var(h)=E[h²]-E[h]²不同。He常見訊號分析需明確指出在維持哪項近似。第14例用128fan-in與1024個隨機樣本，列weight variance、input／ReLU second moment及中心化variance，預期ReLU second moment約1而variance較小。\n\n## API方向與模型結構\n\nnn.init.kaiming_normal_的mode、nonlinearity與實際運算布局要對應。nn.Linear的weight[out,in]與手工W[in,out]不同，對手工矩陣直接套init時需查fan定義。bias常用零是可行起點，但不代表weights全零也一樣可行。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將所有weights標準差乘10，深層activation可能迅速爆大；除以10可能訊號消失。解答：記錄每層activation mean／second moment與grad norm，固定資料比較初始化，而不只看最後loss是否有限。初始化、norm與residual互相影響，下一章繼續看梯度鏈。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/14_initialization.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"He initialization preserves a ReLU second moment approximately.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    layer=nn.Linear(128,128,bias=False)\n    nn.init.kaiming_normal_(layer.weight,mode='fan_in',nonlinearity='relu')\n    x=torch.randn(1024,128)\n    with torch.no_grad():y=F.relu(layer(x))\n    result={'weight_variance':layer.weight.var(unbiased=False),'input_second_moment':x.square().mean(),\n            'relu_second_moment':y.square().mean(),'relu_centered_variance':y.var(unbiased=False),\n            'note':'second moment and centered variance differ because ReLU has a positive mean'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Xavier原始研究](https://proceedings.mlr.press/v9/glorot10a.html)\n- [He initialization](https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.01852)\n- [Torch init](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.init.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "xavierhe", "name": "初始化：對稱性、Xavier、He與訊號尺度", "html": "初始化：對稱性、Xavier、He與訊號尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼不能全部一樣", "html": "為什麼不能全部一樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "xavierhe_1", "name": "Xavier與He的假設", "html": "Xavier與He的假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "second-momentvariance", "name": "Second moment與variance", "html": "Second moment與variance", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "API方向與模型結構", "html": "API方向與模型結構", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "23-gradient-flow", "group": "optimization", "title": "梯度消失與爆炸：長鏈、Jacobian與殘差路徑", "summary": "先看精確標量乘積，再理解它對矩陣深網路提供的直覺。", "tags": ["vanishing gradients", "exploding gradients", "Jacobian", "residual"], "example": "15_gradient_flow.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"jacobian\">梯度消失與爆炸：長鏈、Jacobian與殘差路徑</h1>\n<p>先看精確標量乘積，再理解它對矩陣深網路提供的直覺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">導數連乘的結果</h2>\n<p>y=a^Lx時dy/dx=a^L。a=.5、L20約9.54e-7；a=1.5、L20約3325。第15例以double真實反向，對照解析乘積。它只是一條標量線性鏈，不將這個單數字當所有深網路的通用公式。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\partial h_L}{\\partial h_0}=J_LJ_{L-1}\\cdots J_1\n$$</div>\n<p>矩陣乘積依方向與奇異值傳訊號，不只各元素平均；activation飽和、weight尺度與深度都影響。即使總norm看似正常，也可能部分方向已失去訊號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">如何觀察</h2>\n<p>每層activation分布、grad norm、零梯度比例與step前後參數差。grad=None先查路徑沒使用、斷圖或未反向；grad=0可能是正確局部導數。不能只將兩者都稱為「梯度消失」。追最早異常層，比在最後loss看到NaN才改lr更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常見對策的角色</h2>\n<p>初始化改善初始尺度，activation選擇減少某些飽和，normalization控制部分統計，residual提供額外直接路，gated recurrent結構提供受控記憶。它們不是完全相同的修復；clipping控制大norm更新，不能創造不存在的梯度訊號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">輸入與目標也會影響</h2>\n<p>異常特徵尺度、極大target、錯誤loss縮放或不穩定exp／log都能造成爆炸。先回到小batch、FP32與eager，檢查finite；不要一開始就將所有grad任意clamp到很小數而不理解原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>residual h_next=h+F(h)的Jacobian為I+J_F，當J_F近零仍有identity路徑；但若J_F在某方向約-I，也可能抵消，不能說residual保證永遠不消失。解答：用結構直覺產生假設，再由具體梯度與訓練實驗驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/15_gradient_flow.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Exact derivatives through scalar linear chains, not a universal network law.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">factor</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">):</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">factor</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">factor</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;depth&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;derivative&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;analytic&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">factor</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v9/glorot10a.html\">訊號傳遞與初始化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385\">Residual networks</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度消失與爆炸：長鏈、Jacobian與殘差路徑\n\n先看精確標量乘積，再理解它對矩陣深網路提供的直覺。\n\n## 導數連乘的結果\n\ny=a^Lx時dy/dx=a^L。a=.5、L20約9.54e-7；a=1.5、L20約3325。第15例以double真實反向，對照解析乘積。它只是一條標量線性鏈，不將這個單數字當所有深網路的通用公式。\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial h_L}{\\partial h_0}=J_LJ_{L-1}\\cdots J_1\n$$\n\n矩陣乘積依方向與奇異值傳訊號，不只各元素平均；activation飽和、weight尺度與深度都影響。即使總norm看似正常，也可能部分方向已失去訊號。\n\n## 如何觀察\n\n每層activation分布、grad norm、零梯度比例與step前後參數差。grad=None先查路徑沒使用、斷圖或未反向；grad=0可能是正確局部導數。不能只將兩者都稱為「梯度消失」。追最早異常層，比在最後loss看到NaN才改lr更有效。\n\n## 常見對策的角色\n\n初始化改善初始尺度，activation選擇減少某些飽和，normalization控制部分統計，residual提供額外直接路，gated recurrent結構提供受控記憶。它們不是完全相同的修復；clipping控制大norm更新，不能創造不存在的梯度訊號。\n\n## 輸入與目標也會影響\n\n異常特徵尺度、極大target、錯誤loss縮放或不穩定exp／log都能造成爆炸。先回到小batch、FP32與eager，檢查finite；不要一開始就將所有grad任意clamp到很小數而不理解原因。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nresidual h_next=h+F(h)的Jacobian為I+J_F，當J_F近零仍有identity路徑；但若J_F在某方向約-I，也可能抵消，不能說residual保證永遠不消失。解答：用結構直覺產生假設，再由具體梯度與訓練實驗驗證。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/15_gradient_flow.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Exact derivatives through scalar linear chains, not a universal network law.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result={}\n    for factor in [.5,1.,1.5]:\n        x=torch.tensor(1.,dtype=torch.double,requires_grad=True);y=x\n        for _ in range(20):y=factor*y\n        y.backward()\n        result[str(factor)]={'depth':20,'derivative':x.grad.item(),'analytic':factor**20}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [訊號傳遞與初始化](https://proceedings.mlr.press/v9/glorot10a.html)\n- [Residual networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "jacobian", "name": "梯度消失與爆炸：長鏈、Jacobian與殘差路徑", "html": "梯度消失與爆炸：長鏈、Jacobian與殘差路徑", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "導數連乘的結果", "html": "導數連乘的結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "如何觀察", "html": "如何觀察", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常見對策的角色", "html": "常見對策的角色", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "輸入與目標也會影響", "html": "輸入與目標也會影響", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "24-gradient-control", "group": "optimization", "title": "梯度裁切、累積與精度：先維持目標再控制更新", "summary": "以不等長microbatch驗證有效batch的加權，並理解AMP順序。", "tags": ["clipping", "gradient accumulation", "AMP", "numerical stability"], "example": "16_clipping_accumulation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">梯度裁切、累積與精度：先維持目標再控制更新</h1>\n<p>以不等長microbatch驗證有效batch的加權，並理解AMP順序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">裁切控制哪一項</h2>\n<p>global norm clipping在梯度norm超過上限時，整組按比例縮小，通常保持該向量方向；逐元素clip則是另一種操作。對[3,4]的norm5，裁到1得到約[.6,.8]。它限制這次梯度，不自動修好無效輸入、NaN或過大的optimizer歷史狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">累積需正確分母</h2>\n<p>10筆拆4/4/2，先對每批loss sum除整組10，再逐批backward、最後step一次，才對應同參數位置的大batch mean梯度。每批mean除固定3會放大尾2筆權重。若每批都step，則參數位置已變，是不同演算法。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\nabla L_{group}=\\sum_b\\frac{n_b}{\\sum_jn_j}\\nabla\\bar L_b\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">等價的條件</h2>\n<p>本章用同一Linear、相同SGD比較更新，浮點順序容許誤差內一致。BatchNorm批次統計、Dropout隨機、class weights、token mask與不同rank分母都可能需要額外設計，不能把此等價無條件外推到任何網路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"amp\">AMP的數學位置</h2>\n<p>loss scaling先放大反向訊號，再還原grad；clipping需在unscale之後。有效累積群組內scale保持一致，完整群組才step／update。使用目前torch.amp.GradScaler與torch.autocast，GPU路徑需另測，這門課CPU證據不宣稱混合精度性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">數值實作與工程銜接</h2>\n<p>第16例實測norm裁切與4/4/2更新差。大型記憶體、device搬移、AMP與DDP實作細節可讀PyTorch工程課；這裡先證明loss縮放與更新含義一致。只看loss下降不足以抓出錯的尾批權重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>11筆、micro4、每兩批更新一次，兩組分母為8與3，不是每組固定8。解答：記錄實際有效樣本／token權重和；若最後一組不足，仍要完成一次正確更新或明確採drop政策。任何性能優化都先維持數值與資料覆蓋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/16_clipping_accumulation.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Clipping norm and sample-weighted microbatch equivalence.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">copy</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parameter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">utils</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clip_grad_norm_</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">other</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">deepcopy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">other</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">end</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)]:</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">other</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">reduction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sum&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pre_clip_norm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;clipped_gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_update_difference&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">q</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">other</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html\">AMP與梯度累積</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#utilities\">梯度工具</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度裁切、累積與精度：先維持目標再控制更新\n\n以不等長microbatch驗證有效batch的加權，並理解AMP順序。\n\n## 裁切控制哪一項\n\nglobal norm clipping在梯度norm超過上限時，整組按比例縮小，通常保持該向量方向；逐元素clip則是另一種操作。對[3,4]的norm5，裁到1得到約[.6,.8]。它限制這次梯度，不自動修好無效輸入、NaN或過大的optimizer歷史狀態。\n\n## 累積需正確分母\n\n10筆拆4/4/2，先對每批loss sum除整組10，再逐批backward、最後step一次，才對應同參數位置的大batch mean梯度。每批mean除固定3會放大尾2筆權重。若每批都step，則參數位置已變，是不同演算法。\n\n$$\n\\nabla L_{group}=\\sum_b\\frac{n_b}{\\sum_jn_j}\\nabla\\bar L_b\n$$\n\n## 等價的條件\n\n本章用同一Linear、相同SGD比較更新，浮點順序容許誤差內一致。BatchNorm批次統計、Dropout隨機、class weights、token mask與不同rank分母都可能需要額外設計，不能把此等價無條件外推到任何網路。\n\n## AMP的數學位置\n\nloss scaling先放大反向訊號，再還原grad；clipping需在unscale之後。有效累積群組內scale保持一致，完整群組才step／update。使用目前torch.amp.GradScaler與torch.autocast，GPU路徑需另測，這門課CPU證據不宣稱混合精度性能。\n\n## 數值實作與工程銜接\n\n第16例實測norm裁切與4/4/2更新差。大型記憶體、device搬移、AMP與DDP實作細節可讀PyTorch工程課；這裡先證明loss縮放與更新含義一致。只看loss下降不足以抓出錯的尾批權重。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n11筆、micro4、每兩批更新一次，兩組分母為8與3，不是每組固定8。解答：記錄實際有效樣本／token權重和；若最後一組不足，仍要完成一次正確更新或明確採drop政策。任何性能優化都先維持數值與資料覆蓋。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/16_clipping_accumulation.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Clipping norm and sample-weighted microbatch equivalence.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nimport copy\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    parameter=nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(2));parameter.grad=torch.tensor([3.,4.])\n    norm=torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_([parameter],1.)\n    model=nn.Linear(4,2);other=copy.deepcopy(model)\n    x=torch.randn(10,4);y=torch.arange(10)%2\n    a=torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(),lr=.1);b=torch.optim.SGD(other.parameters(),lr=.1)\n    F.cross_entropy(model(x),y).backward();a.step()\n    b.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    for start,end in [(0,4),(4,8),(8,10)]:\n        (F.cross_entropy(other(x[start:end]),y[start:end],reduction='sum')/10).backward()\n    b.step()\n    result={'pre_clip_norm':norm,'clipped_gradient':parameter.grad,\n            'maximum_update_difference':max((p-q).abs().max().item() for p,q in zip(model.parameters(),other.parameters()))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [AMP與梯度累積](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html)\n- [梯度工具](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#utilities)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "梯度裁切、累積與精度：先維持目標再控制更新", "html": "梯度裁切、累積與精度：先維持目標再控制更新", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "裁切控制哪一項", "html": "裁切控制哪一項", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "累積需正確分母", "html": "累積需正確分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "等價的條件", "html": "等價的條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "amp", "name": "AMP的數學位置", "html": "AMP的數學位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "數值實作與工程銜接", "html": "數值實作與工程銜接", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "25-generalization", "group": "regularization", "title": "過擬合與泛化：資料、容量與最佳化共同決定", "summary": "用訓練與驗證曲線提出假設，避免把單一現象簡化成固定解法。", "tags": ["generalization", "overfitting", "bias variance", "learning curves"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">過擬合與泛化：資料、容量與最佳化共同決定</h1>\n<p>用訓練與驗證曲線提出假設，避免把單一現象簡化成固定解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"train\">Train好不是終點</h2>\n<p>train loss低、val差，可能記住雜訊、資料少、來源偏移或切分不符合部署。train與val都差，可能容量、特徵、目標、label或optimizer問題。先確認資料邊界與數值流程，再根據證據改架構或正則化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">偏差與變異是理解工具</h2>\n<p>在特定平方誤差假設下，可將預測誤差連到bias²、variance與noise；一次train-val差不是直接量到數學variance。網路過參數、訓練時間與隱含偏好可能形成更複雜現象，不能只用參數大於樣本做二分判斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可以改變什麼</h2>\n<p>更具代表性的資料、正確增強、較簡單模型、L2／Dropout、early stopping、改善label、不同特徵。每項假設做受控比較；固定split與配對seed，記錄預算。若同時換資料、架構與lr，就難知道改善來自哪裡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">曲線與支持量</h2>\n<p>epoch曲線看更新進程，learning curve看資料量，validation curve看容量或超參數。至少列train／val、支持筆數、選模準則與多seed變異；稀有類可能被總平均掩蓋。對test反覆挑最漂亮一輪，會讓它變另一份validation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">現實分布是限制</h2>\n<p>相同分布holdout只能提供這個假設下證據；部署新群體、硬體影像或語言來源可能不同。高train與test都不能證明因果或任意外插。模型卡說明用途、資料時間與未驗證情境，讓使用者知道結果適用哪裡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">一個容易誤判的比較</h2>\n<p>設定A最佳validation為.20，設定B為.19，但B試了100組超參數而A只試2組。B較低可能同時包含更多搜尋對validation偶然波動的適應，不能只歸功於架構。比較時記錄搜尋預算，保留真正未參與決策的test；探索很多次之後，也可用巢狀評估或新保留資料估整個選擇程序。當validation樣本少，單一百分點尤其需要配合分母和跨seed結果解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將XOR四點複製100次，樣本筆數變400是否得到更多獨立資訊？答案：沒有，重複樣本仍同四個模式；若跨split會有樂觀評估。完整監督專題用獨立生成樣本，仍僅代表合成分布。比起多報小數位，先說清楚資料與評估問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html\">Regularization與泛化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html\">機器學習原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 過擬合與泛化：資料、容量與最佳化共同決定\n\n用訓練與驗證曲線提出假設，避免把單一現象簡化成固定解法。\n\n## Train好不是終點\n\ntrain loss低、val差，可能記住雜訊、資料少、來源偏移或切分不符合部署。train與val都差，可能容量、特徵、目標、label或optimizer問題。先確認資料邊界與數值流程，再根據證據改架構或正則化。\n\n## 偏差與變異是理解工具\n\n在特定平方誤差假設下，可將預測誤差連到bias²、variance與noise；一次train-val差不是直接量到數學variance。網路過參數、訓練時間與隱含偏好可能形成更複雜現象，不能只用參數大於樣本做二分判斷。\n\n## 可以改變什麼\n\n更具代表性的資料、正確增強、較簡單模型、L2／Dropout、early stopping、改善label、不同特徵。每項假設做受控比較；固定split與配對seed，記錄預算。若同時換資料、架構與lr，就難知道改善來自哪裡。\n\n## 曲線與支持量\n\nepoch曲線看更新進程，learning curve看資料量，validation curve看容量或超參數。至少列train／val、支持筆數、選模準則與多seed變異；稀有類可能被總平均掩蓋。對test反覆挑最漂亮一輪，會讓它變另一份validation。\n\n## 現實分布是限制\n\n相同分布holdout只能提供這個假設下證據；部署新群體、硬體影像或語言來源可能不同。高train與test都不能證明因果或任意外插。模型卡說明用途、資料時間與未驗證情境，讓使用者知道結果適用哪裡。\n\n## 一個容易誤判的比較\n\n設定A最佳validation為.20，設定B為.19，但B試了100組超參數而A只試2組。B較低可能同時包含更多搜尋對validation偶然波動的適應，不能只歸功於架構。比較時記錄搜尋預算，保留真正未參與決策的test；探索很多次之後，也可用巢狀評估或新保留資料估整個選擇程序。當validation樣本少，單一百分點尤其需要配合分母和跨seed結果解讀。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將XOR四點複製100次，樣本筆數變400是否得到更多獨立資訊？答案：沒有，重複樣本仍同四個模式；若跨split會有樂觀評估。完整監督專題用獨立生成樣本，仍僅代表合成分布。比起多報小數位，先說清楚資料與評估問題。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Regularization與泛化](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html)\n- [機器學習原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "過擬合與泛化：資料、容量與最佳化共同決定", "html": "過擬合與泛化：資料、容量與最佳化共同決定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "train", "name": "Train好不是終點", "html": "Train好不是終點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "偏差與變異是理解工具", "html": "偏差與變異是理解工具", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可以改變什麼", "html": "可以改變什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "曲線與支持量", "html": "曲線與支持量", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "現實分布是限制", "html": "現實分布是限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "一個容易誤判的比較", "html": "一個容易誤判的比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "26-weight-regularization", "group": "regularization", "title": "L1、L2與weight decay：限制哪一種複雜度", "summary": "從目標函數到實際更新，理解正則化尺度與參數分組。", "tags": ["L1", "L2", "weight decay", "regularization", "implicit bias"], "html": "<h1 id=\"l1l2weight-decay\">L1、L2與weight decay：限制哪一種複雜度</h1>\n<p>從目標函數到實際更新，理解正則化尺度與參數分組。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">在目標加入偏好</h2>\n<p>L2偏好較小係數，L1有促使部分係數零的幾何效果。它們限制特定參數化下的解，換一種等價重參數化不一定保留同樣懲罰。深網路有尺度對稱性與normalization，因此不能只用weight norm當普遍函數複雜度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_{total}=L_{data}+\\lambda\\frac12\\sum_k\\theta_k^2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\nabla L_{total}=\\nabla L_{data}+\\lambda\\theta\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"optimizer\">更新規則仍需看optimizer</h2>\n<p>對基本SGD，某些L2與decay形式可相連；Adam的自適應縮放則使加進grad的L2與AdamW解耦decay不同。第20章已用零資料梯度核對，不應在這裡又把所有weight_decay都叫一樣的L2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分母與超參數</h2>\n<p>loss使用mean或sum、資料量與累積方式會改data gradient相對懲罰強度。若每microbatch都加一次同樣λnorm，但整個群組只更新一次，可能重複算太多懲罰。先推整組目標，再寫實作；不能只複製一行penalty到每個迴圈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">哪些參數衰減</h2>\n<p>bias與norm affine是否decay可依方案設不同group，常見排除不是無條件規則。freeze參數、grad=None與optimizer參數清單也會影響是否更新。交付實驗記錄分組規則，否則兩個都寫AdamW的run仍可能有重要差異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">正則化不是資料清理</h2>\n<p>大weight不必是壞，少數pattern也不必是noise。先處理單位、label與切分；正則化無法修好洩漏或缺少代表性。透過train CV或val比較λ與任務指標，保留最後test，並觀察校準及子群錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>同一effective batch拆4批，若loss_data每批正確sum/N、L2卻每批都加λ/2||θ||²，最後grad懲罰變4倍。解答：整組只加一次，或按明確權重分配，讓總目標相同。這種推導比「看起來loss下降」更能防止實作漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html\">Regularization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101\">Decoupled decay</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# L1、L2與weight decay：限制哪一種複雜度\n\n從目標函數到實際更新，理解正則化尺度與參數分組。\n\n## 在目標加入偏好\n\nL2偏好較小係數，L1有促使部分係數零的幾何效果。它們限制特定參數化下的解，換一種等價重參數化不一定保留同樣懲罰。深網路有尺度對稱性與normalization，因此不能只用weight norm當普遍函數複雜度。\n\n$$\nL_{total}=L_{data}+\\lambda\\frac12\\sum_k\\theta_k^2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\nabla L_{total}=\\nabla L_{data}+\\lambda\\theta\n$$\n\n## 更新規則仍需看optimizer\n\n對基本SGD，某些L2與decay形式可相連；Adam的自適應縮放則使加進grad的L2與AdamW解耦decay不同。第20章已用零資料梯度核對，不應在這裡又把所有weight_decay都叫一樣的L2。\n\n## 分母與超參數\n\nloss使用mean或sum、資料量與累積方式會改data gradient相對懲罰強度。若每microbatch都加一次同樣λnorm，但整個群組只更新一次，可能重複算太多懲罰。先推整組目標，再寫實作；不能只複製一行penalty到每個迴圈。\n\n## 哪些參數衰減\n\nbias與norm affine是否decay可依方案設不同group，常見排除不是無條件規則。freeze參數、grad=None與optimizer參數清單也會影響是否更新。交付實驗記錄分組規則，否則兩個都寫AdamW的run仍可能有重要差異。\n\n## 正則化不是資料清理\n\n大weight不必是壞，少數pattern也不必是noise。先處理單位、label與切分；正則化無法修好洩漏或缺少代表性。透過train CV或val比較λ與任務指標，保留最後test，並觀察校準及子群錯誤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n同一effective batch拆4批，若loss_data每批正確sum/N、L2卻每批都加λ/2||θ||²，最後grad懲罰變4倍。解答：整組只加一次，或按明確權重分配，讓總目標相同。這種推導比「看起來loss下降」更能防止實作漂移。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Regularization](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html)\n- [Decoupled decay](https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "l1l2weight-decay", "name": "L1、L2與weight decay：限制哪一種複雜度", "html": "L1、L2與weight decay：限制哪一種複雜度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "在目標加入偏好", "html": "在目標加入偏好", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "optimizer", "name": "更新規則仍需看optimizer", "html": "更新規則仍需看optimizer", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分母與超參數", "html": "分母與超參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "哪些參數衰減", "html": "哪些參數衰減", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "正則化不是資料清理", "html": "正則化不是資料清理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "27-dropout", "group": "regularization", "title": "Dropout：隨機遮蔽、期望與推論模式", "summary": "用inverted scaling手算平均保持，了解它對學習訊號的擾動。", "tags": ["Dropout", "inverted dropout", "train eval", "regularization"], "example": "17_dropout.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"dropout\">Dropout：隨機遮蔽、期望與推論模式</h1>\n<p>用inverted scaling手算平均保持，了解它對學習訊號的擾動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">訓練期間隨機關閉部分值</h2>\n<p>Dropout以某機率將activation設零，降低模型對固定共適應模式的依賴。PyTorch的p是丟棄機率，不是保留機率。inverted dropout在train將保留下來的值除1-p，eval直接保持原值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\tilde h=\\frac{m\\odot h}{1-p},\\quad m_j\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(1-p),\\qquad\n\\mathbb E[\\tilde h\\mid h]=h\n$$</div>\n<p>期望保持不表示每筆／每個batch完全一樣，也不表示經過所有後續非線性後整個網路輸出期望恰等eval結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">可執行觀察</h2>\n<p>p=.5、輸入10000個1，train輸出只會0或2，平均約1；eval全為1。第17例驗證這三項。固定seed讓實驗可重現，但不同隨機來源／呼叫次序也會改mask，不用某一批數字恰相等作通用保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">與其他模組的互動</h2>\n<p>Dropout位置、機率與BatchNorm等一起影響學習。不是每個架構都需要很多Dropout，過大會讓小資料小模型欠擬合；對feature map可考慮channel型策略，語意與逐元素不同。先定方案再做validation比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">推論與不確定性</h2>\n<p>標準推論用eval關掉隨機性；若研究MC Dropout，需要有意設計重複取樣、其他模組模式與校準，不能直接把幾次variance當完整epistemic uncertainty保證。模型仍可能在OOD自信錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>只加no_grad後預測仍隨機，原因是Dropout還在train。解答：同時model.eval；反之eval並不自動關Autograd。若把p=.5理解為輸出乘.5，就漏掉隨機遮蔽與inverted scaling，不是同一演算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/17_dropout.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Inverted dropout: train scaling and eval identity.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Dropout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">evaluation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_unique_values&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unique</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;evaluation_is_identity&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">evaluation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;expectation is approximately preserved, not every sample&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jmlr.org/papers/v15/srivastava14a.html\">Dropout原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#dropout-layers\">Torch Dropout</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Dropout：隨機遮蔽、期望與推論模式\n\n用inverted scaling手算平均保持，了解它對學習訊號的擾動。\n\n## 訓練期間隨機關閉部分值\n\nDropout以某機率將activation設零，降低模型對固定共適應模式的依賴。PyTorch的p是丟棄機率，不是保留機率。inverted dropout在train將保留下來的值除1-p，eval直接保持原值。\n\n$$\n\\tilde h=\\frac{m\\odot h}{1-p},\\quad m_j\\sim\\mathrm{Bernoulli}(1-p),\\qquad\n\\mathbb E[\\tilde h\\mid h]=h\n$$\n\n期望保持不表示每筆／每個batch完全一樣，也不表示經過所有後續非線性後整個網路輸出期望恰等eval結果。\n\n## 可執行觀察\n\np=.5、輸入10000個1，train輸出只會0或2，平均約1；eval全為1。第17例驗證這三項。固定seed讓實驗可重現，但不同隨機來源／呼叫次序也會改mask，不用某一批數字恰相等作通用保證。\n\n## 與其他模組的互動\n\nDropout位置、機率與BatchNorm等一起影響學習。不是每個架構都需要很多Dropout，過大會讓小資料小模型欠擬合；對feature map可考慮channel型策略，語意與逐元素不同。先定方案再做validation比較。\n\n## 推論與不確定性\n\n標準推論用eval關掉隨機性；若研究MC Dropout，需要有意設計重複取樣、其他模組模式與校準，不能直接把幾次variance當完整epistemic uncertainty保證。模型仍可能在OOD自信錯誤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n只加no_grad後預測仍隨機，原因是Dropout還在train。解答：同時model.eval；反之eval並不自動關Autograd。若把p=.5理解為輸出乘.5，就漏掉隨機遮蔽與inverted scaling，不是同一演算法。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/17_dropout.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Inverted dropout: train scaling and eval identity.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    dropout=nn.Dropout(.5);x=torch.ones(10000)\n    train=dropout(x);dropout.eval();evaluation=dropout(x)\n    result={'training_mean':train.mean(),'training_unique_values':train.unique(),\n            'evaluation_is_identity':torch.equal(evaluation,x),'note':'expectation is approximately preserved, not every sample'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Dropout原始論文](https://jmlr.org/papers/v15/srivastava14a.html)\n- [Torch Dropout](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#dropout-layers)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "dropout", "name": "Dropout：隨機遮蔽、期望與推論模式", "html": "Dropout：隨機遮蔽、期望與推論模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "訓練期間隨機關閉部分值", "html": "訓練期間隨機關閉部分值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "可執行觀察", "html": "可執行觀察", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "與其他模組的互動", "html": "與其他模組的互動", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "推論與不確定性", "html": "推論與不確定性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "28-batchnorm", "group": "regularization", "title": "BatchNorm：批次統計、running buffers與兩種variance", "summary": "精確區分訓練正規化和推論統計，理解小batch與凍結的影響。", "tags": ["BatchNorm", "running mean", "variance", "momentum"], "example": "18_batchnorm.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"batchnormrunning-buffersvariance\">BatchNorm：批次統計、running buffers與兩種variance</h1>\n<p>精確區分訓練正規化和推論統計，理解小batch與凍結的影響。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">沿哪些軸計算</h2>\n<p>BatchNorm1d對feature/channel沿batch等適當軸估統計，BatchNorm2d對每channel聚合N與空間。它不是將每一筆的所有feature各自平均；LayerNorm下一章使用不同軸。先看輸入layout與API，不從名字猜。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat x=\\frac{x-\\mu_B}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_B^2+\\epsilon}},\\qquad y=\\gamma\\hat x+\\beta\n$$</div>\n<p>gamma／beta可學，running mean／var是buffer，不經optimizer學梯度但會在train更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">訓練與推論</h2>\n<p>train使用當前batch統計並更新running；eval通常使用保存的running統計。PyTorch訓練正規化使用biased variance，而running variance更新採相應unbiased估計。momentum是running混合比例，與SGD momentum不同，不能看到同名就搬用直覺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">手算兩筆</h2>\n<p>x=[[1,2],[3,4]]，每feature平均[2,3]；population variance各1，unbiased各2。初始running mean0、var1，momentum=.1後mean[.2,.3]、var[1.1,1.1]。第18例真正核對buffer與eval輸出，因此eval mean不需為0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batch\">小batch與遷移</h2>\n<p>批次太小或分布差異大時統計噪音增加；若凍結weights但仍train，running buffer仍可改。轉移學習需決定是否沿用／更新統計與affine參數，不是只有requires_grad=False。各rank統計與SyncBatchNorm也是額外工程問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>為何梯度累積4個小batch不一定等真正大batch？答案：每次BN使用不同小batch統計，forward已不同。BN改善訓練不應只用一個「消除internal covariate shift」口號解釋全部效果；原論文提出該動機，實際機制與架構互動還需實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/18_batchnorm.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Batch statistics, running buffers and evaluation mode.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">BatchNorm1d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">affine</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">momentum</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">train_output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">running_mean</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">running_mean</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">running_variance</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">running_var</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">evaluation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">train_output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;running_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">running_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;running_variance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">running_variance</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;evaluation_output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">evaluation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training normalization and running-variance update use different variance estimators&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.03167\">BatchNorm原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#normalization-layers\">Normalization layers</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# BatchNorm：批次統計、running buffers與兩種variance\n\n精確區分訓練正規化和推論統計，理解小batch與凍結的影響。\n\n## 沿哪些軸計算\n\nBatchNorm1d對feature/channel沿batch等適當軸估統計，BatchNorm2d對每channel聚合N與空間。它不是將每一筆的所有feature各自平均；LayerNorm下一章使用不同軸。先看輸入layout與API，不從名字猜。\n\n$$\n\\hat x=\\frac{x-\\mu_B}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_B^2+\\epsilon}},\\qquad y=\\gamma\\hat x+\\beta\n$$\n\ngamma／beta可學，running mean／var是buffer，不經optimizer學梯度但會在train更新。\n\n## 訓練與推論\n\ntrain使用當前batch統計並更新running；eval通常使用保存的running統計。PyTorch訓練正規化使用biased variance，而running variance更新採相應unbiased估計。momentum是running混合比例，與SGD momentum不同，不能看到同名就搬用直覺。\n\n## 手算兩筆\n\nx=[[1,2],[3,4]]，每feature平均[2,3]；population variance各1，unbiased各2。初始running mean0、var1，momentum=.1後mean[.2,.3]、var[1.1,1.1]。第18例真正核對buffer與eval輸出，因此eval mean不需為0。\n\n## 小batch與遷移\n\n批次太小或分布差異大時統計噪音增加；若凍結weights但仍train，running buffer仍可改。轉移學習需決定是否沿用／更新統計與affine參數，不是只有requires_grad=False。各rank統計與SyncBatchNorm也是額外工程問題。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n為何梯度累積4個小batch不一定等真正大batch？答案：每次BN使用不同小batch統計，forward已不同。BN改善訓練不應只用一個「消除internal covariate shift」口號解釋全部效果；原論文提出該動機，實際機制與架構互動還需實驗。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/18_batchnorm.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Batch statistics, running buffers and evaluation mode.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.tensor([[1.,2.],[3.,4.]])\n    norm=nn.BatchNorm1d(2,affine=False,momentum=.1)\n    train_output=norm(x);running_mean=norm.running_mean.clone();running_variance=norm.running_var.clone()\n    norm.eval();evaluation=norm(x)\n    result={'training_mean':train_output.mean(0),'running_mean':running_mean,\n            'running_variance':running_variance,'evaluation_output':evaluation,\n            'note':'training normalization and running-variance update use different variance estimators'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [BatchNorm原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.03167)\n- [Normalization layers](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#normalization-layers)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "batchnormrunning-buffersvariance", "name": "BatchNorm：批次統計、running buffers與兩種variance", "html": "BatchNorm：批次統計、running buffers與兩種variance", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "沿哪些軸計算", "html": "沿哪些軸計算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "訓練與推論", "html": "訓練與推論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "手算兩筆", "html": "手算兩筆", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "batch", "name": "小batch與遷移", "html": "小batch與遷移", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "29-layernorm", "group": "regularization", "title": "LayerNorm、GroupNorm與RMSNorm：正規化軸的選擇", "summary": "比較批次相依性、affine參數與保存狀態，避免只背名稱。", "tags": ["LayerNorm", "GroupNorm", "RMSNorm", "normalization"], "example": "19_layernorm.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"layernormgroupnormrmsnorm\">LayerNorm、GroupNorm與RMSNorm：正規化軸的選擇</h1>\n<p>比較批次相依性、affine參數與保存狀態，避免只背名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"layernorm\">LayerNorm依指定尾部維度</h2>\n<p>對X[N,T,D]使用LayerNorm(D)，每個樣本每個token沿D算mean與variance。其他batch樣本改變不應影響此筆正規化，因此常見於序列架構；它不像BN需要running mean供eval使用。gamma／beta仍可學。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mu_{n,t}=\\frac1D\\sum_d x_{n,t,d},\\qquad\n\\hat x_{n,t,d}=\\frac{x_{n,t,d}-\\mu_{n,t}}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{n,t}^2+\\epsilon}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"groupnorminstance\">GroupNorm與Instance概念</h2>\n<p>對NCHW，GroupNorm將channel分組並沿組內channel與空間正規化，批次大小不直接參與；組數與channel需相容。InstanceNorm等另有軸與狀態設定。不能因都回傳同shape就視為相同統計操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rmsnorm\">RMSNorm的差別</h2>\n<p>RMSNorm按均方根縮放，一般不減mean；它與LayerNorm不是只改名稱。具體affine、epsilon與實作支援看目前API及模型設定。某些架構常用不代表所有任務都需替換既有norm，先維持可比實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">現成數值檢查</h2>\n<p>第19例在[2,3,4]上做LayerNorm(4)，列最後一軸mean接近0，單獨處理第一筆與原batch第一筆相同；另列GroupNorm形狀。這直接驗證軸與batch相依性，而非只說它「讓模型穩定」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"normresidual\">Norm與residual位置</h2>\n<p>pre-norm先規範化再經子層與加回，post-norm在加總後正規化，影響梯度路徑與訓練行為。第46章TinyBlock用pre-norm並實測causal invariant；完整Transformer各種變體由獨立課深入，不把一個小block等同所有LLM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>LayerNorm((T,D))與LayerNorm(D)是否一樣？答案：前者同時跨時間與feature，改變每個token含義且affine形狀不同。對causal模型尤其需小心未來資訊是否透過不當軸混入。先寫norm沿哪些軸，再看輸出與梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/19_layernorm.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;LayerNorm operates over the specified trailing dimensions.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LayerNorm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">single</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">GroupNorm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;layernorm_last_axis_means&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;layernorm_batch_independence_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">single</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;groupnorm_output_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;LayerNorm does not use BatchNorm running means&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1607.06450\">LayerNorm原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#normalization-layers\">Torch normalization</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# LayerNorm、GroupNorm與RMSNorm：正規化軸的選擇\n\n比較批次相依性、affine參數與保存狀態，避免只背名稱。\n\n## LayerNorm依指定尾部維度\n\n對X[N,T,D]使用LayerNorm(D)，每個樣本每個token沿D算mean與variance。其他batch樣本改變不應影響此筆正規化，因此常見於序列架構；它不像BN需要running mean供eval使用。gamma／beta仍可學。\n\n$$\n\\mu_{n,t}=\\frac1D\\sum_d x_{n,t,d},\\qquad\n\\hat x_{n,t,d}=\\frac{x_{n,t,d}-\\mu_{n,t}}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_{n,t}^2+\\epsilon}}\n$$\n\n## GroupNorm與Instance概念\n\n對NCHW，GroupNorm將channel分組並沿組內channel與空間正規化，批次大小不直接參與；組數與channel需相容。InstanceNorm等另有軸與狀態設定。不能因都回傳同shape就視為相同統計操作。\n\n## RMSNorm的差別\n\nRMSNorm按均方根縮放，一般不減mean；它與LayerNorm不是只改名稱。具體affine、epsilon與實作支援看目前API及模型設定。某些架構常用不代表所有任務都需替換既有norm，先維持可比實驗。\n\n## 現成數值檢查\n\n第19例在[2,3,4]上做LayerNorm(4)，列最後一軸mean接近0，單獨處理第一筆與原batch第一筆相同；另列GroupNorm形狀。這直接驗證軸與batch相依性，而非只說它「讓模型穩定」。\n\n## Norm與residual位置\n\npre-norm先規範化再經子層與加回，post-norm在加總後正規化，影響梯度路徑與訓練行為。第46章TinyBlock用pre-norm並實測causal invariant；完整Transformer各種變體由獨立課深入，不把一個小block等同所有LLM。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nLayerNorm((T,D))與LayerNorm(D)是否一樣？答案：前者同時跨時間與feature，改變每個token含義且affine形狀不同。對causal模型尤其需小心未來資訊是否透過不當軸混入。先寫norm沿哪些軸，再看輸出與梯度。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/19_layernorm.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"LayerNorm operates over the specified trailing dimensions.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.randn(2,3,4);layer=nn.LayerNorm(4)\n    output=layer(x)\n    single=layer(x[:1]);group=nn.GroupNorm(2,4)(torch.randn(2,4,2,2))\n    result={'layernorm_last_axis_means':output.mean(-1),'layernorm_batch_independence_error':(single-output[:1]).abs().max(),\n            'groupnorm_output_shape':list(group.shape),'note':'LayerNorm does not use BatchNorm running means'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [LayerNorm原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1607.06450)\n- [Torch normalization](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#normalization-layers)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "layernormgroupnormrmsnorm", "name": "LayerNorm、GroupNorm與RMSNorm：正規化軸的選擇", "html": "LayerNorm、GroupNorm與RMSNorm：正規化軸的選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "layernorm", "name": "LayerNorm依指定尾部維度", "html": "LayerNorm依指定尾部維度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "groupnorminstance", "name": "GroupNorm與Instance概念", "html": "GroupNorm與Instance概念", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "rmsnorm", "name": "RMSNorm的差別", "html": "RMSNorm的差別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "現成數值檢查", "html": "現成數值檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "normresidual", "name": "Norm與residual位置", "html": "Norm與residual位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "30-augmentation", "group": "regularization", "title": "資料增強與Mixup：先定義哪些變換保留答案", "summary": "把不變性假設寫進資料流程，並檢查soft target與loss的一致性。", "tags": ["augmentation", "mixup", "invariance", "soft targets"], "example": "20_mixup.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"mixup\">資料增強與Mixup：先定義哪些變換保留答案</h1>\n<p>把不變性假設寫進資料流程，並檢查soft target與loss的一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">增強是一種假設</h2>\n<p>水平翻轉可能保留某些影像類別，旋轉文字可能改變字義；時間重排可能破壞序列任務，顏色改動可能移除關鍵訊號。本課橫線／直線label在90度旋轉後會互換，所以不能盲目標成label-preserving。每種變換都要看任務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"train\">Train與評估</h2>\n<p>隨機增強在train，val/test使用固定規則或事先定義的test-time augmentation，不能每次看最有利增強結果。原圖及其衍生版本不跨split。保存變換版本與參數，推論尺寸、單位與normalization也要一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixup_1\">Mixup的輸入與目標</h2>\n<p>將兩筆輸入凸組合，目標也以相同lambda組合。對CE，合法soft target的loss等於對兩個hard labels的加權CE；不是把類別ID直接平均成.75再當索引。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\tilde x=\\lambda x_i+(1-\\lambda)x_j,\\quad\n\\tilde y=\\lambda y_i^{onehot}+(1-\\lambda)y_j^{onehot}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">實際等價測試</h2>\n<p>第20例固定lambda=.25、交換兩筆，在同一logits比較soft target CE與加權hard CE，誤差應在浮點容許內。這驗證損失形式，沒有證明任何資料mix後必定合理或泛化一定進步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">其他正則化交互</h2>\n<p>CutMix、label smoothing與Dropout都會改訓練訊號，組合太強可能欠擬合。比較時固定有效樣本／更新預算與validation，不一次開所有選項後把提升歸給其中一項。文字、表格與多模態也有各自合理增強，不能照影像模板搬用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>直線圖旋轉90度，是否保持label？答案：在本課方向分類不保持，應同時改label或不使用此增強。對醫學或工業影像也需領域判斷，不以「常見augmentation」自動合法。將變換假設與失敗案例寫入實驗記錄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/20_mixup.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Mix inputs and labels; soft-target CE matches weighted hard-label CE.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]]);</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">permutation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]);</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.25</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">mixed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">permutation</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">mixed</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">soft</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">one_hot</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">one_hot</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">permutation</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">weighted</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">permutation</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mixed_inputs&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">mixed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;soft_targets&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">soft</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weighted_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">weighted</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;soft_target_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">soft</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_difference&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">weighted</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">soft</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">())}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.09412\">Mixup原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html\">CE soft targets</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料增強與Mixup：先定義哪些變換保留答案\n\n把不變性假設寫進資料流程，並檢查soft target與loss的一致性。\n\n## 增強是一種假設\n\n水平翻轉可能保留某些影像類別，旋轉文字可能改變字義；時間重排可能破壞序列任務，顏色改動可能移除關鍵訊號。本課橫線／直線label在90度旋轉後會互換，所以不能盲目標成label-preserving。每種變換都要看任務。\n\n## Train與評估\n\n隨機增強在train，val/test使用固定規則或事先定義的test-time augmentation，不能每次看最有利增強結果。原圖及其衍生版本不跨split。保存變換版本與參數，推論尺寸、單位與normalization也要一致。\n\n## Mixup的輸入與目標\n\n將兩筆輸入凸組合，目標也以相同lambda組合。對CE，合法soft target的loss等於對兩個hard labels的加權CE；不是把類別ID直接平均成.75再當索引。\n\n$$\n\\tilde x=\\lambda x_i+(1-\\lambda)x_j,\\quad\n\\tilde y=\\lambda y_i^{onehot}+(1-\\lambda)y_j^{onehot}\n$$\n\n## 實際等價測試\n\n第20例固定lambda=.25、交換兩筆，在同一logits比較soft target CE與加權hard CE，誤差應在浮點容許內。這驗證損失形式，沒有證明任何資料mix後必定合理或泛化一定進步。\n\n## 其他正則化交互\n\nCutMix、label smoothing與Dropout都會改訓練訊號，組合太強可能欠擬合。比較時固定有效樣本／更新預算與validation，不一次開所有選項後把提升歸給其中一項。文字、表格與多模態也有各自合理增強，不能照影像模板搬用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n直線圖旋轉90度，是否保持label？答案：在本課方向分類不保持，應同時改label或不使用此增強。對醫學或工業影像也需領域判斷，不以「常見augmentation」自動合法。將變換假設與失敗案例寫入實驗記錄。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/20_mixup.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Mix inputs and labels; soft-target CE matches weighted hard-label CE.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.tensor([[1.,0.],[0.,1.]]);labels=torch.tensor([0,1]);permutation=torch.tensor([1,0]);lam=.25\n    mixed=lam*x+(1-lam)*x[permutation]\n    logits=nn.Linear(2,2)(mixed)\n    soft=lam*F.one_hot(labels,2)+(1-lam)*F.one_hot(labels[permutation],2)\n    weighted=lam*F.cross_entropy(logits,labels)+(1-lam)*F.cross_entropy(logits,labels[permutation])\n    result={'mixed_inputs':mixed,'soft_targets':soft,'weighted_loss':weighted,\n            'soft_target_loss':F.cross_entropy(logits,soft),'maximum_difference':abs(weighted.item()-F.cross_entropy(logits,soft).item())}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Mixup原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.09412)\n- [CE soft targets](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "mixup", "name": "資料增強與Mixup：先定義哪些變換保留答案", "html": "資料增強與Mixup：先定義哪些變換保留答案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "增強是一種假設", "html": "增強是一種假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "train", "name": "Train與評估", "html": "Train與評估", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "mixup_1", "name": "Mixup的輸入與目標", "html": "Mixup的輸入與目標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "實際等價測試", "html": "實際等價測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "其他正則化交互", "html": "其他正則化交互", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "31-convolution", "group": "vision", "title": "卷積運算：局部感受、權重共享與cross-correlation", "summary": "用3×3影像與2×2kernel手算每個位置，理解CNN的結構偏好。", "tags": ["convolution", "cross correlation", "kernel", "weight sharing"], "example": "21_convolution.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"cross-correlation\">卷積運算：局部感受、權重共享與cross-correlation</h1>\n<p>用3×3影像與2×2kernel手算每個位置，理解CNN的結構偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為何局部與共享</h2>\n<p>全連接將所有位置各自連接，卷積則讓同一局部kernel滑過空間，減少參數並偏好平移一致的模式。這是資料結構假設，對影像等常有用，但任意表格欄位未必具有相同鄰接語意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cross-correlation_1\">技術上常是cross-correlation</h2>\n<p>深度學習Conv一般不先翻轉kernel，與純數學某些卷積定義有別。API仍稱convolution。本章手算以實作的cross-correlation一致，不讓符號翻轉差異成為疑似bug。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nY_{n,o,i,j}=b_o+\\sum_{c,u,v}W_{o,c,u,v}\\,X_{n,c,i+u,j+v}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">四個輸出的手算</h2>\n<p>輸入1..9排3×3，kernel[[1,0],[0,-1]]，stride1無padding。左上1-5=-4，其他位置2-6、4-8、5-9也都-4，輸出[1,1,2,2]。第21例直接用F.conv2d核對，沒有依賴下載影像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"channel\">Channel與參數</h2>\n<p>Conv2d(inC,outC,K)的weight[outC,inC,K,K]，每個out channel聚合所有輸入channel；參數數outC×inC×K²+outC，與影像高寬無關。groups／depthwise會改連接結構，不能仍套一般全channel公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stridepaddingdilation\">Stride、padding與dilation的尺寸</h2>\n<p>每個空間維度可獨立計算。設輸入長I、kernel長K、兩側各padding P、stride S、dilation D，dilation讓相鄰kernel元素相隔D個輸入位置。有效kernel跨度為D(K−1)+1；不能把K直接乘D，因為兩端之間只有K−1段間距。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nO=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{I+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$</div>\n<p>例如I=8、K=3、P=1、S=2、D=1，得到O=4。padding保留尺寸與真實資訊是不同概念；補的零不是額外觀測到的像素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">共享權重怎麼得到梯度</h2>\n<p>若上游導數為G=∂L/∂Y，一個kernel weight在多個輸出位置被重複使用，其梯度就是各位置「上游G×對應輸入」的加總。反過來，同一輸入像素也可能參與多個視窗，因此input gradient要加總所有相關路徑。這是全連接鏈式法則在共享與局部連接下的展開，不是另一種學習規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">平移等變與邊界</h2>\n<p>共享kernel提供某些平移等變結構，padding、stride、裁切與邊界會影響精確性；pooling也不自動使任何尺度／角度都不變。不要把CNN叫「天然理解所有位置」；augmentation與資料多樣性仍重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若將kernel翻轉180度，這個例子結果會變+4，反映定義差異。解答：先核對API與手算的一致定義，再查運算。輸入通道從1變3時，不只reshape，還要改kernel的in_channel與資料語意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/21_convolution.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Deep-learning convolution uses cross-correlation without flipping the kernel.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">image</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[[[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]]]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">conv2d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">image</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;input&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">image</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;kernel&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;output_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;manual_first_value&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#convolution-layers\">Convolution layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html\">卷積原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 卷積運算：局部感受、權重共享與cross-correlation\n\n用3×3影像與2×2kernel手算每個位置，理解CNN的結構偏好。\n\n## 為何局部與共享\n\n全連接將所有位置各自連接，卷積則讓同一局部kernel滑過空間，減少參數並偏好平移一致的模式。這是資料結構假設，對影像等常有用，但任意表格欄位未必具有相同鄰接語意。\n\n## 技術上常是cross-correlation\n\n深度學習Conv一般不先翻轉kernel，與純數學某些卷積定義有別。API仍稱convolution。本章手算以實作的cross-correlation一致，不讓符號翻轉差異成為疑似bug。\n\n$$\nY_{n,o,i,j}=b_o+\\sum_{c,u,v}W_{o,c,u,v}\\,X_{n,c,i+u,j+v}\n$$\n\n## 四個輸出的手算\n\n輸入1..9排3×3，kernel[[1,0],[0,-1]]，stride1無padding。左上1-5=-4，其他位置2-6、4-8、5-9也都-4，輸出[1,1,2,2]。第21例直接用F.conv2d核對，沒有依賴下載影像。\n\n## Channel與參數\n\nConv2d(inC,outC,K)的weight[outC,inC,K,K]，每個out channel聚合所有輸入channel；參數數outC×inC×K²+outC，與影像高寬無關。groups／depthwise會改連接結構，不能仍套一般全channel公式。\n\n## Stride、padding與dilation的尺寸\n\n每個空間維度可獨立計算。設輸入長I、kernel長K、兩側各padding P、stride S、dilation D，dilation讓相鄰kernel元素相隔D個輸入位置。有效kernel跨度為D(K−1)+1；不能把K直接乘D，因為兩端之間只有K−1段間距。\n\n$$\nO=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{I+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$\n\n例如I=8、K=3、P=1、S=2、D=1，得到O=4。padding保留尺寸與真實資訊是不同概念；補的零不是額外觀測到的像素。\n\n## 共享權重怎麼得到梯度\n\n若上游導數為G=∂L/∂Y，一個kernel weight在多個輸出位置被重複使用，其梯度就是各位置「上游G×對應輸入」的加總。反過來，同一輸入像素也可能參與多個視窗，因此input gradient要加總所有相關路徑。這是全連接鏈式法則在共享與局部連接下的展開，不是另一種學習規則。\n\n## 平移等變與邊界\n\n共享kernel提供某些平移等變結構，padding、stride、裁切與邊界會影響精確性；pooling也不自動使任何尺度／角度都不變。不要把CNN叫「天然理解所有位置」；augmentation與資料多樣性仍重要。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若將kernel翻轉180度，這個例子結果會變+4，反映定義差異。解答：先核對API與手算的一致定義，再查運算。輸入通道從1變3時，不只reshape，還要改kernel的in_channel與資料語意。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/21_convolution.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Deep-learning convolution uses cross-correlation without flipping the kernel.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    image=torch.arange(1.,10.).reshape(1,1,3,3)\n    kernel=torch.tensor([[[[1.,0.],[0.,-1.]]]])\n    output=F.conv2d(image,kernel)\n    result={'input':image,'kernel':kernel,'output':output,'output_shape':list(output.shape),\n            'manual_first_value':1.-5.}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Convolution layers](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#convolution-layers)\n- [卷積原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cross-correlation", "name": "卷積運算：局部感受、權重共享與cross-correlation", "html": "卷積運算：局部感受、權重共享與cross-correlation", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為何局部與共享", "html": "為何局部與共享", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "cross-correlation_1", "name": "技術上常是cross-correlation", "html": "技術上常是cross-correlation", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "四個輸出的手算", "html": "四個輸出的手算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "channel", "name": "Channel與參數", "html": "Channel與參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "stridepaddingdilation", "name": "Stride、padding與dilation的尺寸", "html": "Stride、padding與dilation的尺寸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "共享權重怎麼得到梯度", "html": "共享權重怎麼得到梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "平移等變與邊界", "html": "平移等變與邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "32-receptive-field", "group": "vision", "title": "輸出尺寸與感受野：stride、padding、dilation", "summary": "推算每層看見哪些輸入，再用真實梯度支持範圍核對。", "tags": ["receptive field", "stride", "padding", "dilation"], "example": "22_receptive_field.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"stridepaddingdilation\">輸出尺寸與感受野：stride、padding、dilation</h1>\n<p>推算每層看見哪些輸入，再用真實梯度支持範圍核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先推輸出高寬</h2>\n<p>單軸輸入H、kernelK、paddingP、strideS、dilationD，輸出由floor公式決定。dilation增加kernel取樣間距，參數數不必增加；stride降低輸出解析度。通道軸與空間軸分別追蹤，不把batch也算進Flatten feature。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nH_{out}=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{H+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">感受野與相鄰輸出的跳距</h2>\n<p>初始r=1、j=1。每層r_next=r+(K-1)Dj，j_next=jS。padding改位置與邊界，但這個內部理論範圍尺寸推算仍適用。理論感受野是可能依賴區域，實際影響分布／非線性會有不同有效程度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nr_l=r_{l-1}+(K_l-1)D_lj_{l-1},\\qquad j_l=j_{l-1}S_l\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可手算三層</h2>\n<p>K3/S1、K3/S2、K3/S1依序r為3、5、9，jump為1、2、2。第22例用三個Conv1d、weights全1、無非線性，對一個中間輸出反向，非零input gradient範圍寬確為9。這是對理論依賴的一個直接測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">邊界與有效感受野</h2>\n<p>近邊界輸出可能部分看padding而非真資料；ReLU關閉、權重抵消或不同路徑會讓某些理論位置梯度零。不能對任意隨機非線性網路只數非零梯度就說理論公式錯。先用受控正權重線性鏈驗證，再研究實際模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>8×8經K3/P1/S1保持8，接K3/P1/S2變4；outC8則Flatten為128。解答：這正是本課TinyCNN最後Linear的輸入，不能照別人圖片尺寸抄256。更換解析度可改結構或用適當adaptive pooling，但都要檢查表達與資訊損失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/22_receptive_field.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Receptive-field arithmetic checked with actual input gradients.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">receptive_field</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">layers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Conv1d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Conv1d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">stride</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Conv1d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">layer</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">init</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">31</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nonzero</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">flatten</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;formula&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">receptive_field</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">layers</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;actual_input_support&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;actual_width&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html\">Conv2d API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html\">卷積原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 輸出尺寸與感受野：stride、padding、dilation\n\n推算每層看見哪些輸入，再用真實梯度支持範圍核對。\n\n## 先推輸出高寬\n\n單軸輸入H、kernelK、paddingP、strideS、dilationD，輸出由floor公式決定。dilation增加kernel取樣間距，參數數不必增加；stride降低輸出解析度。通道軸與空間軸分別追蹤，不把batch也算進Flatten feature。\n\n$$\nH_{out}=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{H+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$\n\n## 感受野與相鄰輸出的跳距\n\n初始r=1、j=1。每層r_next=r+(K-1)Dj，j_next=jS。padding改位置與邊界，但這個內部理論範圍尺寸推算仍適用。理論感受野是可能依賴區域，實際影響分布／非線性會有不同有效程度。\n\n$$\nr_l=r_{l-1}+(K_l-1)D_lj_{l-1},\\qquad j_l=j_{l-1}S_l\n$$\n\n## 可手算三層\n\nK3/S1、K3/S2、K3/S1依序r為3、5、9，jump為1、2、2。第22例用三個Conv1d、weights全1、無非線性，對一個中間輸出反向，非零input gradient範圍寬確為9。這是對理論依賴的一個直接測試。\n\n## 邊界與有效感受野\n\n近邊界輸出可能部分看padding而非真資料；ReLU關閉、權重抵消或不同路徑會讓某些理論位置梯度零。不能對任意隨機非線性網路只數非零梯度就說理論公式錯。先用受控正權重線性鏈驗證，再研究實際模型。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n8×8經K3/P1/S1保持8，接K3/P1/S2變4；outC8則Flatten為128。解答：這正是本課TinyCNN最後Linear的輸入，不能照別人圖片尺寸抄256。更換解析度可改結構或用適當adaptive pooling，但都要檢查表達與資訊損失。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/22_receptive_field.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Receptive-field arithmetic checked with actual input gradients.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import receptive_field\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    layers=[(3,1,1),(3,2,1),(3,1,1)]\n    model=nn.Sequential(nn.Conv1d(1,1,3,bias=False),nn.Conv1d(1,1,3,stride=2,bias=False),nn.Conv1d(1,1,3,bias=False))\n    for layer in model:nn.init.ones_(layer.weight)\n    x=torch.ones(1,1,31,requires_grad=True);model(x)[0,0,5].backward()\n    support=x.grad[0,0].nonzero().flatten()\n    result={'formula':receptive_field(layers),'actual_input_support':support,'actual_width':len(support)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Conv2d API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html)\n- [卷積原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "stridepaddingdilation", "name": "輸出尺寸與感受野：stride、padding、dilation", "html": "輸出尺寸與感受野：stride、padding、dilation", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先推輸出高寬", "html": "先推輸出高寬", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "感受野與相鄰輸出的跳距", "html": "感受野與相鄰輸出的跳距", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可手算三層", "html": "可手算三層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "邊界與有效感受野", "html": "邊界與有效感受野", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "33-pooling", "group": "vision", "title": "Pooling與下採樣：資訊、等變性與aliasing", "summary": "分清最大、平均、stride與global pooling對模型造成的偏好。", "tags": ["pooling", "downsampling", "aliasing", "global average pooling"], "html": "<h1 id=\"poolingaliasing\">Pooling與下採樣：資訊、等變性與aliasing</h1>\n<p>分清最大、平均、stride與global pooling對模型造成的偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼降低解析度</h2>\n<p>下採樣減少activation與運算，後面每個位置可間接看更大原始區域。但也丟資訊，細小物體、邊界或位置任務可能受影響。不能只看模型變小，就說表示更好；要連回任務與資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"maxaverage\">Max與Average</h2>\n<p>max pooling偏向局部最強反應，平均則保留區域平均。max的gradient傳到選中位置，tie有API約定；平均分配到各項。它們通常無可學參數，但會改梯度、解析度與不變性。stride convolution則包含可學權重，兩者不完全可替代。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[[[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">]]]],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max_pool2d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">avg_pool2d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>max為4，只有右下得到此處gradient1；average為2.5。這個局部例子可幫你解釋下採樣的不同訊號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aliasing\">平移與aliasing</h2>\n<p>stride取樣可能對一像素移動敏感，因為取到的格點不同；下採樣前低通等策略可研究，但也有資料與性能取捨。CNN的共享不保證任意平移後最後分類完全不變，更不保證旋轉與尺度不變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"global-average-pooling\">Global Average Pooling</h2>\n<p>將每channel空間平均，可減少固定Flatten的尺寸相依與全連接參數，但丟掉精確位置。對分類有時合適，對定位／序列位置重要時未必。本課TinyCNN保留小型Flatten以便直接核對128個特徵，不把某個設計當唯一方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>物體只占一個亮點，max與average可能有不同反應；若亮點是noise，max也可能放大錯訊號。解答：沒有一個pooling永遠最好，使用合理資料與驗證，檢查小物體／位置切片。更完整偵測與分割架構將在獨立影像課深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#pooling-layers\">Pooling layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html\">CNN結構</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Pooling與下採樣：資訊、等變性與aliasing\n\n分清最大、平均、stride與global pooling對模型造成的偏好。\n\n## 為什麼降低解析度\n\n下採樣減少activation與運算，後面每個位置可間接看更大原始區域。但也丟資訊，細小物體、邊界或位置任務可能受影響。不能只看模型變小，就說表示更好；要連回任務與資料。\n\n## Max與Average\n\nmax pooling偏向局部最強反應，平均則保留區域平均。max的gradient傳到選中位置，tie有API約定；平均分配到各項。它們通常無可學參數，但會改梯度、解析度與不變性。stride convolution則包含可學權重，兩者不完全可替代。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nx=torch.tensor([[[[1.,2.],[3.,4.]]]],requires_grad=True)\nout=F.max_pool2d(x,2)\nout.sum().backward()\nprint(out,x.grad)\nprint(F.avg_pool2d(x.detach(),2))\n```\n\nmax為4，只有右下得到此處gradient1；average為2.5。這個局部例子可幫你解釋下採樣的不同訊號。\n\n## 平移與aliasing\n\nstride取樣可能對一像素移動敏感，因為取到的格點不同；下採樣前低通等策略可研究，但也有資料與性能取捨。CNN的共享不保證任意平移後最後分類完全不變，更不保證旋轉與尺度不變。\n\n## Global Average Pooling\n\n將每channel空間平均，可減少固定Flatten的尺寸相依與全連接參數，但丟掉精確位置。對分類有時合適，對定位／序列位置重要時未必。本課TinyCNN保留小型Flatten以便直接核對128個特徵，不把某個設計當唯一方案。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n物體只占一個亮點，max與average可能有不同反應；若亮點是noise，max也可能放大錯訊號。解答：沒有一個pooling永遠最好，使用合理資料與驗證，檢查小物體／位置切片。更完整偵測與分割架構將在獨立影像課深入。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Pooling layers](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#pooling-layers)\n- [CNN結構](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "poolingaliasing", "name": "Pooling與下採樣：資訊、等變性與aliasing", "html": "Pooling與下採樣：資訊、等變性與aliasing", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼降低解析度", "html": "為什麼降低解析度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "maxaverage", "name": "Max與Average", "html": "Max與Average", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "aliasing", "name": "平移與aliasing", "html": "平移與aliasing", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "global-average-pooling", "name": "Global Average Pooling", "html": "Global Average Pooling", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "34-cnn-training", "group": "vision", "title": "CNN完整訓練：從合成線條到可驗證分類", "summary": "將卷積、shape、loss與資料切分組成真正的學習實驗。", "tags": ["CNN", "image classification", "synthetic data", "training"], "example": "23_cnn.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"cnn\">CNN完整訓練：從合成線條到可驗證分類</h1>\n<p>將卷積、shape、loss與資料切分組成真正的學習實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先用能解釋的資料</h2>\n<p>生成180張1×8×8灰階圖，水平／垂直雙像素帶加固定分布noise，位置在合理範圍隨機。shuffle後108train、36val、36test。這個任務讓你檢查局部方向與位置變動，沒有把線條成績當真實影像能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">架構帳本</h2>\n<p>Conv1→6 K3/P1得到[N,6,8,8]，ReLU；Conv6→8 K3/P1/S2得到[N,8,4,4]，ReLU；Flatten128→Linear2 logits。分類CE用long[N]，每輪train+val，保存val最低loss模型，最後才test。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">驗證要看什麼</h2>\n<p>loss有限且下降、shape正確、grad與weights更新、val/test包含未見noise與位置。很高accuracy可能因任務本來容易，還要對照簡單方向規則；這是工程與架構sanity check，沒有聲稱使用CNN才是唯一解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">放到真實圖片時</h2>\n<p>RGB／灰階、CHW／HWC、0..255／0..1、resize、缺失檔案與label mapping都要明確。預訓練模型有對應transforms，不應任意換。train augmentation與val固定流程分開，同來源圖片group分割，避免衍生版本洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">錯誤分析</h2>\n<p>看是否只在某位置、noise或強度失敗，是否把90度旋轉錯標為label不變。也可先overfit一批診斷，再完整資料。加深模型若無改善，回到生成規則與目標，不能自動認定需要更大GPU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>輸入改16×16，同stride後為[N,8,8,8]，Flatten512，舊Linear128不相容。解答：推算後改head或採適當adaptive pooling，重新驗證。分辨率與噪音改變也改任務分布，不拿不同資料成績直接說架構進步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/23_cnn.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a tiny CNN on generated horizontal/vertical bands.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;image&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;synthetic bands, not real-image recognition accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/blitz/cifar10_tutorial.html\">CNN官方教學</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html\">Conv API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# CNN完整訓練：從合成線條到可驗證分類\n\n將卷積、shape、loss與資料切分組成真正的學習實驗。\n\n## 先用能解釋的資料\n\n生成180張1×8×8灰階圖，水平／垂直雙像素帶加固定分布noise，位置在合理範圍隨機。shuffle後108train、36val、36test。這個任務讓你檢查局部方向與位置變動，沒有把線條成績當真實影像能力。\n\n## 架構帳本\n\nConv1→6 K3/P1得到[N,6,8,8]，ReLU；Conv6→8 K3/P1/S2得到[N,8,4,4]，ReLU；Flatten128→Linear2 logits。分類CE用long[N]，每輪train+val，保存val最低loss模型，最後才test。\n\n## 驗證要看什麼\n\nloss有限且下降、shape正確、grad與weights更新、val/test包含未見noise與位置。很高accuracy可能因任務本來容易，還要對照簡單方向規則；這是工程與架構sanity check，沒有聲稱使用CNN才是唯一解法。\n\n## 放到真實圖片時\n\nRGB／灰階、CHW／HWC、0..255／0..1、resize、缺失檔案與label mapping都要明確。預訓練模型有對應transforms，不應任意換。train augmentation與val固定流程分開，同來源圖片group分割，避免衍生版本洩漏。\n\n## 錯誤分析\n\n看是否只在某位置、noise或強度失敗，是否把90度旋轉錯標為label不變。也可先overfit一批診斷，再完整資料。加深模型若無改善，回到生成規則與目標，不能自動認定需要更大GPU。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n輸入改16×16，同stride後為[N,8,8,8]，Flatten512，舊Linear128不相容。解答：推算後改head或採適當adaptive pooling，重新驗證。分辨率與噪音改變也改任務分布，不拿不同資料成績直接說架構進步。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/23_cnn.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a tiny CNN on generated horizontal/vertical bands.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import experiment\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    run=experiment('image')\n    result={'initial_validation':run['initial_validation'],'best_validation':run['best_validation'],\n            'test':run['test'],'scope':'synthetic bands, not real-image recognition accuracy'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [CNN官方教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/blitz/cifar10_tutorial.html)\n- [Conv API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cnn", "name": "CNN完整訓練：從合成線條到可驗證分類", "html": "CNN完整訓練：從合成線條到可驗證分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先用能解釋的資料", "html": "先用能解釋的資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "架構帳本", "html": "架構帳本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "驗證要看什麼", "html": "驗證要看什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "放到真實圖片時", "html": "放到真實圖片時", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "錯誤分析", "html": "錯誤分析", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "35-residual", "group": "vision", "title": "Residual：學修正量，保留直接路徑", "summary": "從identity Jacobian理解shortcut，同時注意shape與activation位置。", "tags": ["ResNet", "residual", "shortcut", "identity", "Jacobian"], "example": "24_residual.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"residual\">Residual：學修正量，保留直接路徑</h1>\n<p>從identity Jacobian理解shortcut，同時注意shape與activation位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"yxfx\">y=x+F(x)</h2>\n<p>與直接學全部映射相比，殘差分支學對輸入的修正。F接近0時仍保留identity。這個表示可讓某些深層網路較易最佳化，原論文提供實驗；它不是對任意深度／資料永遠成功的定理。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\ny=x+F_\\theta(x),\\qquad \\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x}=I+J_F\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">梯度路徑的意義</h2>\n<p>有額外I項可讓訊號不必只穿過整個分支導數。若J_F某方向抵消I仍可能有問題，因此不能只說residual「完全解決梯度消失」。norm、activation、初始化與步長仍影響整體行為。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">位置與形狀</h2>\n<p>相加兩邊shape需相容且語意一致，channel或stride改變時可用projection shortcut，例如1×1 conv。post-add ReLU會改負值與Jacobian；pre-activation／pre-norm變體又有不同路徑，不把所有ResNet畫成同一圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">精確小例</h2>\n<p>第24例令Linear分支weight/bias全零，直接返回x+branch(x)，沒有加後ReLU。輸入[1,-2]保持原值，Jacobian為I，實際用torch.autograd.functional.jacobian核對。此測試因刻意控制結構才應精確，不能套到含ReLU的所有block。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">模型設計的比較</h2>\n<p>若比較plain與residual，盡量固定寬度、深度、預算、初始化與資料，記錄train/val及梯度。若同時換成不同norm與增強，效果不能全歸給shortcut。合理實驗比背架構名字更能建立判斷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將輸出再ReLU，負輸入-2變0，identity不再對所有輸入成立。解答：用數值與局部導數核對圖的精確位置。若輸入C4、分支輸出C8，不能依靠廣播亂加，應明確設計projection與空間尺寸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/24_residual.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A zero residual branch preserves both values and the identity Jacobian.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">branch</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">init</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">branch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">init</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">branch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">residual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"k\">lambda</span> <span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">branch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">jacobian</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">autograd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">functional</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">jacobian</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">residual</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;input&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">residual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;jacobian&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">jacobian</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;no post-addition ReLU here; a post-ReLU would change negative entries&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385\">Deep Residual Learning</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Residual：學修正量，保留直接路徑\n\n從identity Jacobian理解shortcut，同時注意shape與activation位置。\n\n## y=x+F(x)\n\n與直接學全部映射相比，殘差分支學對輸入的修正。F接近0時仍保留identity。這個表示可讓某些深層網路較易最佳化，原論文提供實驗；它不是對任意深度／資料永遠成功的定理。\n\n$$\ny=x+F_\\theta(x),\\qquad \\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x}=I+J_F\n$$\n\n## 梯度路徑的意義\n\n有額外I項可讓訊號不必只穿過整個分支導數。若J_F某方向抵消I仍可能有問題，因此不能只說residual「完全解決梯度消失」。norm、activation、初始化與步長仍影響整體行為。\n\n## 位置與形狀\n\n相加兩邊shape需相容且語意一致，channel或stride改變時可用projection shortcut，例如1×1 conv。post-add ReLU會改負值與Jacobian；pre-activation／pre-norm變體又有不同路徑，不把所有ResNet畫成同一圖。\n\n## 精確小例\n\n第24例令Linear分支weight/bias全零，直接返回x+branch(x)，沒有加後ReLU。輸入[1,-2]保持原值，Jacobian為I，實際用torch.autograd.functional.jacobian核對。此測試因刻意控制結構才應精確，不能套到含ReLU的所有block。\n\n## 模型設計的比較\n\n若比較plain與residual，盡量固定寬度、深度、預算、初始化與資料，記錄train/val及梯度。若同時換成不同norm與增強，效果不能全歸給shortcut。合理實驗比背架構名字更能建立判斷。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將輸出再ReLU，負輸入-2變0，identity不再對所有輸入成立。解答：用數值與局部導數核對圖的精確位置。若輸入C4、分支輸出C8，不能依靠廣播亂加，應明確設計projection與空間尺寸。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/24_residual.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A zero residual branch preserves both values and the identity Jacobian.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    branch=nn.Linear(2,2);nn.init.zeros_(branch.weight);nn.init.zeros_(branch.bias)\n    x=torch.tensor([1.,-2.],requires_grad=True)\n    residual=lambda value:value+branch(value)\n    jacobian=torch.autograd.functional.jacobian(residual,x)\n    result={'input':x,'output':residual(x),'jacobian':jacobian,\n            'note':'no post-addition ReLU here; a post-ReLU would change negative entries'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Deep Residual Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "residual", "name": "Residual：學修正量，保留直接路徑", "html": "Residual：學修正量，保留直接路徑", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "yxfx", "name": "y=x+F(x)", "html": "y=x+F(x)", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "梯度路徑的意義", "html": "梯度路徑的意義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "位置與形狀", "html": "位置與形狀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "精確小例", "html": "精確小例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "模型設計的比較", "html": "模型設計的比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "36-transfer", "group": "vision", "title": "遷移學習：預訓練表示、凍結與領域差異", "summary": "把機制、前處理與資料適用性分清楚，再決定微調範圍。", "tags": ["transfer learning", "freeze", "pretraining", "fine tuning"], "example": "25_freezing.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">遷移學習：預訓練表示、凍結與領域差異</h1>\n<p>把機制、前處理與資料適用性分清楚，再決定微調範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">遷移的是表示與假設</h2>\n<p>預訓練模型先從某份資料學到參數，再用在新任務。可能節省資料與最佳化，也可能因來源差異而負遷移；不是下載較大weights就保證提升。記錄模型來源、版本、授權、輸入轉換與已驗證範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">三種常見策略</h2>\n<p>固定backbone只學head；解凍後面幾層；全模型以較小lr微調。每種有不同資料量、成本與遺忘風險。optimizer是否含新解凍參數、各group lr與狀態都要檢查，不只改requires_grad旗標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">凍結參數與模式</h2>\n<p>requires_grad=False不等於eval：BatchNorm running buffers與Dropout行為可能仍改變。固定feature extractor時no_grad可減圖，但如果前方有可訓練模組需穿過它回傳gradient，就不能把整段切斷。畫出需要的路徑，再選操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"25\">本課第25例的界線</h2>\n<p>backbone是隨機初始化Linear，明確沒有下載預訓練模型。範例驗證backbone不變、head變化，展示凍結機制，不能拿它證明transfer提升準確率。真正預訓練模型選型與影像／LLM適應會在各自獨立課程深化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">公平評估</h2>\n<p>比較從頭訓練與transfer需說明額外預訓練資料／成本，不只看新任務epochs；用相同split與合理調參。若預訓練來源包含test相似資料，也需考慮污染與外推限制。沿用tokenizer／transforms，不能只保留weights。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>凍結weights後state_dict中的running_mean仍變，原因可能BN仍train。解答：明確決定是否更新統計，並在外層model.train後重新管理該子模組模式。新head輸出類別數、label mapping與loss契約也要重設，不只是替換最後一行名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/25_freezing.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Frozen random features demonstrate the mechanism, not pretrained transfer quality.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">snapshot</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tanh</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">snapshot</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">before_head</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">snapshot</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;backbone_unchanged&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">state_dict</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;head_changed&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">any</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before_head</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">state_dict</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;random frozen features; no pretrained model downloaded&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/transfer_learning_tutorial.html\">Transfer learning官方教學</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Module狀態</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 遷移學習：預訓練表示、凍結與領域差異\n\n把機制、前處理與資料適用性分清楚，再決定微調範圍。\n\n## 遷移的是表示與假設\n\n預訓練模型先從某份資料學到參數，再用在新任務。可能節省資料與最佳化，也可能因來源差異而負遷移；不是下載較大weights就保證提升。記錄模型來源、版本、授權、輸入轉換與已驗證範圍。\n\n## 三種常見策略\n\n固定backbone只學head；解凍後面幾層；全模型以較小lr微調。每種有不同資料量、成本與遺忘風險。optimizer是否含新解凍參數、各group lr與狀態都要檢查，不只改requires_grad旗標。\n\n## 凍結參數與模式\n\nrequires_grad=False不等於eval：BatchNorm running buffers與Dropout行為可能仍改變。固定feature extractor時no_grad可減圖，但如果前方有可訓練模組需穿過它回傳gradient，就不能把整段切斷。畫出需要的路徑，再選操作。\n\n## 本課第25例的界線\n\nbackbone是隨機初始化Linear，明確沒有下載預訓練模型。範例驗證backbone不變、head變化，展示凍結機制，不能拿它證明transfer提升準確率。真正預訓練模型選型與影像／LLM適應會在各自獨立課程深化。\n\n## 公平評估\n\n比較從頭訓練與transfer需說明額外預訓練資料／成本，不只看新任務epochs；用相同split與合理調參。若預訓練來源包含test相似資料，也需考慮污染與外推限制。沿用tokenizer／transforms，不能只保留weights。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n凍結weights後state_dict中的running_mean仍變，原因可能BN仍train。解答：明確決定是否更新統計，並在外層model.train後重新管理該子模組模式。新head輸出類別數、label mapping與loss契約也要重設，不只是替換最後一行名稱。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/25_freezing.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Frozen random features demonstrate the mechanism, not pretrained transfer quality.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import snapshot\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    backbone=nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4,6),nn.Tanh());head=nn.Linear(6,2)\n    for p in backbone.parameters():p.requires_grad_(False)\n    before=snapshot(backbone);before_head=snapshot(head)\n    optimizer=torch.optim.SGD(head.parameters(),lr=.1)\n    x=torch.randn(8,4);labels=torch.arange(8)%2\n    with torch.no_grad():features=backbone(x)\n    F.cross_entropy(head(features),labels).backward();optimizer.step()\n    result={'backbone_unchanged':all(torch.equal(before[k],v) for k,v in backbone.state_dict().items()),\n            'head_changed':any(not torch.equal(before_head[k],v) for k,v in head.state_dict().items()),\n            'scope':'random frozen features; no pretrained model downloaded'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Transfer learning官方教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/transfer_learning_tutorial.html)\n- [Module狀態](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "遷移學習：預訓練表示、凍結與領域差異", "html": "遷移學習：預訓練表示、凍結與領域差異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "遷移的是表示與假設", "html": "遷移的是表示與假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "三種常見策略", "html": "三種常見策略", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "凍結參數與模式", "html": "凍結參數與模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "25", "name": "本課第25例的界線", "html": "本課第25例的界線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "公平評估", "html": "公平評估", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "37-sequence-data", "group": "sequence", "title": "序列資料：時間、順序、長度與預測位置", "summary": "先定義能看見哪些位置，再選RNN、CNN或Attention。", "tags": ["sequence", "time series", "causality", "lengths"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">序列資料：時間、順序、長度與預測位置</h1>\n<p>先定義能看見哪些位置，再選RNN、CNN或Attention。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tensor\">不是多一個Tensor軸就完成</h2>\n<p>X[N,T,D]代表batch、位置、每位置特徵，但T可能是時間、字詞或事件順序。分類整段、每位置標註、預測下一步或生成輸出有不同label對齊。先寫預測時能看到哪一段，避免模型偷看答案後面的資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">時間與樣本的切分</h2>\n<p>滑動視窗可能大量重疊，隨機切窗可讓train與test共享幾乎相同原始片段。按時間、主體或來源切，再造視窗，必要時留gap。前處理也只fit允許的train期間，不能以未來mean填過去資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">同一模型的不同輸出</h2>\n<p>many-to-one可用最後有效hidden或mask pooling，many-to-many每步輸出，encoder-decoder另有兩段長度。若拿PAD之後的最後位置作句子表示，可能讓序列長度決定預測；「最後」應是每筆有效序列的最後，而不是矩形Tensor最右邊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shapebatch\">Shape與batch規則</h2>\n<p>Torch RNN可batch_first=True使用[N,T,D]，hidden state仍有[num_layers×directions,N,H]形式。LSTM還有cell state；不能看到batch_first就把所有state軸也交換。長度與mask是明確metadata，不應把PAD0當普通token參與平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">本課的生成任務</h2>\n<p>序列長2..7、ID1..8、PAD0，label為最後token是否&gt;=5。這刻意讓答案可驗證，直接規則是完美基準；GRU專題用來學pack與state，沒有宣稱這個任務需要遞迴。更複雜語意與長期依賴需另外設計資料與評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>預測明天事件，能否用明天已發生後的完整序列？答案：不能，須限定輸入截止時間。對句子分類可看全句，對逐token預測需causal規則，兩者mask不同。先畫時間與label對齊，再寫forward，比之後修一個維度更根本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html\">Sequence models</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#recurrent-layers\">Torch recurrent layers</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 序列資料：時間、順序、長度與預測位置\n\n先定義能看見哪些位置，再選RNN、CNN或Attention。\n\n## 不是多一個Tensor軸就完成\n\nX[N,T,D]代表batch、位置、每位置特徵，但T可能是時間、字詞或事件順序。分類整段、每位置標註、預測下一步或生成輸出有不同label對齊。先寫預測時能看到哪一段，避免模型偷看答案後面的資訊。\n\n## 時間與樣本的切分\n\n滑動視窗可能大量重疊，隨機切窗可讓train與test共享幾乎相同原始片段。按時間、主體或來源切，再造視窗，必要時留gap。前處理也只fit允許的train期間，不能以未來mean填過去資料。\n\n## 同一模型的不同輸出\n\nmany-to-one可用最後有效hidden或mask pooling，many-to-many每步輸出，encoder-decoder另有兩段長度。若拿PAD之後的最後位置作句子表示，可能讓序列長度決定預測；「最後」應是每筆有效序列的最後，而不是矩形Tensor最右邊。\n\n## Shape與batch規則\n\nTorch RNN可batch_first=True使用[N,T,D]，hidden state仍有[num_layers×directions,N,H]形式。LSTM還有cell state；不能看到batch_first就把所有state軸也交換。長度與mask是明確metadata，不應把PAD0當普通token參與平均。\n\n## 本課的生成任務\n\n序列長2..7、ID1..8、PAD0，label為最後token是否>=5。這刻意讓答案可驗證，直接規則是完美基準；GRU專題用來學pack與state，沒有宣稱這個任務需要遞迴。更複雜語意與長期依賴需另外設計資料與評估。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n預測明天事件，能否用明天已發生後的完整序列？答案：不能，須限定輸入截止時間。對句子分類可看全句，對逐token預測需causal規則，兩者mask不同。先畫時間與label對齊，再寫forward，比之後修一個維度更根本。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Sequence models](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html)\n- [Torch recurrent layers](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#recurrent-layers)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "序列資料：時間、順序、長度與預測位置", "html": "序列資料：時間、順序、長度與預測位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "tensor", "name": "不是多一個Tensor軸就完成", "html": "不是多一個Tensor軸就完成", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "時間與樣本的切分", "html": "時間與樣本的切分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "同一模型的不同輸出", "html": "同一模型的不同輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "shapebatch", "name": "Shape與batch規則", "html": "Shape與batch規則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "本課的生成任務", "html": "本課的生成任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "38-rnn", "group": "sequence", "title": "RNN：共享參數的遞迴與手動展開", "summary": "將同一組weights跨時間使用，理解hidden state如何傳遞。", "tags": ["RNN", "recurrent", "hidden state", "unroll"], "example": "26_rnn.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"rnn\">RNN：共享參數的遞迴與手動展開</h1>\n<p>將同一組weights跨時間使用，理解hidden state如何傳遞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">每一步讀一個位置</h2>\n<p>hidden state結合目前輸入與上一個state；相同參數跨時間共享，長度變動不需新增一套weights。它是一個可學遞迴規則，狀態是否保存足夠資訊取決於容量、目標與最佳化，不自動等於完整記住所有歷史。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nh_t=\\tanh(W_{xh}x_t+W_{hh}h_{t-1}+b),\\qquad y_t=g(h_t)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">展開後是一張計算圖</h2>\n<p>把t=1..T展開，會看到同一W被多次使用。反向時各時間對共享weights的貢獻相加。這與每個時間建一個獨立Linear不同，後者參數與泛化假設都改變，也無法自然支援任意長度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"torchbias\">對照Torch的兩個bias</h2>\n<p>nn.RNN實作可有bias_ih與bias_hh，合起來對應簡化公式b。第26例讀取同一個model的weight_ih、weight_hh與bias，手工迴圈tanh，再與原RNN輸出與last state比。沒有將兩個bias漏掉來解釋對不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">方向與使用條件</h2>\n<p>雙向RNN利用前後文，適合能看完整序列的任務；若線上預測當下卻使用未來反向state，會違反資訊邊界。stateful處理需保證主體／時間銜接，不能把shuffle batch上一筆hidden當下一個無關樣本的歷史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>input[2,4,1]、hidden3、單層單向，output[2,4,3]，h_n[1,2,3]。解答：batch_first只改input/output布局，hidden仍按指定契約。初始hidden為0是一種起點，若要learned initial state或跨窗保存，也需清楚設計梯度與reset政策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/26_rnn.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Manually unroll the same weights as torch.nn.RNN.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">RNN</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">batch_first</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">last</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">t</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tanh</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"nd\">@model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight_ih_l0</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bias_ih_l0</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"nd\">@model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight_hh_l0</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bias_hh_l0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;output_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;hidden_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">last</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;manual_unroll_maximum_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.RNN.html\">Torch RNN</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html\">遞迴網路原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# RNN：共享參數的遞迴與手動展開\n\n將同一組weights跨時間使用，理解hidden state如何傳遞。\n\n## 每一步讀一個位置\n\nhidden state結合目前輸入與上一個state；相同參數跨時間共享，長度變動不需新增一套weights。它是一個可學遞迴規則，狀態是否保存足夠資訊取決於容量、目標與最佳化，不自動等於完整記住所有歷史。\n\n$$\nh_t=\\tanh(W_{xh}x_t+W_{hh}h_{t-1}+b),\\qquad y_t=g(h_t)\n$$\n\n## 展開後是一張計算圖\n\n把t=1..T展開，會看到同一W被多次使用。反向時各時間對共享weights的貢獻相加。這與每個時間建一個獨立Linear不同，後者參數與泛化假設都改變，也無法自然支援任意長度。\n\n## 對照Torch的兩個bias\n\nnn.RNN實作可有bias_ih與bias_hh，合起來對應簡化公式b。第26例讀取同一個model的weight_ih、weight_hh與bias，手工迴圈tanh，再與原RNN輸出與last state比。沒有將兩個bias漏掉來解釋對不上。\n\n## 方向與使用條件\n\n雙向RNN利用前後文，適合能看完整序列的任務；若線上預測當下卻使用未來反向state，會違反資訊邊界。stateful處理需保證主體／時間銜接，不能把shuffle batch上一筆hidden當下一個無關樣本的歷史。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ninput[2,4,1]、hidden3、單層單向，output[2,4,3]，h_n[1,2,3]。解答：batch_first只改input/output布局，hidden仍按指定契約。初始hidden為0是一種起點，若要learned initial state或跨窗保存，也需清楚設計梯度與reset政策。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/26_rnn.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Manually unroll the same weights as torch.nn.RNN.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    model=nn.RNN(1,3,batch_first=True)\n    x=torch.randn(2,4,1);automatic,last=model(x)\n    h=torch.zeros(2,3);rows=[]\n    for t in range(x.shape[1]):\n        h=torch.tanh(x[:,t]@model.weight_ih_l0.t()+model.bias_ih_l0+h@model.weight_hh_l0.t()+model.bias_hh_l0)\n        rows.append(h)\n    manual=torch.stack(rows,1)\n    result={'output_shape':list(automatic.shape),'hidden_shape':list(last.shape),\n            'manual_unroll_maximum_error':(manual-automatic).abs().max()}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Torch RNN](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.RNN.html)\n- [遞迴網路原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "rnn", "name": "RNN：共享參數的遞迴與手動展開", "html": "RNN：共享參數的遞迴與手動展開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "每一步讀一個位置", "html": "每一步讀一個位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "展開後是一張計算圖", "html": "展開後是一張計算圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "torchbias", "name": "對照Torch的兩個bias", "html": "對照Torch的兩個bias", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "方向與使用條件", "html": "方向與使用條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "39-bptt", "group": "sequence", "title": "BPTT：跨時間反向傳播與截斷", "summary": "在共享參數與長鏈之間，分清記憶狀態與梯度歷史。", "tags": ["BPTT", "truncated BPTT", "detach", "gradient flow"], "html": "<h1 id=\"bptt\">BPTT：跨時間反向傳播與截斷</h1>\n<p>在共享參數與長鏈之間，分清記憶狀態與梯度歷史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"weights\">共享weights的梯度來自所有時間</h2>\n<p>loss可出現在最後一步或每一步；每個loss透過後續state影響前面weights。反向展開沿時間圖傳遞，將同一參數的多次使用累加。若每步都重新建模型，就不再是同樣RNN，也失去這個共享結構。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial h_t}=\\frac{\\partial\\ell_t}{\\partial h_t}+\n\\left(\\frac{\\partial h_{t+1}}{\\partial h_t}\\right)^T\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial h_{t+1}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">消失與爆炸</h2>\n<p>多次recurrent Jacobian乘積與activation導數，使長距訊號難傳。clipping可控制爆大norm，不能保證長距依賴被學到。RNN的問題也受序列長度、初始化、target位置與資料訊號影響，不只是參數少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"truncated-bptt\">Truncated BPTT改哪一條路</h2>\n<p>保留hidden數值繼續forward，但detach切斷跨前一段的梯度，限制backward跨度與記憶體。不是把記憶值歸零；也不是仍有完整長期credit assignment。選截斷長度是在計算與學習依賴之間取捨。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"n\">continued</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">continued</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">continued</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>值仍可延續，路徑已切。真實網路還有新段自己的parameters，所以新loss仍可對該段weights求導，與這個純常數片段不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">資料順序與標籤</h2>\n<p>stateful分段要按同一來源與時間續接，換用戶或序列結束需reset。先predict再更新的線上評估需處理label延遲；不能訓練過該段後再叫未見評估。若用bidirectional或全窗正規化，也要確認是否引入未來。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>detach hidden是否讓模型忘記所有過去？答案：數值仍包含過去資訊，但無法用當前loss將梯度傳回截斷前。若用zero hidden則數值記憶也清掉。分清兩者，才能正確設計串流與長序列實驗，而不是每次錯誤都加detach。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html\">BPTT與序列模型</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd圖</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# BPTT：跨時間反向傳播與截斷\n\n在共享參數與長鏈之間，分清記憶狀態與梯度歷史。\n\n## 共享weights的梯度來自所有時間\n\nloss可出現在最後一步或每一步；每個loss透過後續state影響前面weights。反向展開沿時間圖傳遞，將同一參數的多次使用累加。若每步都重新建模型，就不再是同樣RNN，也失去這個共享結構。\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial h_t}=\\frac{\\partial\\ell_t}{\\partial h_t}+\n\\left(\\frac{\\partial h_{t+1}}{\\partial h_t}\\right)^T\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial h_{t+1}}\n$$\n\n## 消失與爆炸\n\n多次recurrent Jacobian乘積與activation導數，使長距訊號難傳。clipping可控制爆大norm，不能保證長距依賴被學到。RNN的問題也受序列長度、初始化、target位置與資料訊號影響，不只是參數少。\n\n## Truncated BPTT改哪一條路\n\n保留hidden數值繼續forward，但detach切斷跨前一段的梯度，限制backward跨度與記憶體。不是把記憶值歸零；也不是仍有完整長期credit assignment。選截斷長度是在計算與學習依賴之間取捨。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nh=torch.tensor(1.,requires_grad=True)\nfirst=2*h\ncontinued=3*first.detach()\nprint(first.item(),continued.item(),continued.requires_grad)\n```\n\n值仍可延續，路徑已切。真實網路還有新段自己的parameters，所以新loss仍可對該段weights求導，與這個純常數片段不同。\n\n## 資料順序與標籤\n\nstateful分段要按同一來源與時間續接，換用戶或序列結束需reset。先predict再更新的線上評估需處理label延遲；不能訓練過該段後再叫未見評估。若用bidirectional或全窗正規化，也要確認是否引入未來。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ndetach hidden是否讓模型忘記所有過去？答案：數值仍包含過去資訊，但無法用當前loss將梯度傳回截斷前。若用zero hidden則數值記憶也清掉。分清兩者，才能正確設計串流與長序列實驗，而不是每次錯誤都加detach。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [BPTT與序列模型](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/rnn.html)\n- [Autograd圖](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "bptt", "name": "BPTT：跨時間反向傳播與截斷", "html": "BPTT：跨時間反向傳播與截斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "weights", "name": "共享weights的梯度來自所有時間", "html": "共享weights的梯度來自所有時間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "消失與爆炸", "html": "消失與爆炸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "truncated-bptt", "name": "Truncated BPTT改哪一條路", "html": "Truncated BPTT改哪一條路", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "資料順序與標籤", "html": "資料順序與標籤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "40-gates", "group": "sequence", "title": "LSTM與GRU：用gate控制更新與記憶", "summary": "理解cell state、忘記與讀寫門，以及框架公式的細節。", "tags": ["LSTM", "GRU", "gates", "cell state"], "example": "27_lstm_gru.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"lstmgrugate\">LSTM與GRU：用gate控制更新與記憶</h1>\n<p>理解cell state、忘記與讀寫門，以及框架公式的細節。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lstm\">LSTM的狀態分工</h2>\n<p>LSTM以forget、input、output gates控制cell路徑。候選g由tanh，c把前記憶與新候選加總，h再由output gate讀出。gate是由輸入與舊hidden學出的0..1值，不是手工固定的開關。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nc_t=f_t\\odot c_{t-1}+i_t\\odot g_t,\\qquad\nh_t=o_t\\odot\\tanh(c_t)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"lstmgate\">把LSTM各個gate展開</h2>\n<p>以下採單筆column-vector記號，W乘目前輸入、U乘舊hidden，b把兩個偏置的效果合寫。各gate長度都等於hidden size，⊙是逐元素相乘，不是矩陣乘法。PyTorch把四組轉換打包以便計算，但邏輯仍是這些式子。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ni_t&amp;=\\sigma(W_ix_t+U_ih_{t-1}+b_i),\\\\\nf_t&amp;=\\sigma(W_fx_t+U_fh_{t-1}+b_f),\\\\\ng_t&amp;=\\tanh(W_gx_t+U_gh_{t-1}+b_g),\\\\\no_t&amp;=\\sigma(W_ox_t+U_oh_{t-1}+b_o).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$</div>\n<p>一維手算：舊cell為2、forget=.8、input=.1、候選=.5，新cell為1.65；若output=.6，hidden就是.6×tanh(1.65)。cell可以保留大於1的數值，hidden則在此標準形式經tanh限制，不能把兩者當同一張量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為何有助長依賴</h2>\n<p>直接cell路徑提供受控加法與乘forget gate的通道，比只有反覆tanh與矩陣乘有不同梯度結構。但gate本身相依於hidden，完整導數不只一個f；也不保證任意長序列完全無消失或資料需求消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gru\">GRU較合併的設計</h2>\n<p>GRU以reset與update調整候選與舊state比例，沒有另外cell state。不同論文／框架gate命名或候選reset位置可能不同；讀Torch公式再手工核對，不把一個圖的z意義無條件搬用。PyTorch的候選計算對reset位置有明確說明。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_t&amp;=\\sigma(W_{ir}x_t+b_{ir}+W_{hr}h_{t-1}+b_{hr}),\\\\\nz_t&amp;=\\sigma(W_{iz}x_t+b_{iz}+W_{hz}h_{t-1}+b_{hz}),\\\\\nn_t&amp;=\\tanh(W_{in}x_t+b_{in}+r_t\\odot(W_{hn}h_{t-1}+b_{hn})),\\\\\nh_t&amp;=(1-z_t)\\odot n_t+z_t\\odot h_{t-1}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$</div>\n<p>這裡採PyTorch的GRU候選公式。z接近1偏向保留舊hidden，接近0偏向新候選；reset放在hidden線性轉換之後，不能任意改為W乘(r⊙h)還聲稱完全相同。除非有特殊結構，矩陣乘與逐元素乘不交換。</p>\n<h2 id=\"state\">實際state契約</h2>\n<p>第27例input[2,5,3]、hidden4、batch_first，兩者output[2,5,4]；LSTM回(h_n,c_n)兩個[1,2,4]，GRU一個hidden。例子真的backward，確認weights得到有限梯度，沒有把只印模型結構當運作驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">何時選擇</h2>\n<p>資料量、延遲、序列長度與所需上下文決定；不能因gate多就必然更準。比較RNN／GRU／LSTM時固定split、合理參數與調參預算，記錄state reset、padding與是否雙向。Attention提供另一種連接方式，下篇再比較機制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>LSTM輸出是tuple，直接拿tuple.shape會錯；解答：分開output與state，再分h/c。若模型只需最後有效hidden，對變長batch使用pack或明確mask，不拿PAD後最右位置。截斷hidden時LSTM的h與c都要依設計處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/27_lstm_gru.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;LSTM and GRU output/state contracts with real backward.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">kind</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;LSTM&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LSTM</span><span class=\"p\">),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;GRU&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">GRU</span><span class=\"p\">)]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">kind</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">batch_first</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">state</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">tuple</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;output_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;state_shapes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">s</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                      <span class=\"s1\">&#39;finite_gradients&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span> <span class=\"ow\">is</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span> <span class=\"ow\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isfinite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">())}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.LSTM.html\">LSTM API與公式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html\">GRU API與公式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.1078\">GRU原始研究</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# LSTM與GRU：用gate控制更新與記憶\n\n理解cell state、忘記與讀寫門，以及框架公式的細節。\n\n## LSTM的狀態分工\n\nLSTM以forget、input、output gates控制cell路徑。候選g由tanh，c把前記憶與新候選加總，h再由output gate讀出。gate是由輸入與舊hidden學出的0..1值，不是手工固定的開關。\n\n$$\nc_t=f_t\\odot c_{t-1}+i_t\\odot g_t,\\qquad\nh_t=o_t\\odot\\tanh(c_t)\n$$\n\n## 把LSTM各個gate展開\n\n以下採單筆column-vector記號，W乘目前輸入、U乘舊hidden，b把兩個偏置的效果合寫。各gate長度都等於hidden size，⊙是逐元素相乘，不是矩陣乘法。PyTorch把四組轉換打包以便計算，但邏輯仍是這些式子。\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ni_t&=\\sigma(W_ix_t+U_ih_{t-1}+b_i),\\\\\nf_t&=\\sigma(W_fx_t+U_fh_{t-1}+b_f),\\\\\ng_t&=\\tanh(W_gx_t+U_gh_{t-1}+b_g),\\\\\no_t&=\\sigma(W_ox_t+U_oh_{t-1}+b_o).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n一維手算：舊cell為2、forget=.8、input=.1、候選=.5，新cell為1.65；若output=.6，hidden就是.6×tanh(1.65)。cell可以保留大於1的數值，hidden則在此標準形式經tanh限制，不能把兩者當同一張量。\n\n## 為何有助長依賴\n\n直接cell路徑提供受控加法與乘forget gate的通道，比只有反覆tanh與矩陣乘有不同梯度結構。但gate本身相依於hidden，完整導數不只一個f；也不保證任意長序列完全無消失或資料需求消失。\n\n## GRU較合併的設計\n\nGRU以reset與update調整候選與舊state比例，沒有另外cell state。不同論文／框架gate命名或候選reset位置可能不同；讀Torch公式再手工核對，不把一個圖的z意義無條件搬用。PyTorch的候選計算對reset位置有明確說明。\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nr_t&=\\sigma(W_{ir}x_t+b_{ir}+W_{hr}h_{t-1}+b_{hr}),\\\\\nz_t&=\\sigma(W_{iz}x_t+b_{iz}+W_{hz}h_{t-1}+b_{hz}),\\\\\nn_t&=\\tanh(W_{in}x_t+b_{in}+r_t\\odot(W_{hn}h_{t-1}+b_{hn})),\\\\\nh_t&=(1-z_t)\\odot n_t+z_t\\odot h_{t-1}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n這裡採PyTorch的GRU候選公式。z接近1偏向保留舊hidden，接近0偏向新候選；reset放在hidden線性轉換之後，不能任意改為W乘(r⊙h)還聲稱完全相同。除非有特殊結構，矩陣乘與逐元素乘不交換。\n\n## 實際state契約\n\n第27例input[2,5,3]、hidden4、batch_first，兩者output[2,5,4]；LSTM回(h_n,c_n)兩個[1,2,4]，GRU一個hidden。例子真的backward，確認weights得到有限梯度，沒有把只印模型結構當運作驗證。\n\n## 何時選擇\n\n資料量、延遲、序列長度與所需上下文決定；不能因gate多就必然更準。比較RNN／GRU／LSTM時固定split、合理參數與調參預算，記錄state reset、padding與是否雙向。Attention提供另一種連接方式，下篇再比較機制。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nLSTM輸出是tuple，直接拿tuple.shape會錯；解答：分開output與state，再分h/c。若模型只需最後有效hidden，對變長batch使用pack或明確mask，不拿PAD後最右位置。截斷hidden時LSTM的h與c都要依設計處理。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/27_lstm_gru.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"LSTM and GRU output/state contracts with real backward.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x=torch.randn(2,5,3);result={}\n    for name,kind in [('LSTM',nn.LSTM),('GRU',nn.GRU)]:\n        model=kind(3,4,batch_first=True);output,state=model(x)\n        output.square().mean().backward()\n        states=state if isinstance(state,tuple) else (state,)\n        result[name]={'output_shape':list(output.shape),'state_shapes':[list(s.shape) for s in states],\n                      'finite_gradients':all(p.grad is not None and torch.isfinite(p.grad).all().item() for p in model.parameters())}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [LSTM API與公式](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.LSTM.html)\n- [GRU API與公式](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html)\n- [GRU原始研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.1078)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "lstmgrugate", "name": "LSTM與GRU：用gate控制更新與記憶", "html": "LSTM與GRU：用gate控制更新與記憶", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "lstm", "name": "LSTM的狀態分工", "html": "LSTM的狀態分工", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "lstmgate", "name": "把LSTM各個gate展開", "html": "把LSTM各個gate展開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為何有助長依賴", "html": "為何有助長依賴", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gru", "name": "GRU較合併的設計", "html": "GRU較合併的設計", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "state", "name": "實際state契約", "html": "實際state契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "何時選擇", "html": "何時選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 7}, {"id": "41-embedding-mask", "group": "sequence", "title": "Embedding、Padding與Mask：索引如何成為表示", "summary": "把詞表、特殊ID與有效長度寫成可測契約。", "tags": ["Embedding", "padding", "mask", "pooling", "token IDs"], "example": "28_embedding_mask.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"embeddingpaddingmask\">Embedding、Padding與Mask：索引如何成為表示</h1>\n<p>把詞表、特殊ID與有效長度寫成可測契約。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">查表而不是連續數值</h2>\n<p>token ID是離散索引，Embedding(V,D)回傳對應列，輸入long[N,T]→[N,T,D]。ID3不表示比ID2語意多一單位，不能直接當普通float特徵。詞表版本、PAD／UNK與清理規則是模型的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pad\">PAD列與平均分母</h2>\n<p>padding_idx=0讓對應列在一般訓練不更新；若做mean pooling，仍需只除有效token數。補零後對所有T平均會讓短句表示依PAD量改變。全空序列要明確拒絕或設計EMPTY規則，不默默除0。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nu_i=\\frac{\\sum_t m_{i,t}e_{i,t}}{\\sum_t m_{i,t}}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本章兩項不變性檢查</h2>\n<p>第28例用[1,2,0,0]與[3,4,5,0]，masked pooling；第一句與只取[1,2]平均相同，PAD列grad為0。這比單看shape更能捕捉常見錯誤。若有weight decay或另行手工更新特殊列，也需按實際optimizer規則檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mask\">長度與mask不能互相猜測</h2>\n<p>core raw序列只允許1..8，collate才加入0 PAD，所以長度明確。若合法token本身也可0，就不能再用tokens!=0推mask。Attention、loss與pooling對bool True的語意各有契約，不看名稱直接共用很危險。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">表示的能力</h2>\n<p>mean pooling忽略順序，[1,2]與[2,1]相同；RNN／位置化Attention可引入順序。Embedding只是可學向量，不含自動預訓練語意；本課小詞表從隨機初值開始，沒有下載語言模型或聲稱理解自然語言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>給定兩個向量[2,0]、[0,2]，有效mean為[1,1]，加兩個PAD仍應相同。若變[.5,.5]，分母用了4。解答：檢查mask、有效長度及全空政策；換詞表時同維度不代表同ID意義，需一起版本化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/28_embedding_mask.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Masked pooling and padding-row gradients.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Embedding</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">padding_idx</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ne</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">pooled</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hidden</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unsqueeze</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">keepdim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">pooled</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pooled&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">pooled</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pad_gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;short_sequence_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">pooled</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers\">Embedding與sparse layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html\">表示學習背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Embedding、Padding與Mask：索引如何成為表示\n\n把詞表、特殊ID與有效長度寫成可測契約。\n\n## 查表而不是連續數值\n\ntoken ID是離散索引，Embedding(V,D)回傳對應列，輸入long[N,T]→[N,T,D]。ID3不表示比ID2語意多一單位，不能直接當普通float特徵。詞表版本、PAD／UNK與清理規則是模型的一部分。\n\n## PAD列與平均分母\n\npadding_idx=0讓對應列在一般訓練不更新；若做mean pooling，仍需只除有效token數。補零後對所有T平均會讓短句表示依PAD量改變。全空序列要明確拒絕或設計EMPTY規則，不默默除0。\n\n$$\nu_i=\\frac{\\sum_t m_{i,t}e_{i,t}}{\\sum_t m_{i,t}}\n$$\n\n## 本章兩項不變性檢查\n\n第28例用[1,2,0,0]與[3,4,5,0]，masked pooling；第一句與只取[1,2]平均相同，PAD列grad為0。這比單看shape更能捕捉常見錯誤。若有weight decay或另行手工更新特殊列，也需按實際optimizer規則檢查。\n\n## 長度與mask不能互相猜測\n\ncore raw序列只允許1..8，collate才加入0 PAD，所以長度明確。若合法token本身也可0，就不能再用tokens!=0推mask。Attention、loss與pooling對bool True的語意各有契約，不看名稱直接共用很危險。\n\n## 表示的能力\n\nmean pooling忽略順序，[1,2]與[2,1]相同；RNN／位置化Attention可引入順序。Embedding只是可學向量，不含自動預訓練語意；本課小詞表從隨機初值開始，沒有下載語言模型或聲稱理解自然語言。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n給定兩個向量[2,0]、[0,2]，有效mean為[1,1]，加兩個PAD仍應相同。若變[.5,.5]，分母用了4。解答：檢查mask、有效長度及全空政策；換詞表時同維度不代表同ID意義，需一起版本化。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/28_embedding_mask.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Masked pooling and padding-row gradients.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    embedding=nn.Embedding(9,4,padding_idx=0)\n    tokens=torch.tensor([[1,2,0,0],[3,4,5,0]])\n    mask=tokens.ne(0);hidden=embedding(tokens)\n    pooled=(hidden*mask.unsqueeze(-1)).sum(1)/mask.sum(1,keepdim=True)\n    pooled.square().sum().backward()\n    result={'pooled':pooled,'pad_gradient':embedding.weight.grad[0],\n            'short_sequence_error':(pooled[0]-embedding(torch.tensor([1,2])).mean(0)).abs().max()}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Embedding與sparse layers](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers)\n- [表示學習背景](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "embeddingpaddingmask", "name": "Embedding、Padding與Mask：索引如何成為表示", "html": "Embedding、Padding與Mask：索引如何成為表示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "查表而不是連續數值", "html": "查表而不是連續數值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pad", "name": "PAD列與平均分母", "html": "PAD列與平均分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本章兩項不變性檢查", "html": "本章兩項不變性檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "mask", "name": "長度與mask不能互相猜測", "html": "長度與mask不能互相猜測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "表示的能力", "html": "表示的能力", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "42-sequence-training", "group": "sequence", "title": "變長序列完整專案：Embedding到GRU分類", "summary": "真正處理collate、pack、train/val/test與最後有效state。", "tags": ["sequence project", "GRU", "pack_padded_sequence", "collate"], "example": "29_sequence_project.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"embeddinggru\">變長序列完整專案：Embedding到GRU分類</h1>\n<p>真正處理collate、pack、train/val/test與最後有效state。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">可知答案的任務</h2>\n<p>生成240筆，長度2..7，token1..8，答案為最後token&gt;=5。144train、48val、48test。直接看最後ID已有完美規則，所以此專題不是為GRU證明優勢，而是讓你核對變長資料、表示與更新是否正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"collate\">Collate與模型</h2>\n<p>collate回tokens[N,T]、lengths[N]與labels[N]。Embedding9×8，GRU hidden12，head12→2。pack_padded_sequence使用lengths CPU、enforce_sorted=False，讓每筆最後有效state對齊，不讓額外PAD參與遞迴。回傳h_n[-1]再分類。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">資料與模式</h2>\n<p>raw sequence拒絕空與ID0，0只作PAD；length不可超過T。train shuffle、workers0，eval使用不記錄模式並還原training。保存val最低loss weights，固定預算結束才test。這些都是與影像／表格相同的學習邊界，只是batch契約不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">測試關鍵行為</h2>\n<p>對[1,2]與[1,2,0,0]、相同有效length2，model輸出應相同。若使用普通RNN直到T最後，PAD可能改state；若length排序與label錯位，也可能看到學不會。先單筆核對，再看整體loss，不只反覆增加hidden。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">銜接更真實任務</h2>\n<p>自然語言需tokenizer、詞表與未知規則，時間序列需真實時間切分與可用特徵；整段分類可雙向，線上逐步預測不能偷用未來。這些問題不因pack API成功就自動解決。模型及資料卡應說清任務與基準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把label改成第一token&gt;=5，再比較長度增加後GRU是否較難學；解答：它改變信用分配距離，需新的受控實驗與直接基準，不能沿用前任務test成績。切換LSTM時forward state型態也要調整，並保留padding不變性測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/29_sequence_project.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Variable-length GRU classification on a known last-token rule.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sequence&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;target is last token &gt;=5; a direct rule is a perfect baseline, GRU is an implementation exercise&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.utils.rnn.pack_padded_sequence.html\">Packed sequences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html\">GRU</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 變長序列完整專案：Embedding到GRU分類\n\n真正處理collate、pack、train/val/test與最後有效state。\n\n## 可知答案的任務\n\n生成240筆，長度2..7，token1..8，答案為最後token>=5。144train、48val、48test。直接看最後ID已有完美規則，所以此專題不是為GRU證明優勢，而是讓你核對變長資料、表示與更新是否正確。\n\n## Collate與模型\n\ncollate回tokens[N,T]、lengths[N]與labels[N]。Embedding9×8，GRU hidden12，head12→2。pack_padded_sequence使用lengths CPU、enforce_sorted=False，讓每筆最後有效state對齊，不讓額外PAD參與遞迴。回傳h_n[-1]再分類。\n\n## 資料與模式\n\nraw sequence拒絕空與ID0，0只作PAD；length不可超過T。train shuffle、workers0，eval使用不記錄模式並還原training。保存val最低loss weights，固定預算結束才test。這些都是與影像／表格相同的學習邊界，只是batch契約不同。\n\n## 測試關鍵行為\n\n對[1,2]與[1,2,0,0]、相同有效length2，model輸出應相同。若使用普通RNN直到T最後，PAD可能改state；若length排序與label錯位，也可能看到學不會。先單筆核對，再看整體loss，不只反覆增加hidden。\n\n## 銜接更真實任務\n\n自然語言需tokenizer、詞表與未知規則，時間序列需真實時間切分與可用特徵；整段分類可雙向，線上逐步預測不能偷用未來。這些問題不因pack API成功就自動解決。模型及資料卡應說清任務與基準。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把label改成第一token>=5，再比較長度增加後GRU是否較難學；解答：它改變信用分配距離，需新的受控實驗與直接基準，不能沿用前任務test成績。切換LSTM時forward state型態也要調整，並保留padding不變性測試。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/29_sequence_project.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Variable-length GRU classification on a known last-token rule.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import experiment\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    run=experiment('sequence')\n    result={'initial_validation':run['initial_validation'],'best_validation':run['best_validation'],'test':run['test'],\n            'scope':'target is last token >=5; a direct rule is a perfect baseline, GRU is an implementation exercise'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Packed sequences](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.utils.rnn.pack_padded_sequence.html)\n- [GRU](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "embeddinggru", "name": "變長序列完整專案：Embedding到GRU分類", "html": "變長序列完整專案：Embedding到GRU分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "可知答案的任務", "html": "可知答案的任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "collate", "name": "Collate與模型", "html": "Collate與模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "資料與模式", "html": "資料與模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "測試關鍵行為", "html": "測試關鍵行為", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "銜接更真實任務", "html": "銜接更真實任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "43-attention", "group": "attention", "title": "Attention：Query、Key、Value與縮放內積", "summary": "用一個小矩陣手算權重，理解內容相依的資訊聚合。", "tags": ["attention", "QKV", "scaled dot product", "softmax"], "example": "30_attention.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"attentionquerykeyvalue\">Attention：Query、Key、Value與縮放內積</h1>\n<p>用一個小矩陣手算權重，理解內容相依的資訊聚合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">從固定摘要到選擇性讀取</h2>\n<p>Query表示目前想找的條件，Key提供可比對特徵，Value是要被聚合的內容。它們可以由相同或不同資料透過可學投影取得。Attention是加權讀取機制，不等於神經模型的完整推理或人類注意力。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nS=\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}},\\qquad A=\\mathrm{softmax}_{keys}(S),\\qquad O=AV\n$$</div>\n<p>Q[L,d_k]、K[S,d_k]、V[S,d_v]，權重[L,S]，輸出[L,d_v]。每個query row沿keys正規化，不跨batch或任意feature軸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sqrtd_k\">為什麼除sqrt(d_k)</h2>\n<p>在部分獨立尺度近似下，內積隨維度的變異增加，可能讓softmax過於尖銳、梯度不利。縮放是一種控制logits尺度的設計，仍受表示分布與norm影響；不能把它當所有attention都必用相同公式的定理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">真正數值對照</h2>\n<p>第30例生成double Q/K/V、算softmax與AV，再比F.scaled_dot_product_attention(dropout_p=0)。每row sum為1，輸出誤差接近精度。CPU驗證只保證這個數學契約，沒有報FlashAttention或GPU速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">權重如何解讀</h2>\n<p>大權重表示此層此head在當下混合較多某value，不自動是因果重要性。還有投影、其他head、FFN與residual路徑。若要解釋整個預測，不能只畫一張attention熱圖就說找到了唯一理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>QK logits全相同，權重均勻，輸出是values平均。若某key被mask則需先排除再正規化，不是在softmax後隨意設零而忘記重新歸一。空可見集合需明確政策，下一章用future invariance測causal實作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/30_attention.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Manual scaled dot-product attention checked against the current PyTorch API.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"nd\">@k</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transpose</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">softmax</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"nd\">@v</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">scaled_dot_product_attention</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dropout_p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;weights&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;row_sums&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">manual</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">automatic</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\">Attention原始Transformer研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention.html\">Scaled dot-product API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.0473\">早期encoder-decoder attention</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Attention：Query、Key、Value與縮放內積\n\n用一個小矩陣手算權重，理解內容相依的資訊聚合。\n\n## 從固定摘要到選擇性讀取\n\nQuery表示目前想找的條件，Key提供可比對特徵，Value是要被聚合的內容。它們可以由相同或不同資料透過可學投影取得。Attention是加權讀取機制，不等於神經模型的完整推理或人類注意力。\n\n$$\nS=\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}},\\qquad A=\\mathrm{softmax}_{keys}(S),\\qquad O=AV\n$$\n\nQ[L,d_k]、K[S,d_k]、V[S,d_v]，權重[L,S]，輸出[L,d_v]。每個query row沿keys正規化，不跨batch或任意feature軸。\n\n## 為什麼除sqrt(d_k)\n\n在部分獨立尺度近似下，內積隨維度的變異增加，可能讓softmax過於尖銳、梯度不利。縮放是一種控制logits尺度的設計，仍受表示分布與norm影響；不能把它當所有attention都必用相同公式的定理。\n\n## 真正數值對照\n\n第30例生成double Q/K/V、算softmax與AV，再比F.scaled_dot_product_attention(dropout_p=0)。每row sum為1，輸出誤差接近精度。CPU驗證只保證這個數學契約，沒有報FlashAttention或GPU速度。\n\n## 權重如何解讀\n\n大權重表示此層此head在當下混合較多某value，不自動是因果重要性。還有投影、其他head、FFN與residual路徑。若要解釋整個預測，不能只畫一張attention熱圖就說找到了唯一理由。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nQK logits全相同，權重均勻，輸出是values平均。若某key被mask則需先排除再正規化，不是在softmax後隨意設零而忘記重新歸一。空可見集合需明確政策，下一章用future invariance測causal實作。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/30_attention.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Manual scaled dot-product attention checked against the current PyTorch API.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    q=torch.randn(1,1,3,2,dtype=torch.double)\n    k=torch.randn(1,1,3,2,dtype=torch.double);v=torch.randn(1,1,3,2,dtype=torch.double)\n    weights=(q@k.transpose(-2,-1)/(q.shape[-1]**.5)).softmax(-1)\n    manual=weights@v\n    automatic=F.scaled_dot_product_attention(q,k,v,dropout_p=0.)\n    result={'weights':weights,'row_sums':weights.sum(-1),'maximum_error':(manual-automatic).abs().max()}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Attention原始Transformer研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)\n- [Scaled dot-product API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention.html)\n- [早期encoder-decoder attention](https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.0473)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "attentionquerykeyvalue", "name": "Attention：Query、Key、Value與縮放內積", "html": "Attention：Query、Key、Value與縮放內積", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "從固定摘要到選擇性讀取", "html": "從固定摘要到選擇性讀取", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "sqrtd_k", "name": "為什麼除sqrt(d_k)", "html": "為什麼除sqrt(d_k)", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "真正數值對照", "html": "真正數值對照", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "權重如何解讀", "html": "權重如何解讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "44-attention-masks", "group": "attention", "title": "Self、Cross與Causal Mask：防止未來資訊滲漏", "summary": "用擾動未來value的實驗，驗證能看見的位置是否符合任務。", "tags": ["self attention", "cross attention", "causal mask", "padding mask"], "example": "31_causal_mask.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"selfcrosscausal-mask\">Self、Cross與Causal Mask：防止未來資訊滲漏</h1>\n<p>用擾動未來value的實驗，驗證能看見的位置是否符合任務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">來源與可見範圍</h2>\n<p>self-attention的Q/K/V來自同一序列，cross-attention的Q來自一段、K/V來自另一來源。能否看未來由任務決定：整句分類可全可見，下一token預測通常限制key位置j&lt;=query位置i。名稱本身不會替你加mask。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bool\">bool語意最容易相反</h2>\n<p>PyTorch F.scaled_dot_product_attention的bool True表示允許；nn.MultiheadAttention的bool attn_mask True表示禁止。兩者API契約相反，本課明確分開。padding mask、causal mask與float additive mask也有各自shape／組合規則，不能看到bool就直接搬用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mask\">正規化與全mask</h2>\n<p>手工實作通常將不可見logit設-inf後softmax，正常非空集合被遮項為0；若整row全-inf，普通softmax會有NaN，需處理無有效key政策。現成算子的邊界實作也需看版本，不把任意mask當一定有定義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">直接測未來不變性</h2>\n<p>第31例用lower-triangular allowed mask，將最後位置V加100，前3個輸出應完全不變；另比is_causal=True結果。這個測試比只看mask矩陣長得像三角更有力。若倒置True／False，可能仍產生有限值卻偷看未來。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dropouteval\">dropout與eval</h2>\n<p>functional SDPA的dropout_p由你明確提供，不能以為外部model.eval會替任意functional呼叫自動改成0。驗證固定0；模組版本則依其契約管理。mask、dropout、shape與快取在真實語言模型互相影響，完整生成／KV cache由Transformer課深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>L4的query第1個只能看key0；query最後可看0..3。解答：把每個query能看的索引寫出，再做擾動測試。若Q/K也改未來，前面的合法可見值依舊不該改；多層網路還需norm／其他運算不跨未來位置，第46章測完整小block。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/31_causal_mask.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;SDPA bool True means allowed; future values cannot affect earlier output.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">allowed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tril</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">scaled_dot_product_attention</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">attn_mask</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">allowed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dropout_p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"p\">[:,:,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">scaled_dot_product_attention</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">attn_mask</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">allowed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dropout_p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">causal</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">scaled_dot_product_attention</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">is_causal</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">dropout_p</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;early_positions_maximum_change&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">[:,:,:</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">[:,:,:</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;mask_vs_is_causal_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">causal</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;nn.MultiheadAttention bool mask uses True for blocked, the opposite convention&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention.html\">SDPA mask與dropout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html\">MHA mask語意</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Self、Cross與Causal Mask：防止未來資訊滲漏\n\n用擾動未來value的實驗，驗證能看見的位置是否符合任務。\n\n## 來源與可見範圍\n\nself-attention的Q/K/V來自同一序列，cross-attention的Q來自一段、K/V來自另一來源。能否看未來由任務決定：整句分類可全可見，下一token預測通常限制key位置j<=query位置i。名稱本身不會替你加mask。\n\n## bool語意最容易相反\n\nPyTorch F.scaled_dot_product_attention的bool True表示允許；nn.MultiheadAttention的bool attn_mask True表示禁止。兩者API契約相反，本課明確分開。padding mask、causal mask與float additive mask也有各自shape／組合規則，不能看到bool就直接搬用。\n\n## 正規化與全mask\n\n手工實作通常將不可見logit設-inf後softmax，正常非空集合被遮項為0；若整row全-inf，普通softmax會有NaN，需處理無有效key政策。現成算子的邊界實作也需看版本，不把任意mask當一定有定義。\n\n## 直接測未來不變性\n\n第31例用lower-triangular allowed mask，將最後位置V加100，前3個輸出應完全不變；另比is_causal=True結果。這個測試比只看mask矩陣長得像三角更有力。若倒置True／False，可能仍產生有限值卻偷看未來。\n\n## dropout與eval\n\nfunctional SDPA的dropout_p由你明確提供，不能以為外部model.eval會替任意functional呼叫自動改成0。驗證固定0；模組版本則依其契約管理。mask、dropout、shape與快取在真實語言模型互相影響，完整生成／KV cache由Transformer課深入。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nL4的query第1個只能看key0；query最後可看0..3。解答：把每個query能看的索引寫出，再做擾動測試。若Q/K也改未來，前面的合法可見值依舊不該改；多層網路還需norm／其他運算不跨未來位置，第46章測完整小block。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/31_causal_mask.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"SDPA bool True means allowed; future values cannot affect earlier output.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    q=torch.randn(1,1,4,3);k=torch.randn(1,1,4,3);v=torch.randn(1,1,4,3)\n    allowed=torch.ones(4,4,dtype=torch.bool).tril()\n    output=F.scaled_dot_product_attention(q,k,v,attn_mask=allowed,dropout_p=0.)\n    changed=v.clone();changed[:,:,3]+=100\n    after=F.scaled_dot_product_attention(q,k,changed,attn_mask=allowed,dropout_p=0.)\n    causal=F.scaled_dot_product_attention(q,k,v,is_causal=True,dropout_p=0.)\n    result={'early_positions_maximum_change':(output[:,:,:3]-after[:,:,:3]).abs().max(),\n            'mask_vs_is_causal_error':(causal-output).abs().max(),\n            'note':'nn.MultiheadAttention bool mask uses True for blocked, the opposite convention'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [SDPA mask與dropout](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention.html)\n- [MHA mask語意](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "selfcrosscausal-mask", "name": "Self、Cross與Causal Mask：防止未來資訊滲漏", "html": "Self、Cross與Causal Mask：防止未來資訊滲漏", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "來源與可見範圍", "html": "來源與可見範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "bool", "name": "bool語意最容易相反", "html": "bool語意最容易相反", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "mask", "name": "正規化與全mask", "html": "正規化與全mask", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "直接測未來不變性", "html": "直接測未來不變性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dropouteval", "name": "dropout與eval", "html": "dropout與eval", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "45-multihead-position", "group": "attention", "title": "Multi-head與位置資訊：多個子空間如何組合", "summary": "理解head拆分、投影與順序訊號，再銜接完整Transformer。", "tags": ["multihead", "position encoding", "permutation", "attention"], "html": "<h1 id=\"multi-head\">Multi-head與位置資訊：多個子空間如何組合</h1>\n<p>理解head拆分、投影與順序訊號，再銜接完整Transformer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"head\">多個head不是多個獨立答案</h2>\n<p>各head有自己的投影與加權讀取，輸出concat後再投影回模型維度。它讓模型可在不同子空間建關係，但不保證每個head都學到人可命名的語法角色。head數與每head維度共同影響參數、計算與容量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathrm{MHA}(X)=\\mathrm{Concat}(O_1,\\ldots,O_H)W_O\n$$</div>\n<p>常見設定d_model可被H整除，每head d_model/H。本課8維、2head，實作batch_first=True，避免把時間與batch顛倒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batchhead\">從batch一路追到每個head</h2>\n<p>輸入[B,T,8]，三個可學投影產生同形狀Q、K、V，再重排為[B,2,T,4]。QKᵀ得到[B,2,T,T]，沿最後的key軸softmax；乘V回[B,2,T,4]，合併head回[B,T,8]，最後經輸出投影。跨Attention時query長度Tq、key長度Tk可不同，權重矩陣改為[B,H,Tq,Tk]。</p>\n<p>2個head不是把序列切成前半和後半，而是拆每個token的表示維度。投影也不是單純切割原始特徵：不同head的可學線性組合，讓每個head可使用全部原始維度的資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">沒位置時的對稱性</h2>\n<p>不含位置等訊號的self-attention對重排有相應等變性，不能單靠內容任意辨識絕對次序。需加入位置embedding、sinusoidal或相對位置機制。causal mask也引入順序限制，但與所有位置表示不是同一功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本課位置範例的界線</h2>\n<p>第32例在小block輸入加手工sin(position/frequency)特徵，明確只為示意，不聲稱完整重現原論文所有sin/cos或現代LLM的RoPE。模型隨機初始化，沒有tokenizer、預訓練或生成能力；它只讓你測shape與causal結構。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sinusoidal\">原始sinusoidal位置公式</h2>\n<p>原始Transformer以成對sin／cos頻率編碼位置，將position與維度索引分清楚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{PE}_{p,2i}=\\sin\\left(p/10000^{2i/d}\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PE}_{p,2i+1}=\\cos\\left(p/10000^{2i/d}\\right).\n$$</div>\n<p>這是補充原論文定義，本課第32例的簡化手工sin特徵沒有冒充這組完整實作。可學絕對位置、相對位置與RoPE各有不同運作方式，完整推導及語言模型使用留在獨立Transformer課程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">成本的概念</h2>\n<p>一般dense attention權重涉及T×T，序列長度增加會影響時間／記憶體；不同kernel與sparse／linear等變體有不同取捨。CPU小例不能推論GPU吞吐，較新平台能力也不是架構原理的替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>d_model8、heads2，每head4；若改heads3，標準等分方式不相容，不能靠reshape丟元素。解答：維度與投影要一致。下一章把MHA、FFN、norm與residual組起來，再用整block測未來不變，而非只列元件名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\">Transformer原論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html\">MultiheadAttention API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Multi-head與位置資訊：多個子空間如何組合\n\n理解head拆分、投影與順序訊號，再銜接完整Transformer。\n\n## 多個head不是多個獨立答案\n\n各head有自己的投影與加權讀取，輸出concat後再投影回模型維度。它讓模型可在不同子空間建關係，但不保證每個head都學到人可命名的語法角色。head數與每head維度共同影響參數、計算與容量。\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{MHA}(X)=\\mathrm{Concat}(O_1,\\ldots,O_H)W_O\n$$\n\n常見設定d_model可被H整除，每head d_model/H。本課8維、2head，實作batch_first=True，避免把時間與batch顛倒。\n\n## 從batch一路追到每個head\n\n輸入[B,T,8]，三個可學投影產生同形狀Q、K、V，再重排為[B,2,T,4]。QKᵀ得到[B,2,T,T]，沿最後的key軸softmax；乘V回[B,2,T,4]，合併head回[B,T,8]，最後經輸出投影。跨Attention時query長度Tq、key長度Tk可不同，權重矩陣改為[B,H,Tq,Tk]。\n\n2個head不是把序列切成前半和後半，而是拆每個token的表示維度。投影也不是單純切割原始特徵：不同head的可學線性組合，讓每個head可使用全部原始維度的資訊。\n\n## 沒位置時的對稱性\n\n不含位置等訊號的self-attention對重排有相應等變性，不能單靠內容任意辨識絕對次序。需加入位置embedding、sinusoidal或相對位置機制。causal mask也引入順序限制，但與所有位置表示不是同一功能。\n\n## 本課位置範例的界線\n\n第32例在小block輸入加手工sin(position/frequency)特徵，明確只為示意，不聲稱完整重現原論文所有sin/cos或現代LLM的RoPE。模型隨機初始化，沒有tokenizer、預訓練或生成能力；它只讓你測shape與causal結構。\n\n## 原始sinusoidal位置公式\n\n原始Transformer以成對sin／cos頻率編碼位置，將position與維度索引分清楚：\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{PE}_{p,2i}=\\sin\\left(p/10000^{2i/d}\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PE}_{p,2i+1}=\\cos\\left(p/10000^{2i/d}\\right).\n$$\n\n這是補充原論文定義，本課第32例的簡化手工sin特徵沒有冒充這組完整實作。可學絕對位置、相對位置與RoPE各有不同運作方式，完整推導及語言模型使用留在獨立Transformer課程。\n\n## 成本的概念\n\n一般dense attention權重涉及T×T，序列長度增加會影響時間／記憶體；不同kernel與sparse／linear等變體有不同取捨。CPU小例不能推論GPU吞吐，較新平台能力也不是架構原理的替代。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nd_model8、heads2，每head4；若改heads3，標準等分方式不相容，不能靠reshape丟元素。解答：維度與投影要一致。下一章把MHA、FFN、norm與residual組起來，再用整block測未來不變，而非只列元件名稱。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Transformer原論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)\n- [MultiheadAttention API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "multi-head", "name": "Multi-head與位置資訊：多個子空間如何組合", "html": "Multi-head與位置資訊：多個子空間如何組合", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "head", "name": "多個head不是多個獨立答案", "html": "多個head不是多個獨立答案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "batchhead", "name": "從batch一路追到每個head", "html": "從batch一路追到每個head", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "沒位置時的對稱性", "html": "沒位置時的對稱性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本課位置範例的界線", "html": "本課位置範例的界線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "sinusoidal", "name": "原始sinusoidal位置公式", "html": "原始sinusoidal位置公式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "成本的概念", "html": "成本的概念", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "46-transformer-bridge", "group": "attention", "title": "一個Transformer Block：Attention、FFN、Norm與Residual", "summary": "實際組合pre-norm causal block，建立通往完整模型課程的橋梁。", "tags": ["Transformer block", "pre norm", "FFN", "residual", "causality"], "example": "32_transformer_block.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"transformer-blockattentionffnnormresidual\">一個Transformer Block：Attention、FFN、Norm與Residual</h1>\n<p>實際組合pre-norm causal block，建立通往完整模型課程的橋梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">兩個主要子層</h2>\n<p>Attention在位置間交換內容；逐位置FFN做非線性特徵轉換；residual保留直接路，norm調整指定feature統計。單一block不是完整語言模型，還缺輸入tokenization、embedding／位置策略、輸出head、訓練目標與生成流程。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nU=X+\\mathrm{MHA}(\\mathrm{LN}(X)),\\qquad\nY=U+\\mathrm{FFN}(\\mathrm{LN}(U))\n$$</div>\n<p>本課採pre-norm；原論文post-norm與其他變體有不同路徑，不用此式代表所有Transformer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">小型實作</h2>\n<p>TinyBlock維度8、2head、FFN8→16→8加GELU，MHA dropout0、LayerNorm最後維度8。causal mask用MHA的True禁止上三角，need_weights=False。forward保持[N,T,8]，每個FFN獨立作用各位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"causal\">整體causal測試</h2>\n<p>第32例改最後token輸入，前3位置輸出不變。這同時覆蓋norm、residual與FFN的正確軸；若誤用跨整個T的LayerNorm，可能透過其他路徑洩漏。能通過Attention函式測試，不等於所有外層操作都causal。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rnn\">與RNN的差異</h2>\n<p>RNN以遞迴state串時間，Attention可在已知序列上平行建立內容關係，但一般有T²成本。生成逐步解碼時仍有自回歸與快取工程；不能因訓練可平行就說生成一次完成所有token。完整Transformer／LLM原理課將深入這些機制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>這個block輸出[2,4,8]，是否已能回答自然語言？答案：沒有；只是隨機參數的小運算模組。要分類可加pool/head並定資料／loss，要語言模型需詞表head與next-token目標。先明確任務，再判斷是否需要完整架構。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/32_transformer_block.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A tiny pre-norm causal block, not a pretrained language model.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyBlock</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">TinyBlock</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">changed</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;early_positions_maximum_change&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">[:,:</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">[:,:</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;8-dimensional block with handmade position features; no tokenizer, pretraining or generation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\">Transformer研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html\">MHA與mask</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 一個Transformer Block：Attention、FFN、Norm與Residual\n\n實際組合pre-norm causal block，建立通往完整模型課程的橋梁。\n\n## 兩個主要子層\n\nAttention在位置間交換內容；逐位置FFN做非線性特徵轉換；residual保留直接路，norm調整指定feature統計。單一block不是完整語言模型，還缺輸入tokenization、embedding／位置策略、輸出head、訓練目標與生成流程。\n\n$$\nU=X+\\mathrm{MHA}(\\mathrm{LN}(X)),\\qquad\nY=U+\\mathrm{FFN}(\\mathrm{LN}(U))\n$$\n\n本課採pre-norm；原論文post-norm與其他變體有不同路徑，不用此式代表所有Transformer。\n\n## 小型實作\n\nTinyBlock維度8、2head、FFN8→16→8加GELU，MHA dropout0、LayerNorm最後維度8。causal mask用MHA的True禁止上三角，need_weights=False。forward保持[N,T,8]，每個FFN獨立作用各位置。\n\n## 整體causal測試\n\n第32例改最後token輸入，前3位置輸出不變。這同時覆蓋norm、residual與FFN的正確軸；若誤用跨整個T的LayerNorm，可能透過其他路徑洩漏。能通過Attention函式測試，不等於所有外層操作都causal。\n\n## 與RNN的差異\n\nRNN以遞迴state串時間，Attention可在已知序列上平行建立內容關係，但一般有T²成本。生成逐步解碼時仍有自回歸與快取工程；不能因訓練可平行就說生成一次完成所有token。完整Transformer／LLM原理課將深入這些機制。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n這個block輸出[2,4,8]，是否已能回答自然語言？答案：沒有；只是隨機參數的小運算模組。要分類可加pool/head並定資料／loss，要語言模型需詞表head與next-token目標。先明確任務，再判斷是否需要完整架構。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/32_transformer_block.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A tiny pre-norm causal block, not a pretrained language model.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import TinyBlock\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    model=TinyBlock().eval();x=torch.randn(2,4,8)\n    position=torch.arange(4).float().reshape(1,4,1)\n    x=x+torch.sin(position/torch.arange(1,9).reshape(1,1,8))\n    changed=x.clone();changed[:,3]+=10\n    with torch.no_grad():output=model(x);after=model(changed)\n    result={'shape':list(output.shape),'early_positions_maximum_change':(output[:,:3]-after[:,:3]).abs().max(),\n            'scope':'8-dimensional block with handmade position features; no tokenizer, pretraining or generation'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Transformer研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)\n- [MHA與mask](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.MultiheadAttention.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "transformer-blockattentionffnnormresidual", "name": "一個Transformer Block：Attention、FFN、Norm與Residual", "html": "一個Transformer Block：Attention、FFN、Norm與Residual", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "兩個主要子層", "html": "兩個主要子層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "小型實作", "html": "小型實作", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "causal", "name": "整體causal測試", "html": "整體causal測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "rnn", "name": "與RNN的差異", "html": "與RNN的差異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "47-contrastive", "group": "attention", "title": "表示與對比學習：讓相似的定義來自任務", "summary": "從positive pairs、negative candidates到可微分的InfoNCE目標。", "tags": ["contrastive learning", "InfoNCE", "representation", "temperature"], "example": "33_contrastive.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">表示與對比學習：讓相似的定義來自任務</h1>\n<p>從positive pairs、negative candidates到可微分的InfoNCE目標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">學相似之前先定義相似</h2>\n<p>同一影像不同合理增強、同意句或相同實體可作positive，但規則要符合任務。不相關不一定是真negative，同topic不同樣本也可能false negative。標註／增強選擇定義表示偏好，loss本身不會替你理解哪些關係有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"in-batch\">In-batch候選與溫度</h2>\n<p>normalize後的向量內積形成相似度矩陣，對角為正配對，其他作候選負例；temperature縮放logits。較低溫增加相對差異與某些梯度，不保證所有情況更好。小batch的負例種類有限，需配合資料設計。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\ell_i=-\\log\\frac{\\exp(s(a_i,b_i)/\\tau)}{\\sum_j\\exp(s(a_i,b_j)/\\tau)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"collapse\">實作與collapse檢查</h2>\n<p>第33例雙向平均a→b與b→a，實際對兩組向量backward，列grad norm。所有向量相同時logits相同，loss=logN；這是數學核對，不表示collapse已被所有目標自動排除。零向量cosine語意不明，本課直接拒絕。</p>\n<h2 id=\"loss\">評估不只訓練loss</h2>\n<p>用下游分類／檢索、linear probe、近鄰、跨來源與多語等按任務評估。表示score不是正確率，維度相同不表示空間相同。若之後微調，索引與cache都可能要重建；embedding完整應用可讀既有獨立課。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>N4且所有logits相等，positive機率1/4、loss約1.386。解答：如果把loss報成「相似度86%」就搞錯量。新增負例可能使loss比較基準改變，不能跨不同candidate數直接以原始loss大小判斷表示品質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/33_contrastive.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Symmetric in-batch InfoNCE with actual feature gradients.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">contrastive_loss</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad_</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">contrastive_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">contrastive_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_view_gradient_norm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;second_view_gradient_norm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">norm</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;collapsed_equal_logits_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;expected_uniform_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">log</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">)))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.05709\">SimCLR原始研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html\">表示學習</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 表示與對比學習：讓相似的定義來自任務\n\n從positive pairs、negative candidates到可微分的InfoNCE目標。\n\n## 學相似之前先定義相似\n\n同一影像不同合理增強、同意句或相同實體可作positive，但規則要符合任務。不相關不一定是真negative，同topic不同樣本也可能false negative。標註／增強選擇定義表示偏好，loss本身不會替你理解哪些關係有用。\n\n## In-batch候選與溫度\n\nnormalize後的向量內積形成相似度矩陣，對角為正配對，其他作候選負例；temperature縮放logits。較低溫增加相對差異與某些梯度，不保證所有情況更好。小batch的負例種類有限，需配合資料設計。\n\n$$\n\\ell_i=-\\log\\frac{\\exp(s(a_i,b_i)/\\tau)}{\\sum_j\\exp(s(a_i,b_j)/\\tau)}\n$$\n\n## 實作與collapse檢查\n\n第33例雙向平均a→b與b→a，實際對兩組向量backward，列grad norm。所有向量相同時logits相同，loss=logN；這是數學核對，不表示collapse已被所有目標自動排除。零向量cosine語意不明，本課直接拒絕。\n\n## 評估不只訓練loss\n\n用下游分類／檢索、linear probe、近鄰、跨來源與多語等按任務評估。表示score不是正確率，維度相同不表示空間相同。若之後微調，索引與cache都可能要重建；embedding完整應用可讀既有獨立課。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nN4且所有logits相等，positive機率1/4、loss約1.386。解答：如果把loss報成「相似度86%」就搞錯量。新增負例可能使loss比較基準改變，不能跨不同candidate數直接以原始loss大小判斷表示品質。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/33_contrastive.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Symmetric in-batch InfoNCE with actual feature gradients.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import contrastive_loss\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    a=torch.randn(4,5,requires_grad=True);b=(a.detach()+.1*torch.randn(4,5)).requires_grad_()\n    loss=contrastive_loss(a,b,.2);loss.backward()\n    uniform=contrastive_loss(torch.ones(4,5),torch.ones(4,5),.2)\n    result={'loss':loss,'first_view_gradient_norm':a.grad.norm(),'second_view_gradient_norm':b.grad.norm(),\n            'collapsed_equal_logits_loss':uniform,'expected_uniform_loss':float(torch.log(torch.tensor(4.)))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [SimCLR原始研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.05709)\n- [表示學習](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "表示與對比學習：讓相似的定義來自任務", "html": "表示與對比學習：讓相似的定義來自任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "學相似之前先定義相似", "html": "學相似之前先定義相似", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "in-batch", "name": "In-batch候選與溫度", "html": "In-batch候選與溫度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "collapse", "name": "實作與collapse檢查", "html": "實作與collapse檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "loss", "name": "評估不只訓練loss", "html": "評估不只訓練loss", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "48-self-supervision", "group": "attention", "title": "自監督、預訓練與微調：目標如何塑造表示", "summary": "比較重建、遮罩預測、對比與蒸餾式方法的共同資料邊界。", "tags": ["self supervised", "pretraining", "masked prediction", "linear probe"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">自監督、預訓練與微調：目標如何塑造表示</h1>\n<p>比較重建、遮罩預測、對比與蒸餾式方法的共同資料邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"label\">沒有人工作業label仍有訓練目標</h2>\n<p>自監督從資料構造target，例如遮罩內容、不同view對應或下一位置。它降低對某種人工標籤的依賴，不代表完全沒有假設、清理成本或資料權限。模型可學到來源捷徑，也可能從預訓練資料記住評估內容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">幾種目標的差別</h2>\n<p>重建偏好保留可重建資訊，對比依positive／negative拉開關係，遮罩預測依上下文補內容，teacher-student方式依目標表示與穩定化策略。不同架構與目標可結合，不宜只用一個新方法名字代替流程說明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"collapse\">Collapse與防護機制</h2>\n<p>若所有表示相同仍能滿足某個過度簡單目標，會失去資訊。負例、停止梯度、動量teacher、variance／covariance限制等可在不同方法中使用，各有假設；不是只加detach就自動得到有效自監督學習。需要看原始目標與實際評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">表示與適應的評估</h2>\n<p>linear probe固定backbone只學線性head，fine-tune更新更多層，二者回答不同問題。公平比較要記預訓練資料、算力、下游label量與調參預算；較少下游epochs不代表總訓練成本較低。group/time與資料污染仍要檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">與本課範例的關係</h2>\n<p>第33例只測in-batch對比數學與grad，不宣稱重現完整SimCLR；AE／VAE篇實際學低維重建；第60章以小teacher/student示範distillation。這些讓你看見目標差異，之後可沿原始論文與獨立Embedding課深化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">自己設計一個檢查</h2>\n<p>若表示只記住拍攝設備，使用同設備的linear probe可能很好，換設備就失效。可以按資料來源分組切分，再比較within-source與held-out-source結果；同時查看表示是否幾乎相同、是否只分出來源而沒有任務訊號。這比只展示一張漂亮的二維投影更直接回答「表示是否有用」。預訓練中沒有下游label，也不會自動消除來源偏差或資料污染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>用同一圖片增強產生兩view，若增強改掉label語意，positive仍合理嗎？答案：不一定，會要求模型忽略你真正關心訊號。解答要連回下游任務、失敗樣本與表示評估，而不只看對比loss下降。模型學的是你設計的目標，不是自動知道你的用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.05709\">SimCLR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html\">Representation learning</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 自監督、預訓練與微調：目標如何塑造表示\n\n比較重建、遮罩預測、對比與蒸餾式方法的共同資料邊界。\n\n## 沒有人工作業label仍有訓練目標\n\n自監督從資料構造target，例如遮罩內容、不同view對應或下一位置。它降低對某種人工標籤的依賴，不代表完全沒有假設、清理成本或資料權限。模型可學到來源捷徑，也可能從預訓練資料記住評估內容。\n\n## 幾種目標的差別\n\n重建偏好保留可重建資訊，對比依positive／negative拉開關係，遮罩預測依上下文補內容，teacher-student方式依目標表示與穩定化策略。不同架構與目標可結合，不宜只用一個新方法名字代替流程說明。\n\n## Collapse與防護機制\n\n若所有表示相同仍能滿足某個過度簡單目標，會失去資訊。負例、停止梯度、動量teacher、variance／covariance限制等可在不同方法中使用，各有假設；不是只加detach就自動得到有效自監督學習。需要看原始目標與實際評估。\n\n## 表示與適應的評估\n\nlinear probe固定backbone只學線性head，fine-tune更新更多層，二者回答不同問題。公平比較要記預訓練資料、算力、下游label量與調參預算；較少下游epochs不代表總訓練成本較低。group/time與資料污染仍要檢查。\n\n## 與本課範例的關係\n\n第33例只測in-batch對比數學與grad，不宣稱重現完整SimCLR；AE／VAE篇實際學低維重建；第60章以小teacher/student示範distillation。這些讓你看見目標差異，之後可沿原始論文與獨立Embedding課深化。\n\n## 自己設計一個檢查\n\n若表示只記住拍攝設備，使用同設備的linear probe可能很好，換設備就失效。可以按資料來源分組切分，再比較within-source與held-out-source結果；同時查看表示是否幾乎相同、是否只分出來源而沒有任務訊號。這比只展示一張漂亮的二維投影更直接回答「表示是否有用」。預訓練中沒有下游label，也不會自動消除來源偏差或資料污染。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n用同一圖片增強產生兩view，若增強改掉label語意，positive仍合理嗎？答案：不一定，會要求模型忽略你真正關心訊號。解答要連回下游任務、失敗樣本與表示評估，而不只看對比loss下降。模型學的是你設計的目標，不是自動知道你的用途。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [SimCLR](https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.05709)\n- [Representation learning](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/representation.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "自監督、預訓練與微調：目標如何塑造表示", "html": "自監督、預訓練與微調：目標如何塑造表示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "label", "name": "沒有人工作業label仍有訓練目標", "html": "沒有人工作業label仍有訓練目標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "幾種目標的差別", "html": "幾種目標的差別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "collapse", "name": "Collapse與防護機制", "html": "Collapse與防護機制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "表示與適應的評估", "html": "表示與適應的評估", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "與本課範例的關係", "html": "與本課範例的關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "自己設計一個檢查", "html": "自己設計一個檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "49-autoencoder", "group": "generative", "title": "Autoencoder：瓶頸、重建與表示限制", "summary": "真正訓練一維瓶頸重建二維曲線，區分壓縮與生成分布。", "tags": ["autoencoder", "bottleneck", "reconstruction", "latent"], "example": "34_autoencoder.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"autoencoder\">Autoencoder：瓶頸、重建與表示限制</h1>\n<p>真正訓練一維瓶頸重建二維曲線，區分壓縮與生成分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"encoderdecoder\">Encoder與Decoder</h2>\n<p>encoder將x變latent z，decoder重建x̂，以reconstruction loss訓練。若容量足夠且沒有約束，可能只是記住輸入；瓶頸、noise或其他限制才讓表示有特定偏好。重建好不保證分類／檢索好，兩者目標不同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nz=f_\\theta(x),\\quad\\hat x=g_\\phi(z),\\quad\nL=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\lVert x_i-g_\\phi(f_\\theta(x_i))\\rVert^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">線性與非線性連結</h2>\n<p>某些線性、平方誤差與適當限制情況可連到PCA子空間；一般非線性AE不等同PCA，latent座標也非唯一。decoder哪裡可生成合理樣本，取決於latent在訓練見過什麼，不是任意標準normal都有合理對應。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本章實驗</h2>\n<p>合成2D資料[u,.5u²-.5]，2→8→1 encoder接1→8→2 decoder，120次full-batch Adam。第34例列初始與最終reconstruction MSE，測試確認下降。這是訓練可學性檢查，沒有獨立生成品質或真實壓縮benchmark。</p>\n<h2 id=\"denoising\">Denoising與其他變體</h2>\n<p>denoising AE輸入受擾動、target為clean，逼模型學部分穩健結構；sparse／contractive等另有目標。不能看到所有方法都有encoder-decoder就叫同一loss。下一章VAE加入概率latent與KL，目的與普通AE不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">評估與失敗</h2>\n<p>過強瓶頸可能丟關鍵訊號，過大容量可能memorize；重建loss平均可掩蓋稀有模式。若用重建誤差作異常score，需獨立評估，因某些異常也能重建得好。latent圖只是探索，不能直接推定真實語意群組。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>從標準normal隨機z解碼，普通AE是否有明確訓練保證？答案：沒有對該prior的對齊目標。解答：先檢查encoder latent分布與用途，若要概率生成，研究VAE／flow等不同設計，不能把一個decoder存在當完整生成模型驗收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/34_autoencoder.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a one-dimensional bottleneck on a synthetic curved 2D dataset.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_autoencoder</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_autoencoder</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">!=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;2D synthetic reconstruction; not a generally calibrated generative density&#39;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/autoencoders.html\">Autoencoders</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Autoencoder：瓶頸、重建與表示限制\n\n真正訓練一維瓶頸重建二維曲線，區分壓縮與生成分布。\n\n## Encoder與Decoder\n\nencoder將x變latent z，decoder重建x̂，以reconstruction loss訓練。若容量足夠且沒有約束，可能只是記住輸入；瓶頸、noise或其他限制才讓表示有特定偏好。重建好不保證分類／檢索好，兩者目標不同。\n\n$$\nz=f_\\theta(x),\\quad\\hat x=g_\\phi(z),\\quad\nL=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\lVert x_i-g_\\phi(f_\\theta(x_i))\\rVert^2\n$$\n\n## 線性與非線性連結\n\n某些線性、平方誤差與適當限制情況可連到PCA子空間；一般非線性AE不等同PCA，latent座標也非唯一。decoder哪裡可生成合理樣本，取決於latent在訓練見過什麼，不是任意標準normal都有合理對應。\n\n## 本章實驗\n\n合成2D資料[u,.5u²-.5]，2→8→1 encoder接1→8→2 decoder，120次full-batch Adam。第34例列初始與最終reconstruction MSE，測試確認下降。這是訓練可學性檢查，沒有獨立生成品質或真實壓縮benchmark。\n\n## Denoising與其他變體\n\ndenoising AE輸入受擾動、target為clean，逼模型學部分穩健結構；sparse／contractive等另有目標。不能看到所有方法都有encoder-decoder就叫同一loss。下一章VAE加入概率latent與KL，目的與普通AE不同。\n\n## 評估與失敗\n\n過強瓶頸可能丟關鍵訊號，過大容量可能memorize；重建loss平均可掩蓋稀有模式。若用重建誤差作異常score，需獨立評估，因某些異常也能重建得好。latent圖只是探索，不能直接推定真實語意群組。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n從標準normal隨機z解碼，普通AE是否有明確訓練保證？答案：沒有對該prior的對齊目標。解答：先檢查encoder latent分布與用途，若要概率生成，研究VAE／flow等不同設計，不能把一個decoder存在當完整生成模型驗收。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/34_autoencoder.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a one-dimensional bottleneck on a synthetic curved 2D dataset.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import train_autoencoder\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    run=train_autoencoder()\n    result={k:v for k,v in run.items() if k!='model'}\n    result['scope']='2D synthetic reconstruction; not a generally calibrated generative density'\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autoencoders](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/autoencoders.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "autoencoder", "name": "Autoencoder：瓶頸、重建與表示限制", "html": "Autoencoder：瓶頸、重建與表示限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "encoderdecoder", "name": "Encoder與Decoder", "html": "Encoder與Decoder", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "線性與非線性連結", "html": "線性與非線性連結", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本章實驗", "html": "本章實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "denoising", "name": "Denoising與其他變體", "html": "Denoising與其他變體", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "評估與失敗", "html": "評估與失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "50-vae", "group": "generative", "title": "VAE：重參數化、ELBO與Gaussian KL", "summary": "將重建與latent prior連起來，分清beta目標與報告指標。", "tags": ["VAE", "ELBO", "reparameterization", "KL divergence"], "example": "35_vae.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"vaeelbogaussian-kl\">VAE：重參數化、ELBO與Gaussian KL</h1>\n<p>將重建與latent prior連起來，分清beta目標與報告指標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"encoder\">Encoder輸出分布參數</h2>\n<p>VAE以q(z|x)近似latent posterior，常輸出mean與log variance；decoder描述p(x|z)，prior常標準normal。不是對同一latent任意加noise就自動等於VAE，必須有對應概率目標與推導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">重參數化</h2>\n<p>z=μ+σ⊙ε，ε來自與可學參數無關的標準normal，使抽樣可寫成可微轉換。logvar是logσ²，所以std=exp(.5logvar)，漏掉.5會改分布。測試真的backward確認encoder與decoder梯度有限。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nz=\\mu+\\exp(\\tfrac12\\log\\sigma^2)\\odot\\epsilon,\\quad\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"elbokl\">ELBO與KL</h2>\n<p>負ELBO由負重建log likelihood加KL組成；對對角Gaussian與標準normal，KL有解析式。mean0、logvar0時KL0；mean[1,2]、variance1時KL2.5，是可手算測試。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nD_{KL}=\\frac12\\sum_j(\\mu_j^2+e^{\\ell_j}-1-\\ell_j),\\qquad \\ell_j=\\log\\sigma_j^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">下界是如何產生的</h2>\n<p>從log pθ(x)=log∫pθ(x,z)dz開始，乘除qφ(z|x)，將積分寫成q下的期望。log是凹函數，Jensen讓「log期望」大於等於「期望log」。展開joint後得到重建期望減KL：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\log p_\\theta(x)\\geq\n\\mathbb E_{q_\\phi(z\\mid x)}[\\log p_\\theta(x\\mid z)]\n-D_{KL}(q_\\phi(z\\mid x)\\Vert p(z))\n=\\operatorname{ELBO}(x).\n$$</div>\n<p>在密度與支撐等條件滿足時，log p(x)與ELBO的差是q(z|x)對真正posterior pθ(z|x)的KL。最大化下界因此同時涉及生成模型與近似posterior，但不保證有限網路能完全消除差距。實作常以一次或少數ε抽樣估計重建期望；那個隨機估計也不同於deterministic decoder(mean)的MSE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本課訓練的精確目標</h2>\n<p>第35例2D toy，重建採固定variance1 Gaussian去常數後的.5平方和，另加beta=.1的KL。因beta非1，明確稱beta-VAE取捨，不冒稱原始標準ELBO。報告mean-decode MSE與最後KL，MSE不是ELBO，也不是生成品質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">限制與練習</h2>\n<p>KL太強可能posterior collapse，decoder忽略z；太弱latent prior對齊不足。先看重建、KL、latent使用與獨立samples，而不只總loss。解答：比較不同beta時各項縮放需固定，不能跨不同維度／likelihood單位直接讀總loss。普通AE的任意latent問題在此由概率目標處理，但仍需充分訓練與驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/35_vae.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a tiny beta-VAE with reparameterization and analytic Gaussian KL.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_vae</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_vae</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">!=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;beta=.1 reconstruction/KL trade-off; mean-decode MSE is not ELBO or generation quality&#39;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114\">Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# VAE：重參數化、ELBO與Gaussian KL\n\n將重建與latent prior連起來，分清beta目標與報告指標。\n\n## Encoder輸出分布參數\n\nVAE以q(z|x)近似latent posterior，常輸出mean與log variance；decoder描述p(x|z)，prior常標準normal。不是對同一latent任意加noise就自動等於VAE，必須有對應概率目標與推導。\n\n## 重參數化\n\nz=μ+σ⊙ε，ε來自與可學參數無關的標準normal，使抽樣可寫成可微轉換。logvar是logσ²，所以std=exp(.5logvar)，漏掉.5會改分布。測試真的backward確認encoder與decoder梯度有限。\n\n$$\nz=\\mu+\\exp(\\tfrac12\\log\\sigma^2)\\odot\\epsilon,\\quad\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)\n$$\n\n## ELBO與KL\n\n負ELBO由負重建log likelihood加KL組成；對對角Gaussian與標準normal，KL有解析式。mean0、logvar0時KL0；mean[1,2]、variance1時KL2.5，是可手算測試。\n\n$$\nD_{KL}=\\frac12\\sum_j(\\mu_j^2+e^{\\ell_j}-1-\\ell_j),\\qquad \\ell_j=\\log\\sigma_j^2\n$$\n\n## 下界是如何產生的\n\n從log pθ(x)=log∫pθ(x,z)dz開始，乘除qφ(z|x)，將積分寫成q下的期望。log是凹函數，Jensen讓「log期望」大於等於「期望log」。展開joint後得到重建期望減KL：\n\n$$\n\\log p_\\theta(x)\\geq\n\\mathbb E_{q_\\phi(z\\mid x)}[\\log p_\\theta(x\\mid z)]\n-D_{KL}(q_\\phi(z\\mid x)\\Vert p(z))\n=\\operatorname{ELBO}(x).\n$$\n\n在密度與支撐等條件滿足時，log p(x)與ELBO的差是q(z|x)對真正posterior pθ(z|x)的KL。最大化下界因此同時涉及生成模型與近似posterior，但不保證有限網路能完全消除差距。實作常以一次或少數ε抽樣估計重建期望；那個隨機估計也不同於deterministic decoder(mean)的MSE。\n\n## 本課訓練的精確目標\n\n第35例2D toy，重建採固定variance1 Gaussian去常數後的.5平方和，另加beta=.1的KL。因beta非1，明確稱beta-VAE取捨，不冒稱原始標準ELBO。報告mean-decode MSE與最後KL，MSE不是ELBO，也不是生成品質。\n\n## 限制與練習\n\nKL太強可能posterior collapse，decoder忽略z；太弱latent prior對齊不足。先看重建、KL、latent使用與獨立samples，而不只總loss。解答：比較不同beta時各項縮放需固定，不能跨不同維度／likelihood單位直接讀總loss。普通AE的任意latent問題在此由概率目標處理，但仍需充分訓練與驗證。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/35_vae.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a tiny beta-VAE with reparameterization and analytic Gaussian KL.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import train_vae\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    run=train_vae()\n    result={k:v for k,v in run.items() if k!='model'}\n    result['scope']='beta=.1 reconstruction/KL trade-off; mean-decode MSE is not ELBO or generation quality'\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Auto-Encoding Variational Bayes](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "vaeelbogaussian-kl", "name": "VAE：重參數化、ELBO與Gaussian KL", "html": "VAE：重參數化、ELBO與Gaussian KL", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "encoder", "name": "Encoder輸出分布參數", "html": "Encoder輸出分布參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "重參數化", "html": "重參數化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "elbokl", "name": "ELBO與KL", "html": "ELBO與KL", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "下界是如何產生的", "html": "下界是如何產生的", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本課訓練的精確目標", "html": "本課訓練的精確目標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "限制與練習", "html": "限制與練習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "51-gan", "group": "generative", "title": "GAN：交替對抗目標與梯度邊界", "summary": "用低維分布實際更新兩個模型，避免把loss下降當收斂保證。", "tags": ["GAN", "generator", "discriminator", "non saturating", "detach"], "example": "36_gan.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"gan\">GAN：交替對抗目標與梯度邊界</h1>\n<p>用低維分布實際更新兩個模型，避免把loss下降當收斂保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">兩個模型與兩種資料</h2>\n<p>generator把noise變fake，discriminator分真／假。原始minimax設計讓兩者目標相互牽動；實務常用non-saturating generator loss改善某些梯度。訓練不是一個固定單模型凸目標，震盪與mode collapse都是可能現象。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_D=-\\mathbb E_{x\\sim p_{data}}\\log D(x)-\\mathbb E_z\\log(1-D(G(z)))\n$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_G^{NS}=-\\mathbb E_z\\log D(G(z))\n$$</div>\n<p>第二式是本課使用的non-saturating目標，與原minimax generator式不可直接說數值相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dg\">更新D時切斷G</h2>\n<p>fake=G(z).detach，D loss用real label1、fake0，step只更新D。更新G時fake不能detach，否則G沒有路徑；D weights暫時不求參數grad，但仍需讓其運算對G輸出可微。no_grad包整個D會錯切訊號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本章實際訓練</h2>\n<p>第36例生成2D Gaussian均值[2,-1]，G／D都是小MLP，交替120步，輸出最後loss與sample mean。測試分別確認D-step不改G、G-step不改D及旗標還原。沒有用這兩個loss就宣稱樣本逼近成功或GAN一定收斂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">評估與失敗</h2>\n<p>D loss小可能D太強，G loss小也可能模式少或評估不足；需看samples多樣性、覆蓋與獨立任務指標。固定noise看演化有助診斷，不只挑最好一張。真實影像GAN需更完整架構、正則與大量實驗，本課低維只驗機制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若G-step把G(z).detach，loss仍可對D微分，但G不更新。解答：檢查每個optimizer參數與grad路徑，不只看backward沒有錯。若D-step忘detach，可能浪費G梯度或誤更新；以狀態不變性測試可直接抓到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/36_gan.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Alternate real discriminator and generator updates on 2D synthetic samples.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_gan</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_gan</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.2661\">Generative Adversarial Networks</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# GAN：交替對抗目標與梯度邊界\n\n用低維分布實際更新兩個模型，避免把loss下降當收斂保證。\n\n## 兩個模型與兩種資料\n\ngenerator把noise變fake，discriminator分真／假。原始minimax設計讓兩者目標相互牽動；實務常用non-saturating generator loss改善某些梯度。訓練不是一個固定單模型凸目標，震盪與mode collapse都是可能現象。\n\n$$\nL_D=-\\mathbb E_{x\\sim p_{data}}\\log D(x)-\\mathbb E_z\\log(1-D(G(z)))\n$$\n\n$$\nL_G^{NS}=-\\mathbb E_z\\log D(G(z))\n$$\n\n第二式是本課使用的non-saturating目標，與原minimax generator式不可直接說數值相同。\n\n## 更新D時切斷G\n\nfake=G(z).detach，D loss用real label1、fake0，step只更新D。更新G時fake不能detach，否則G沒有路徑；D weights暫時不求參數grad，但仍需讓其運算對G輸出可微。no_grad包整個D會錯切訊號。\n\n## 本章實際訓練\n\n第36例生成2D Gaussian均值[2,-1]，G／D都是小MLP，交替120步，輸出最後loss與sample mean。測試分別確認D-step不改G、G-step不改D及旗標還原。沒有用這兩個loss就宣稱樣本逼近成功或GAN一定收斂。\n\n## 評估與失敗\n\nD loss小可能D太強，G loss小也可能模式少或評估不足；需看samples多樣性、覆蓋與獨立任務指標。固定noise看演化有助診斷，不只挑最好一張。真實影像GAN需更完整架構、正則與大量實驗，本課低維只驗機制。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若G-step把G(z).detach，loss仍可對D微分，但G不更新。解答：檢查每個optimizer參數與grad路徑，不只看backward沒有錯。若D-step忘detach，可能浪費G梯度或誤更新；以狀態不變性測試可直接抓到。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/36_gan.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Alternate real discriminator and generator updates on 2D synthetic samples.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import train_gan\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result=train_gan()\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Generative Adversarial Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.2661)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "gan", "name": "GAN：交替對抗目標與梯度邊界", "html": "GAN：交替對抗目標與梯度邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "兩個模型與兩種資料", "html": "兩個模型與兩種資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dg", "name": "更新D時切斷G", "html": "更新D時切斷G", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本章實際訓練", "html": "本章實際訓練", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "評估與失敗", "html": "評估與失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "52-diffusion", "group": "generative", "title": "Diffusion：加噪、epsilon預測與反向取樣", "summary": "實際訓練一維DDPM，推導每個係數並標示離散近似限制。", "tags": ["diffusion", "DDPM", "epsilon prediction", "noise schedule"], "example": "37_diffusion.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"diffusionepsilon\">Diffusion：加噪、epsilon預測與反向取樣</h1>\n<p>實際訓練一維DDPM，推導每個係數並標示離散近似限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">前向逐步破壞資料</h2>\n<p>β_t決定每步noise，α_t=1-β_t，αbar_t為累乘。可直接從clean與獨立normal ε取得任意t的noisy樣本，不必逐步跑到t。程式索引0對應數學第一個加噪步，不是clean本身，避免off-by-one。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nx_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"noise\">模型學預測noise</h2>\n<p>網路接受x_t與time，最小化epsilon MSE；它不是直接把所有x_t設成0，也不是每步都重新訓練一個不同網路。time embedding與架構在真實系統更複雜，本課只用1D輸入加normalized time的小MLP。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_\\epsilon=\\mathbb E\\lVert\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\rVert^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"variance\">反向平均與variance</h2>\n<p>本課使用DDPM epsilon形式mean與posterior variance，最後一步不再加noise。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}},\\quad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">最後一步與索引約定</h2>\n<p>定義乾淨時刻ᾱ₀=1，所以數學t=1的posterior variance為0。程式schedule[0]對應這個t=1，previous alpha_bar首項要補1。其他步驟由mean加上sqrt(β̃_t)乘新的normal噪音；同一條反向鏈的每一步使用當前xt與對應t，不能把第一次的模型輸出重複套30次。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nx_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z,\n\\quad z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)\\ (t&gt;1),\\qquad\nx_0=\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1).\n$$</div>\n<p>首頁固定ε隨t變化，是比較閉式邊際分布係數的視圖；它不是逐步注入獨立噪音的前向Markov樣本路徑。網頁的前向數學、Python的noise prediction訓練與反向採樣，需各自說明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">低維實驗與證據</h2>\n<p>第37例clean為±2附近的一維分布，30步schedule、220個訓練更新，真正跑反向sampler。固定probe噪音與t比較前後MSE，測試確認改善；terminal αbar小但不是精確0，有限步與有限模型都影響樣本，沒有聲稱高品質影像或精確目標密度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若漏sqrt，把αbar直接乘x0，會改前向variance與反向假設。解答：以固定x0、epsilon、t核對閉式；posterior variance首步為0且非負。資料重建、noise prediction與最終生成品質是不同指標，不能只看train MSE就宣稱分布完全學會。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/37_diffusion.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train epsilon prediction and execute a 30-step one-dimensional DDPM sampler.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_diffusion</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_diffusion</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239\">DDPM原始論文</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Diffusion：加噪、epsilon預測與反向取樣\n\n實際訓練一維DDPM，推導每個係數並標示離散近似限制。\n\n## 前向逐步破壞資料\n\nβ_t決定每步noise，α_t=1-β_t，αbar_t為累乘。可直接從clean與獨立normal ε取得任意t的noisy樣本，不必逐步跑到t。程式索引0對應數學第一個加噪步，不是clean本身，避免off-by-one。\n\n$$\nx_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon\n$$\n\n## 模型學預測noise\n\n網路接受x_t與time，最小化epsilon MSE；它不是直接把所有x_t設成0，也不是每步都重新訓練一個不同網路。time embedding與架構在真實系統更複雜，本課只用1D輸入加normalized time的小MLP。\n\n$$\nL_\\epsilon=\\mathbb E\\lVert\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\rVert^2\n$$\n\n## 反向平均與variance\n\n本課使用DDPM epsilon形式mean與posterior variance，最後一步不再加noise。\n\n$$\n\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}},\\quad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n$$\n\n## 最後一步與索引約定\n\n定義乾淨時刻ᾱ₀=1，所以數學t=1的posterior variance為0。程式schedule[0]對應這個t=1，previous alpha_bar首項要補1。其他步驟由mean加上sqrt(β̃_t)乘新的normal噪音；同一條反向鏈的每一步使用當前xt與對應t，不能把第一次的模型輸出重複套30次。\n\n$$\nx_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z,\n\\quad z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)\\ (t>1),\\qquad\nx_0=\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1).\n$$\n\n首頁固定ε隨t變化，是比較閉式邊際分布係數的視圖；它不是逐步注入獨立噪音的前向Markov樣本路徑。網頁的前向數學、Python的noise prediction訓練與反向採樣，需各自說明。\n\n## 低維實驗與證據\n\n第37例clean為±2附近的一維分布，30步schedule、220個訓練更新，真正跑反向sampler。固定probe噪音與t比較前後MSE，測試確認改善；terminal αbar小但不是精確0，有限步與有限模型都影響樣本，沒有聲稱高品質影像或精確目標密度。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若漏sqrt，把αbar直接乘x0，會改前向variance與反向假設。解答：以固定x0、epsilon、t核對閉式；posterior variance首步為0且非負。資料重建、noise prediction與最終生成品質是不同指標，不能只看train MSE就宣稱分布完全學會。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/37_diffusion.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train epsilon prediction and execute a 30-step one-dimensional DDPM sampler.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import train_diffusion\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result=train_diffusion()\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [DDPM原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "diffusionepsilon", "name": "Diffusion：加噪、epsilon預測與反向取樣", "html": "Diffusion：加噪、epsilon預測與反向取樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "前向逐步破壞資料", "html": "前向逐步破壞資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "noise", "name": "模型學預測noise", "html": "模型學預測noise", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "variance", "name": "反向平均與variance", "html": "反向平均與variance", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "最後一步與索引約定", "html": "最後一步與索引約定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "低維實驗與證據", "html": "低維實驗與證據", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "53-flows", "group": "generative", "title": "Flow Matching：學速度場與積分生成", "summary": "比較改變變數、連續路徑與條件速度目標，真正跑一維Euler取樣。", "tags": ["flow matching", "normalizing flow", "ODE", "velocity field"], "example": "38_flow_matching.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"flow-matching\">Flow Matching：學速度場與積分生成</h1>\n<p>比較改變變數、連續路徑與條件速度目標，真正跑一維Euler取樣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">分布如何被搬動</h2>\n<p>normalizing flow以可逆轉換與Jacobian處理密度；continuous flow以時間速度場描述樣本移動。Flow Matching研究如何對指定機率路徑訓練向量場，不表示每個實作都已計算可用log likelihood或解完最佳傳輸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本課的線性條件路徑</h2>\n<p>取noise z與target x1，t∈[0,1]，x_t=(1-t)z+tx1，條件速度為x1-z。對獨立配對抽樣訓練MSE，固定(x_t,t)可能對應不同配對，最適回歸是相應條件期望，不是網路能對每組noise完全還原其隱藏配對。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nx_t=(1-t)z+tx_1,\\qquad u_t=x_1-z,\\qquad\nL=\\mathbb E\\lVert v_\\theta(x_t,t)-u_t\\rVert^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">取樣使用積分</h2>\n<p>從base noise開始，解dx/dt=vθ(x,t)。第38例真正學1D向量場，再30次Euler更新x+=vΔt，target為mean2、std.5 Gaussian。小模型、有限訓練與離散步數都有誤差，只報finite loss與samples統計，不冒稱已驗證真實生成品質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"diffusion\">與Diffusion的關係</h2>\n<p>兩者都可把簡單分布連到資料，卻有不同路徑、目標與sampler。某些理論形式可連結，不是把epsilon MSE更名velocity就相同。時間方向、端點、條件配對與數值solver都需一致。本例沒有OT配對solver、adaptive ODE或密度計算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>z=1、x1=3，t=.25時x_t=1.5、u=2；t0回noise、t1回target。解答：這是配對路徑的精確手算，生成時只有學得vθ與base，沒有拿未知x1當輸入偷用答案。Euler步數變化需比較數值誤差與成本，而不只看單次sample mean。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/38_flow_matching.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a 1D conditional velocity field and integrate with Euler steps.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_flow</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_flow</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747\">Flow Matching for Generative Modeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/generative_models.html\">概率模型背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Flow Matching：學速度場與積分生成\n\n比較改變變數、連續路徑與條件速度目標，真正跑一維Euler取樣。\n\n## 分布如何被搬動\n\nnormalizing flow以可逆轉換與Jacobian處理密度；continuous flow以時間速度場描述樣本移動。Flow Matching研究如何對指定機率路徑訓練向量場，不表示每個實作都已計算可用log likelihood或解完最佳傳輸。\n\n## 本課的線性條件路徑\n\n取noise z與target x1，t∈[0,1]，x_t=(1-t)z+tx1，條件速度為x1-z。對獨立配對抽樣訓練MSE，固定(x_t,t)可能對應不同配對，最適回歸是相應條件期望，不是網路能對每組noise完全還原其隱藏配對。\n\n$$\nx_t=(1-t)z+tx_1,\\qquad u_t=x_1-z,\\qquad\nL=\\mathbb E\\lVert v_\\theta(x_t,t)-u_t\\rVert^2\n$$\n\n## 取樣使用積分\n\n從base noise開始，解dx/dt=vθ(x,t)。第38例真正學1D向量場，再30次Euler更新x+=vΔt，target為mean2、std.5 Gaussian。小模型、有限訓練與離散步數都有誤差，只報finite loss與samples統計，不冒稱已驗證真實生成品質。\n\n## 與Diffusion的關係\n\n兩者都可把簡單分布連到資料，卻有不同路徑、目標與sampler。某些理論形式可連結，不是把epsilon MSE更名velocity就相同。時間方向、端點、條件配對與數值solver都需一致。本例沒有OT配對solver、adaptive ODE或密度計算。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nz=1、x1=3，t=.25時x_t=1.5、u=2；t0回noise、t1回target。解答：這是配對路徑的精確手算，生成時只有學得vθ與base，沒有拿未知x1當輸入偷用答案。Euler步數變化需比較數值誤差與成本，而不只看單次sample mean。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/38_flow_matching.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a 1D conditional velocity field and integrate with Euler steps.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import train_flow\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    result=train_flow()\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Flow Matching for Generative Modeling](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747)\n- [概率模型背景](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/generative_models.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "flow-matching", "name": "Flow Matching：學速度場與積分生成", "html": "Flow Matching：學速度場與積分生成", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "分布如何被搬動", "html": "分布如何被搬動", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本課的線性條件路徑", "html": "本課的線性條件路徑", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "取樣使用積分", "html": "取樣使用積分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "diffusion", "name": "與Diffusion的關係", "html": "與Diffusion的關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "54-generative-evaluation", "group": "generative", "title": "生成模型評估：重建、似然、分布與人類判斷", "summary": "為不同目標選證據，避免以漂亮樣本或單一loss代替完整驗收。", "tags": ["generative evaluation", "FID", "likelihood", "coverage", "diversity"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">生成模型評估：重建、似然、分布與人類判斷</h1>\n<p>為不同目標選證據，避免以漂亮樣本或單一loss代替完整驗收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先問是哪一種主張</h2>\n<p>AE重建、VAE近似概率學習、GAN對抗樣本、DDPM noise prediction與Flow速度回歸，各有不同訓練loss。原始loss尺度不能直接跨方法排名。若目標是生成樣本，還需品質、多樣性、覆蓋與條件符合；若要密度，則需實際可計的likelihood與相應假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">玩具實驗應報什麼</h2>\n<p>本課低維生成分布可看sample mean／std、直方圖、多個seed與已知target對照；不從mean接近就認為整個分布相同。多峰資料只生成中間平均也可能看似均值正確，卻完全漏mode。固定一組noise方便觀察，另用獨立noise評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">常見影像指標</h2>\n<p>FID等在指定特徵空間比較分布統計，受encoder、樣本量、前處理與資料來源影響；不是直接量所有語意正確，也非任意兩份資料可公平跨分數比較。人評要有抽樣、盲測與標準，不只展示少數挑選的最佳樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">重建與生成不同</h2>\n<p>VAE decoder(mean)的MSE低，不保證prior抽樣好；DDPM固定probe MSE下降只證明部分epsilon目標學習，仍需sampler分布；GAN兩loss有限不保證對抗收斂。這些限制是例子設計的一部分，而非等到結果不好才補的解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">資料污染與記憶</h2>\n<p>生成看似逼真可能接近訓練樣本；需考慮最近鄰、重複與來源隔離。條件生成需測條件符合與不適用情境，多模態還有不同主體／來源差異。公開展示模型與樣本時保留資料使用與來源說明，避免把合成教學成績包成實際產品能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">將採樣成本一併列出</h2>\n<p>同一模型採樣30步與300步，品質和時間可能不同；比較兩種方法時，還需固定樣本數、裝置、精度與量測程序。若只挑選最好看的十張而不揭露總共生成幾張，就無法知道挑選成本與失敗率。低維教材也可採相同原則：先固定評估樣本數和seed，報告全部樣本的統計，再看個案。這裡沒有計算FID或實機效能，不把概念介紹寫成已完成的benchmark。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>目標是兩個等大峰±2，模型全輸出0，mean一樣0，是否成功？答案：沒有，variance與覆蓋完全不同。解答：選多項對應主張的證據，報樣本數與seed，不以一張漂亮圖或一個loss替代分布驗收。第64章把這個原則寫成可重現生成專題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.08500\">GAN評估與FID研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239\">DDPM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114\">VAE</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 生成模型評估：重建、似然、分布與人類判斷\n\n為不同目標選證據，避免以漂亮樣本或單一loss代替完整驗收。\n\n## 先問是哪一種主張\n\nAE重建、VAE近似概率學習、GAN對抗樣本、DDPM noise prediction與Flow速度回歸，各有不同訓練loss。原始loss尺度不能直接跨方法排名。若目標是生成樣本，還需品質、多樣性、覆蓋與條件符合；若要密度，則需實際可計的likelihood與相應假設。\n\n## 玩具實驗應報什麼\n\n本課低維生成分布可看sample mean／std、直方圖、多個seed與已知target對照；不從mean接近就認為整個分布相同。多峰資料只生成中間平均也可能看似均值正確，卻完全漏mode。固定一組noise方便觀察，另用獨立noise評估。\n\n## 常見影像指標\n\nFID等在指定特徵空間比較分布統計，受encoder、樣本量、前處理與資料來源影響；不是直接量所有語意正確，也非任意兩份資料可公平跨分數比較。人評要有抽樣、盲測與標準，不只展示少數挑選的最佳樣本。\n\n## 重建與生成不同\n\nVAE decoder(mean)的MSE低，不保證prior抽樣好；DDPM固定probe MSE下降只證明部分epsilon目標學習，仍需sampler分布；GAN兩loss有限不保證對抗收斂。這些限制是例子設計的一部分，而非等到結果不好才補的解釋。\n\n## 資料污染與記憶\n\n生成看似逼真可能接近訓練樣本；需考慮最近鄰、重複與來源隔離。條件生成需測條件符合與不適用情境，多模態還有不同主體／來源差異。公開展示模型與樣本時保留資料使用與來源說明，避免把合成教學成績包成實際產品能力。\n\n## 將採樣成本一併列出\n\n同一模型採樣30步與300步，品質和時間可能不同；比較兩種方法時，還需固定樣本數、裝置、精度與量測程序。若只挑選最好看的十張而不揭露總共生成幾張，就無法知道挑選成本與失敗率。低維教材也可採相同原則：先固定評估樣本數和seed，報告全部樣本的統計，再看個案。這裡沒有計算FID或實機效能，不把概念介紹寫成已完成的benchmark。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n目標是兩個等大峰±2，模型全輸出0，mean一樣0，是否成功？答案：沒有，variance與覆蓋完全不同。解答：選多項對應主張的證據，報樣本數與seed，不以一張漂亮圖或一個loss替代分布驗收。第64章把這個原則寫成可重現生成專題。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [GAN評估與FID研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.08500)\n- [DDPM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239)\n- [VAE](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "生成模型評估：重建、似然、分布與人類判斷", "html": "生成模型評估：重建、似然、分布與人類判斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先問是哪一種主張", "html": "先問是哪一種主張", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "玩具實驗應報什麼", "html": "玩具實驗應報什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "常見影像指標", "html": "常見影像指標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "重建與生成不同", "html": "重建與生成不同", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "資料污染與記憶", "html": "資料污染與記憶", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "將採樣成本一併列出", "html": "將採樣成本一併列出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "55-training-failures", "group": "reliability", "title": "模型沒有學到：從第一個失敗的數值開始查", "summary": "建立可重複的診斷順序，將資料、計算圖、最佳化與評估錯誤分開定位。", "tags": ["debugging", "overfit one batch", "NaN", "gradients"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">模型沒有學到：從第一個失敗的數值開始查</h1>\n<p>建立可重複的診斷順序，將資料、計算圖、最佳化與評估錯誤分開定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先界定失敗發生在哪裡</h2>\n<p>loss不降、訓練準確但驗證失敗，以及存檔後推論改變，是三種不同問題。先保留一個輸入批次、標籤、初始化與版本，縮短到CPU單步。若每次都換資料、seed和設定，修好後也難以知道原因。記錄第一次出現異常的張量，而非只留下最後的NaN。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">用一個批次檢驗可學性</h2>\n<p>暫時關閉增強、Dropout與正則化，反覆訓練同一小批資料。對本課乾淨、可分且容量足夠的範例，loss應能明顯下降。這不是泛化評估，也不是任何資料都必然趨近零的定理：相同輸入若有矛盾標籤，就有不可消除的限制。成功後恢復獨立驗證資料，再逐項加回功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">一次更新的四道檢查</h2>\n<p>先確認輸入有限、shape和類別範圍正確，再看logits、loss與梯度，最後比較參數更新前後。<code>grad is None</code>可能是未參與計算圖或被detach；全零梯度可能是飽和、mask或局部導數為零；有限但極小的梯度又是另一件事。optimizer持有舊模型參數、忘記step或在backward前清錯梯度，都可能讓參數不動。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">functional</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isfinite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span> <span class=\"ow\">is</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isfinite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">第一個非有限值</h2>\n<p>除零、直接對零取log、過大的exp、無效的全遮罩Attention列，常比optimizer本身更早造成異常。用穩定的logsumexp與logits版loss；對小範例可開<code>torch.autograd.detect_anomaly()</code>定位backward來源，但它有額外成本，不當成日常效能設定。不要用任意clip或nan_to_num把根因藏起來。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">訓練正常卻評估失敗</h2>\n<p>檢查eval模式、訓練統計前處理、標籤對應及padding語意是否一致。若單批可記住、全資料train正常但validation差，才往資料分布、容量、正則化與資料量調查。最後用同一輸入比對記憶體模型和重載模型的logits，確認交付邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>你看到loss有限、每個參數grad都有值，但weight完全沒變。下一步是什麼？答案：確認step執行、lr非零、optimizer的參數物件就是現在forward的模型，並以clone快照比較。僅印出兩次同一個Parameter參考，可能兩次都指向已更新的值而無法證明差異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html\">Autograd異常偵測</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Module與訓練模式</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 模型沒有學到：從第一個失敗的數值開始查\n\n建立可重複的診斷順序，將資料、計算圖、最佳化與評估錯誤分開定位。\n\n## 先界定失敗發生在哪裡\n\nloss不降、訓練準確但驗證失敗，以及存檔後推論改變，是三種不同問題。先保留一個輸入批次、標籤、初始化與版本，縮短到CPU單步。若每次都換資料、seed和設定，修好後也難以知道原因。記錄第一次出現異常的張量，而非只留下最後的NaN。\n\n## 用一個批次檢驗可學性\n\n暫時關閉增強、Dropout與正則化，反覆訓練同一小批資料。對本課乾淨、可分且容量足夠的範例，loss應能明顯下降。這不是泛化評估，也不是任何資料都必然趨近零的定理：相同輸入若有矛盾標籤，就有不可消除的限制。成功後恢復獨立驗證資料，再逐項加回功能。\n\n## 一次更新的四道檢查\n\n先確認輸入有限、shape和類別範圍正確，再看logits、loss與梯度，最後比較參數更新前後。`grad is None`可能是未參與計算圖或被detach；全零梯度可能是飽和、mask或局部導數為零；有限但極小的梯度又是另一件事。optimizer持有舊模型參數、忘記step或在backward前清錯梯度，都可能讓參數不動。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\ntorch.manual_seed(7)\nmodel=nn.Linear(2,2)\noptimizer=torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(),lr=.1)\nx=torch.tensor([[1.,-1.],[.5,2.]])\ny=torch.tensor([0,1])\nbefore=model.weight.detach().clone()\noptimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\nloss=nn.functional.cross_entropy(model(x),y)\nassert torch.isfinite(loss)\nloss.backward()\nassert model.weight.grad is not None\nassert torch.isfinite(model.weight.grad).all()\noptimizer.step()\nassert not torch.equal(before,model.weight)\n```\n\n## 第一個非有限值\n\n除零、直接對零取log、過大的exp、無效的全遮罩Attention列，常比optimizer本身更早造成異常。用穩定的logsumexp與logits版loss；對小範例可開`torch.autograd.detect_anomaly()`定位backward來源，但它有額外成本，不當成日常效能設定。不要用任意clip或nan_to_num把根因藏起來。\n\n## 訓練正常卻評估失敗\n\n檢查eval模式、訓練統計前處理、標籤對應及padding語意是否一致。若單批可記住、全資料train正常但validation差，才往資料分布、容量、正則化與資料量調查。最後用同一輸入比對記憶體模型和重載模型的logits，確認交付邊界。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n你看到loss有限、每個參數grad都有值，但weight完全沒變。下一步是什麼？答案：確認step執行、lr非零、optimizer的參數物件就是現在forward的模型，並以clone快照比較。僅印出兩次同一個Parameter參考，可能兩次都指向已更新的值而無法證明差異。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd異常偵測](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html)\n- [Module與訓練模式](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "模型沒有學到：從第一個失敗的數值開始查", "html": "模型沒有學到：從第一個失敗的數值開始查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先界定失敗發生在哪裡", "html": "先界定失敗發生在哪裡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "用一個批次檢驗可學性", "html": "用一個批次檢驗可學性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "一次更新的四道檢查", "html": "一次更新的四道檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "第一個非有限值", "html": "第一個非有限值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "訓練正常卻評估失敗", "html": "訓練正常卻評估失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "56-reproducibility", "group": "reliability", "title": "重現與隨機性：seed是實驗條件的一部分", "summary": "區分固定設定下的重跑、跨環境一致性，以及跨seed結果是否穩定。", "tags": ["reproducibility", "seed", "determinism", "ablation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"seed\">重現與隨機性：seed是實驗條件的一部分</h1>\n<p>區分固定設定下的重跑、跨環境一致性，以及跨seed結果是否穩定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"seed_1\">seed能固定什麼</h2>\n<p>模型初始化、資料打散、Dropout與生成採樣都使用隨機數。固定seed讓同一實作在同一環境更容易重跑；它不保證跨PyTorch版本、CPU／GPU或不同底層演算法逐位相同。GPU某些運算還涉及非確定性，應依官方說明選擇deterministic設定並衡量效能成本。本課只驗證CPU路徑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">亂數流也需要邊界</h2>\n<p>若新增一個畫圖用的randn就消耗全域RNG，後面的初始化可能改變。共用實作將資料生成和loader打散使用獨立Generator，降低無關操作的影響。模型與訓練仍有自身順序；這種分離是控制實驗的工具，不是完全切斷所有隨機依賴。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># 全域RNG不會改變g</span>\n<span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"seed_2\">不只挑一個幸運seed</h2>\n<p>比較架構A、B時，預先決定seed集合、切分、訓練預算與主指標。在同一seed／split配對比較差值，比各挑最高分更能說明設定差異。記錄每次結果與平均、散布；標準差描述這組實驗的變動，並不自動等於資料母體或所有未來分布的不確定性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nd_s=m_{B,s}-m_{A,s},\\qquad\n\\bar d=\\frac1S\\sum_{s=1}^{S}d_s\n$$</div>\n<p>若指標是loss，差值負代表B較低；若是accuracy則方向相反。表格欄位要寫清楚，不能只用向上箭頭概括所有數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">重跑清單要保存到哪裡</h2>\n<p>保留原始資料識別與切分索引、前處理、程式commit、Python／Torch完整版本、裝置、seed、超參數及最佳epoch。推論artifact只保留推論必要資訊；要精確續訓還需optimizer、scheduler、RNG與採樣進度。第66章會明確區分這兩種交付，本課範例不聲稱完整續訓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">如何寫可信的結論</h2>\n<p>「seed7在本機CPU合成資料上，validation loss降低」是可核對的觀察；「這個架構永遠優於其他架構」需要遠多於一個玩具實驗。若不同seed優劣反轉，應報告差異及成本，檢查資料大小、超參數預算與不穩定來源。不要因為測試能重跑，就將單次結果當成普遍結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>固定seed後換GPU，結果有些微差異，是否表示程式一定有bug？答案：不一定。先比對版本、演算法與容許誤差，再檢查資料及執行順序。相反地，同環境、同輸入下存讀模型產生很大差異，應優先檢查eval模式與前處理，不能一概歸咎於隨機性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html\">PyTorch可重現性</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 重現與隨機性：seed是實驗條件的一部分\n\n區分固定設定下的重跑、跨環境一致性，以及跨seed結果是否穩定。\n\n## seed能固定什麼\n\n模型初始化、資料打散、Dropout與生成採樣都使用隨機數。固定seed讓同一實作在同一環境更容易重跑；它不保證跨PyTorch版本、CPU／GPU或不同底層演算法逐位相同。GPU某些運算還涉及非確定性，應依官方說明選擇deterministic設定並衡量效能成本。本課只驗證CPU路徑。\n\n## 亂數流也需要邊界\n\n若新增一個畫圖用的randn就消耗全域RNG，後面的初始化可能改變。共用實作將資料生成和loader打散使用獨立Generator，降低無關操作的影響。模型與訓練仍有自身順序；這種分離是控制實驗的工具，不是完全切斷所有隨機依賴。\n\n```python\nimport torch\ng=torch.Generator().manual_seed(11)\nfirst=torch.randn(4,generator=g)\ntorch.randn(100)  # 全域RNG不會改變g\ng.manual_seed(11)\nassert torch.equal(first,torch.randn(4,generator=g))\n```\n\n## 不只挑一個幸運seed\n\n比較架構A、B時，預先決定seed集合、切分、訓練預算與主指標。在同一seed／split配對比較差值，比各挑最高分更能說明設定差異。記錄每次結果與平均、散布；標準差描述這組實驗的變動，並不自動等於資料母體或所有未來分布的不確定性。\n\n$$\nd_s=m_{B,s}-m_{A,s},\\qquad\n\\bar d=\\frac1S\\sum_{s=1}^{S}d_s\n$$\n\n若指標是loss，差值負代表B較低；若是accuracy則方向相反。表格欄位要寫清楚，不能只用向上箭頭概括所有數字。\n\n## 重跑清單要保存到哪裡\n\n保留原始資料識別與切分索引、前處理、程式commit、Python／Torch完整版本、裝置、seed、超參數及最佳epoch。推論artifact只保留推論必要資訊；要精確續訓還需optimizer、scheduler、RNG與採樣進度。第66章會明確區分這兩種交付，本課範例不聲稱完整續訓。\n\n## 如何寫可信的結論\n\n「seed7在本機CPU合成資料上，validation loss降低」是可核對的觀察；「這個架構永遠優於其他架構」需要遠多於一個玩具實驗。若不同seed優劣反轉，應報告差異及成本，檢查資料大小、超參數預算與不穩定來源。不要因為測試能重跑，就將單次結果當成普遍結論。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n固定seed後換GPU，結果有些微差異，是否表示程式一定有bug？答案：不一定。先比對版本、演算法與容許誤差，再檢查資料及執行順序。相反地，同環境、同輸入下存讀模型產生很大差異，應優先檢查eval模式與前處理，不能一概歸咎於隨機性。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [PyTorch可重現性](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "seed", "name": "重現與隨機性：seed是實驗條件的一部分", "html": "重現與隨機性：seed是實驗條件的一部分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "seed_1", "name": "seed能固定什麼", "html": "seed能固定什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "亂數流也需要邊界", "html": "亂數流也需要邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "seed_2", "name": "不只挑一個幸運seed", "html": "不只挑一個幸運seed", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "重跑清單要保存到哪裡", "html": "重跑清單要保存到哪裡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "如何寫可信的結論", "html": "如何寫可信的結論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "57-calibration-ood", "group": "reliability", "title": "信心、校準與分布外資料：高分不等於可靠", "summary": "理解機率品質、溫度縮放與分布移動，避免把softmax最大值視為安全保證。", "tags": ["calibration", "temperature scaling", "OOD", "Brier score"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">信心、校準與分布外資料：高分不等於可靠</h1>\n<p>理解機率品質、溫度縮放與分布移動，避免把softmax最大值視為安全保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分類正確與機率正確</h2>\n<p>模型將所有樣本預測為正類：若其中八成真的為正，輸出0.8和0.999的分類結果相同，但機率品質很不同。校準關心宣稱某信心的樣本群是否有相近正確率。分箱圖還需樣本量；只有兩筆的箱子非常不穩定，不宜過度解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">兩個可以手算的分數</h2>\n<p>二分類Brier取機率與0／1標籤的平方差平均，NLL對給真實類別極低機率的錯誤有很大懲罰。若y=1，p=.8的Brier為.04；p=.1則為.81。評估時也看分類、類別分組與資料切片，單一平均可能掩蓋少數群組的失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{Brier}=\\frac1N\\sum_i(p_i-y_i)^2,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NLL}=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log p_i(y_i)\n$$</div>\n<p>這裡Brier是二分類單一正類機率的定義；多類別版本通常還對類別加總，報告時須寫明慣例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">溫度縮放只改一個正數</h2>\n<p>將已訓練模型凍結，在另外保留的校準資料上以NLL估T&gt;0，再用softmax(z/T)。T較大讓分布平緩；它保留同一筆logits的argmax，所以通常不改top-1分類結果，無法修好原本分類錯誤。校準資料可從validation另分；不要用最終test調T。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\np_T(c\\mid x)=\\frac{\\exp(z_c/T)}{\\sum_j\\exp(z_j/T)},\\qquad T&gt;0\n$$</div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">softmax</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">softmax</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">argmax</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">argmax</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"oodsoftmax\">OOD沒有由softmax自動解決</h2>\n<p>訓練只見過水平／垂直亮帶，對自然照片仍會被迫分到這兩類；很大的最大機率不表示看過相似資料。需要事先定義分布外情境、適合的驗證集合與拒答／人工處理政策，評估偵測錯誤率與成本。溫度縮放在一個分布有效，也不保證對另一分布仍校準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>校準後accuracy不變，NLL下降，是否沒有改善？答案：機率品質可能改善，對依信心採取行動的流程有意義；應用保留資料驗證。若只看到ECE下降，也需檢查分箱選擇、NLL及樣本數，不能單憑一個分箱數字宣布可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.04599\">溫度縮放原始研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html\">分類目標與logits</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 信心、校準與分布外資料：高分不等於可靠\n\n理解機率品質、溫度縮放與分布移動，避免把softmax最大值視為安全保證。\n\n## 分類正確與機率正確\n\n模型將所有樣本預測為正類：若其中八成真的為正，輸出0.8和0.999的分類結果相同，但機率品質很不同。校準關心宣稱某信心的樣本群是否有相近正確率。分箱圖還需樣本量；只有兩筆的箱子非常不穩定，不宜過度解讀。\n\n## 兩個可以手算的分數\n\n二分類Brier取機率與0／1標籤的平方差平均，NLL對給真實類別極低機率的錯誤有很大懲罰。若y=1，p=.8的Brier為.04；p=.1則為.81。評估時也看分類、類別分組與資料切片，單一平均可能掩蓋少數群組的失敗。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{Brier}=\\frac1N\\sum_i(p_i-y_i)^2,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{NLL}=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log p_i(y_i)\n$$\n\n這裡Brier是二分類單一正類機率的定義；多類別版本通常還對類別加總，報告時須寫明慣例。\n\n## 溫度縮放只改一個正數\n\n將已訓練模型凍結，在另外保留的校準資料上以NLL估T>0，再用softmax(z/T)。T較大讓分布平緩；它保留同一筆logits的argmax，所以通常不改top-1分類結果，無法修好原本分類錯誤。校準資料可從validation另分；不要用最終test調T。\n\n$$\np_T(c\\mid x)=\\frac{\\exp(z_c/T)}{\\sum_j\\exp(z_j/T)},\\qquad T>0\n$$\n\n```python\nimport torch\nz=torch.tensor([[2.,0.,-1.]])\np1=(z/1.).softmax(-1)\np2=(z/2.).softmax(-1)\nassert p1.argmax()==p2.argmax()\nassert p2.max()<p1.max()\n```\n\n## OOD沒有由softmax自動解決\n\n訓練只見過水平／垂直亮帶，對自然照片仍會被迫分到這兩類；很大的最大機率不表示看過相似資料。需要事先定義分布外情境、適合的驗證集合與拒答／人工處理政策，評估偵測錯誤率與成本。溫度縮放在一個分布有效，也不保證對另一分布仍校準。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n校準後accuracy不變，NLL下降，是否沒有改善？答案：機率品質可能改善，對依信心採取行動的流程有意義；應用保留資料驗證。若只看到ECE下降，也需檢查分箱選擇、NLL及樣本數，不能單憑一個分箱數字宣布可靠。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [溫度縮放原始研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.04599)\n- [分類目標與logits](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "信心、校準與分布外資料：高分不等於可靠", "html": "信心、校準與分布外資料：高分不等於可靠", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分類正確與機率正確", "html": "分類正確與機率正確", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "兩個可以手算的分數", "html": "兩個可以手算的分數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "溫度縮放只改一個正數", "html": "溫度縮放只改一個正數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "oodsoftmax", "name": "OOD沒有由softmax自動解決", "html": "OOD沒有由softmax自動解決", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "58-saliency", "group": "reliability", "title": "模型看哪裡：梯度敏感度與解釋的界線", "summary": "用可驗證的小函數理解input gradient，辨認局部敏感度、歸因與因果的差別。", "tags": ["saliency", "input gradient", "interpretability", "finite difference"], "example": "39_saliency.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">模型看哪裡：梯度敏感度與解釋的界線</h1>\n<p>用可驗證的小函數理解input gradient，辨認局部敏感度、歸因與因果的差別。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">對輸入求導</h2>\n<p>固定參數，對一個選定輸出分數求輸入梯度，回答「在此點附近，小幅改變某輸入，分數一階會如何變」。必須說明對哪個logit或loss求導，輸入是否標準化，以及取絕對值、符號或通道加總。不同選擇產生不同視圖，不能當作唯一客觀解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一個有已知答案的模型</h2>\n<p>範例39設定f(x)=2x1−x2，梯度固定[2,−1]，並以中央差分驗證。這讓我們先確認程式真正在對輸入求導，而非混入權重梯度或錯誤聚合。對複雜網路，有限差分也只驗證局部導數，並未證明視覺化符合人類的語意。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nf(x+\\delta)\\approx f(x)+\\nabla_x f(x)^T\\delta\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">飽和與尺度的陷阱</h2>\n<p>sigmoid接近0或1時，機率對輸入的局部梯度可能很小；這不表示該輸入在整個決策中不重要。若x'=(x−μ)/s，則對原始輸入的梯度還有1/s因子。直接比較不同單位特徵的數字大小，可能只在比較單位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">關聯不能直接當因果</h2>\n<p>熱圖顯示模型對背景敏感，值得設計背景替換的測試，但還不能證明現實因素的因果關係。遮擋或替換也可能產生訓練外輸入；先確定擾動是否合理、是否保留標籤，再看性能與預測如何改變。對幾筆樣本的漂亮圖，保留其個案範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">檢查流程</h2>\n<p>先eval固定模型，僅讓輸入requires_grad。對單一指定分數backward或autograd.grad，確認shape與有限值，再與已知線性函數、有限差分做校對。若批次輸出總和求導，還須知道模型是否有跨樣本運算，例如訓練態BatchNorm，否則樣本間可能互相影響。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>梯度為[2,−1]，擾動[.01,.03]的一階分數變化是多少？答案：.02−.03=−.01，本例線性所以精確成立。這能證明第二特徵在現實中造成結果嗎？不能；這只描述模型函數及指定擾動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/39_saliency.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A known input gradient checked with central differences.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">copy_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]]))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.8</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.001</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">-=</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">difference</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">plus</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">minus</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">epsilon</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;input_gradient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_coordinate_finite_difference&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">difference</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;local model sensitivity, not causal feature effects&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_9\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html\">自動微分介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd計算圖</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 模型看哪裡：梯度敏感度與解釋的界線\n\n用可驗證的小函數理解input gradient，辨認局部敏感度、歸因與因果的差別。\n\n## 對輸入求導\n\n固定參數，對一個選定輸出分數求輸入梯度，回答「在此點附近，小幅改變某輸入，分數一階會如何變」。必須說明對哪個logit或loss求導，輸入是否標準化，以及取絕對值、符號或通道加總。不同選擇產生不同視圖，不能當作唯一客觀解釋。\n\n## 一個有已知答案的模型\n\n範例39設定f(x)=2x1−x2，梯度固定[2,−1]，並以中央差分驗證。這讓我們先確認程式真正在對輸入求導，而非混入權重梯度或錯誤聚合。對複雜網路，有限差分也只驗證局部導數，並未證明視覺化符合人類的語意。\n\n$$\nf(x+\\delta)\\approx f(x)+\\nabla_x f(x)^T\\delta\n$$\n\n## 飽和與尺度的陷阱\n\nsigmoid接近0或1時，機率對輸入的局部梯度可能很小；這不表示該輸入在整個決策中不重要。若x'=(x−μ)/s，則對原始輸入的梯度還有1/s因子。直接比較不同單位特徵的數字大小，可能只在比較單位。\n\n## 關聯不能直接當因果\n\n熱圖顯示模型對背景敏感，值得設計背景替換的測試，但還不能證明現實因素的因果關係。遮擋或替換也可能產生訓練外輸入；先確定擾動是否合理、是否保留標籤，再看性能與預測如何改變。對幾筆樣本的漂亮圖，保留其個案範圍。\n\n## 檢查流程\n\n先eval固定模型，僅讓輸入requires_grad。對單一指定分數backward或autograd.grad，確認shape與有限值，再與已知線性函數、有限差分做校對。若批次輸出總和求導，還須知道模型是否有跨樣本運算，例如訓練態BatchNorm，否則樣本間可能互相影響。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n梯度為[2,−1]，擾動[.01,.03]的一階分數變化是多少？答案：.02−.03=−.01，本例線性所以精確成立。這能證明第二特徵在現實中造成結果嗎？不能；這只描述模型函數及指定擾動。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/39_saliency.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A known input gradient checked with central differences.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    model=nn.Linear(2,1,bias=False)\n    with torch.no_grad():model.weight.copy_(torch.tensor([[2.,-1.]]))\n    x=torch.tensor([[.3,.8]],requires_grad=True)\n    model(x).sum().backward();epsilon=.001\n    plus=x.detach().clone();minus=x.detach().clone();plus[0,0]+=epsilon;minus[0,0]-=epsilon\n    difference=((model(plus)-model(minus))/(2*epsilon)).item()\n    result={'input_gradient':x.grad,'first_coordinate_finite_difference':difference,\n            'scope':'local model sensitivity, not causal feature effects'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [自動微分介面](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html)\n- [Autograd計算圖](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "模型看哪裡：梯度敏感度與解釋的界線", "html": "模型看哪裡：梯度敏感度與解釋的界線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "對輸入求導", "html": "對輸入求導", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一個有已知答案的模型", "html": "一個有已知答案的模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "飽和與尺度的陷阱", "html": "飽和與尺度的陷阱", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "關聯不能直接當因果", "html": "關聯不能直接當因果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "檢查流程", "html": "檢查流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "59-robustness", "group": "reliability", "title": "穩健性：定義哪些改變應該不影響答案", "summary": "將自然擾動、分布移動與梯度敏感度轉成有條件的測試，而非籠統聲稱模型穩健。", "tags": ["robustness", "distribution shift", "perturbation", "invariance"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">穩健性：定義哪些改變應該不影響答案</h1>\n<p>將自然擾動、分布移動與梯度敏感度轉成有條件的測試，而非籠統聲稱模型穩健。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先寫不變的條件</h2>\n<p>對亮帶方向分類，移動帶的位置應保留方向；旋轉90度卻會交換水平與垂直標籤。如果隨機旋轉後沿用原標籤，就是製造錯標。序列任務若由最後token決定，改變前面的token應保持答案，改最後token可能真的改標籤。穩健性必須和任務定義綁在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">對照組先固定</h2>\n<p>以同一批原始測試資料生成指定強度的擾動，記錄原本及擾動後正確率、預測翻轉率與分組差異。只挑原本正確的樣本和使用全資料的分母不同，報告須明說。若看過這些結果後持續改模型，應保留新的最終測試資料，避免測試集變成開發集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">梯度可以指出敏感方向</h2>\n<p>在可微分loss下，受限的小擾動可用一階近似分析。若各座標限制在±ε，朝梯度符號方向會增加線性化loss；這是本地、近似的敏感度探查，不保證真實loss一定增加，也不代表該擾動在領域中合理。原始值有範圍時還需投影回合法集合。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\max_{\\lVert\\delta\\rVert_\\infty\\leq\\epsilon}\n\\nabla_x L^T\\delta=\\epsilon\\lVert\\nabla_xL\\rVert_1,\n\\qquad \\delta=\\epsilon\\operatorname{sign}(\\nabla_x L)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">深度學習的防過度結論</h2>\n<p>增加某種噪音訓練，可能提高對該噪音的容忍度，卻不保證對不同感測器、罕見類別或新的資料來源有效。一般擾動、刻意找敏感方向以及真正分布外資料，應各自定義測試。局部測試通過，只支持那個範圍內的觀察。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">本課可以做的低成本實驗</h2>\n<p>從第34章的CNN改一個設定：保持方向規則，讓test亮帶位置超出train範圍，再檢查準確率。這是新的分布移動實驗，應使用新資料生成器和保留validation選擇設定。也可比較同樣參數量附近的MLP、CNN，但不能同時改資料量和訓練步數後把差異全歸因於卷積。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>為何「圖像加噪後模型輸出相同」不一定值得慶祝？答案：如果原輸出已錯，維持錯誤不是正確率改善；若擾動其實改變真實標籤，不變反而可能錯。先驗證標籤保持條件，再同時報告正確率與翻轉率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html\">泛化與正則化背景</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html\">Autograd輸入導數</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 穩健性：定義哪些改變應該不影響答案\n\n將自然擾動、分布移動與梯度敏感度轉成有條件的測試，而非籠統聲稱模型穩健。\n\n## 先寫不變的條件\n\n對亮帶方向分類，移動帶的位置應保留方向；旋轉90度卻會交換水平與垂直標籤。如果隨機旋轉後沿用原標籤，就是製造錯標。序列任務若由最後token決定，改變前面的token應保持答案，改最後token可能真的改標籤。穩健性必須和任務定義綁在一起。\n\n## 對照組先固定\n\n以同一批原始測試資料生成指定強度的擾動，記錄原本及擾動後正確率、預測翻轉率與分組差異。只挑原本正確的樣本和使用全資料的分母不同，報告須明說。若看過這些結果後持續改模型，應保留新的最終測試資料，避免測試集變成開發集。\n\n## 梯度可以指出敏感方向\n\n在可微分loss下，受限的小擾動可用一階近似分析。若各座標限制在±ε，朝梯度符號方向會增加線性化loss；這是本地、近似的敏感度探查，不保證真實loss一定增加，也不代表該擾動在領域中合理。原始值有範圍時還需投影回合法集合。\n\n$$\n\\max_{\\lVert\\delta\\rVert_\\infty\\leq\\epsilon}\n\\nabla_x L^T\\delta=\\epsilon\\lVert\\nabla_xL\\rVert_1,\n\\qquad \\delta=\\epsilon\\operatorname{sign}(\\nabla_x L)\n$$\n\n## 深度學習的防過度結論\n\n增加某種噪音訓練，可能提高對該噪音的容忍度，卻不保證對不同感測器、罕見類別或新的資料來源有效。一般擾動、刻意找敏感方向以及真正分布外資料，應各自定義測試。局部測試通過，只支持那個範圍內的觀察。\n\n## 本課可以做的低成本實驗\n\n從第34章的CNN改一個設定：保持方向規則，讓test亮帶位置超出train範圍，再檢查準確率。這是新的分布移動實驗，應使用新資料生成器和保留validation選擇設定。也可比較同樣參數量附近的MLP、CNN，但不能同時改資料量和訓練步數後把差異全歸因於卷積。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n為何「圖像加噪後模型輸出相同」不一定值得慶祝？答案：如果原輸出已錯，維持錯誤不是正確率改善；若擾動其實改變真實標籤，不變反而可能錯。先驗證標籤保持條件，再同時報告正確率與翻轉率。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [泛化與正則化背景](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/regularization.html)\n- [Autograd輸入導數](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "穩健性：定義哪些改變應該不影響答案", "html": "穩健性：定義哪些改變應該不影響答案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先寫不變的條件", "html": "先寫不變的條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "對照組先固定", "html": "對照組先固定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "梯度可以指出敏感方向", "html": "梯度可以指出敏感方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "深度學習的防過度結論", "html": "深度學習的防過度結論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "本課可以做的低成本實驗", "html": "本課可以做的低成本實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "60-distillation", "group": "reliability", "title": "知識蒸餾：讓小模型學標籤，也學老師的分布", "summary": "推導溫度、KL方向及T平方縮放，實作凍結teacher與student更新。", "tags": ["distillation", "teacher", "student", "temperature", "compression"], "example": "40_distillation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">知識蒸餾：讓小模型學標籤，也學老師的分布</h1>\n<p>推導溫度、KL方向及T平方縮放，實作凍結teacher與student更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">為何不只給硬標籤</h2>\n<p>真實標籤提供目標類別，teacher的完整分布則提供其類別相對判斷。student可以同時學二者，代價是繼承teacher錯誤與偏差。小模型的容量、資料及訓練設定都影響結果，不能預設蒸餾一定提升準確率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">目標與方向</h2>\n<p>teacher機率作為固定目標，student提供log機率，計算KL(teacher∥student)。本課以batchmean reduction，soft項乘T²，hard項使用未除T的student logits做CE。T²是常見的尺度補償慣例，改T仍會改變目標與梯度，不表示任意溫度完全等價。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL=\\lambda L_{\\rm CE}(z_s,y)\n +(1-\\lambda)T^2D_{\\rm KL}\n \\left(\\operatorname{softmax}(z_t/T)\\Vert\n \\operatorname{softmax}(z_s/T)\\right)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"teacher\">teacher確實不能更新</h2>\n<p>先完成teacher訓練，設eval並關閉其參數梯度，以no_grad取得teacher logits，再detach目標分布。student仍需完整梯度。只呼叫eval不會阻止teacher autograd；只detach目標也不會切換Dropout／BatchNorm。模式與計算圖是兩條不同控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">範例的公平範圍</h2>\n<p>第40例用MLP寬24作teacher，寬6作student，參數分別770與86；teacher先訓練12epochs，student18epochs，回報驗證結果與參數量。這是可執行流程，尚未完成同預算、跨seed、hard-only student的完整比較，也沒有量測實機延遲。因此不要把參數減少直接稱為等比例加速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">怎麼擴成真正比較</h2>\n<p>保留固定資料和student初始化，比較hard-only、soft-only與混合目標。teacher只看train，T與λ只依validation調整，最後各用一次test。測推論延遲時固定batch、輸入shape、裝置與暖機方式，GPU還需正確同步，這部分接到PyTorch工程課。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若teacher和student的soft分布完全相同，KL是多少？答案為0；hard CE仍可能大於0，因為相同分布不表示對真實類別給機率1。若teacher梯度在step後累積，應檢查哪裡？答案：是否漏了no_grad／detach，以及optimizer是否誤含teacher參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/40_distillation.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a small student from hard labels and detached teacher soft targets.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">train_epoch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">distillation_loss</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tabular&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">loaders</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">teacher_optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.02</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">):</span><span class=\"n\">train_epoch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">teacher_optimizer</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">MLP</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">width</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.02</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">18</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">distillation_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">temperature</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">hard_weight</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;teacher_parameters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">teacher</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;student_parameters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;student_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;student_test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">evaluate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">student</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fixed toy distillation configuration; no claim that the student matches or beats the teacher&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531\">知識蒸餾原始研究</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.KLDivLoss.html\">KLDivLoss慣例</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 知識蒸餾：讓小模型學標籤，也學老師的分布\n\n推導溫度、KL方向及T平方縮放，實作凍結teacher與student更新。\n\n## 為何不只給硬標籤\n\n真實標籤提供目標類別，teacher的完整分布則提供其類別相對判斷。student可以同時學二者，代價是繼承teacher錯誤與偏差。小模型的容量、資料及訓練設定都影響結果，不能預設蒸餾一定提升準確率。\n\n## 目標與方向\n\nteacher機率作為固定目標，student提供log機率，計算KL(teacher∥student)。本課以batchmean reduction，soft項乘T²，hard項使用未除T的student logits做CE。T²是常見的尺度補償慣例，改T仍會改變目標與梯度，不表示任意溫度完全等價。\n\n$$\nL=\\lambda L_{\\rm CE}(z_s,y)\n +(1-\\lambda)T^2D_{\\rm KL}\n \\left(\\operatorname{softmax}(z_t/T)\\Vert\n \\operatorname{softmax}(z_s/T)\\right)\n$$\n\n## teacher確實不能更新\n\n先完成teacher訓練，設eval並關閉其參數梯度，以no_grad取得teacher logits，再detach目標分布。student仍需完整梯度。只呼叫eval不會阻止teacher autograd；只detach目標也不會切換Dropout／BatchNorm。模式與計算圖是兩條不同控制。\n\n## 範例的公平範圍\n\n第40例用MLP寬24作teacher，寬6作student，參數分別770與86；teacher先訓練12epochs，student18epochs，回報驗證結果與參數量。這是可執行流程，尚未完成同預算、跨seed、hard-only student的完整比較，也沒有量測實機延遲。因此不要把參數減少直接稱為等比例加速。\n\n## 怎麼擴成真正比較\n\n保留固定資料和student初始化，比較hard-only、soft-only與混合目標。teacher只看train，T與λ只依validation調整，最後各用一次test。測推論延遲時固定batch、輸入shape、裝置與暖機方式，GPU還需正確同步，這部分接到PyTorch工程課。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若teacher和student的soft分布完全相同，KL是多少？答案為0；hard CE仍可能大於0，因為相同分布不表示對真實類別給機率1。若teacher梯度在step後累積，應檢查哪裡？答案：是否漏了no_grad／detach，以及optimizer是否誤含teacher參數。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/40_distillation.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a small student from hard labels and detached teacher soft targets.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import MLP,make_loaders,train_epoch,evaluate,distillation_loss\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    loaders,_=make_loaders('tabular');train,validation,test=loaders\n    teacher=MLP();teacher_optimizer=torch.optim.AdamW(teacher.parameters(),lr=.02)\n    for _ in range(12):train_epoch(teacher,train,teacher_optimizer)\n    teacher.eval()\n    for p in teacher.parameters():p.requires_grad_(False)\n    student=MLP(width=6);optimizer=torch.optim.AdamW(student.parameters(),lr=.02)\n    for _ in range(18):\n        student.train()\n        for x,y in train:\n            with torch.no_grad():target=teacher(x)\n            optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n            loss=distillation_loss(student(x),target,y,temperature=2.,hard_weight=.5)\n            loss.backward();optimizer.step()\n    result={'teacher_parameters':sum(p.numel() for p in teacher.parameters()),\n            'student_parameters':sum(p.numel() for p in student.parameters()),\n            'student_validation':evaluate(student,validation),'student_test':evaluate(student,test),\n            'scope':'fixed toy distillation configuration; no claim that the student matches or beats the teacher'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [知識蒸餾原始研究](https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531)\n- [KLDivLoss慣例](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.KLDivLoss.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "知識蒸餾：讓小模型學標籤，也學老師的分布", "html": "知識蒸餾：讓小模型學標籤，也學老師的分布", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "為何不只給硬標籤", "html": "為何不只給硬標籤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "目標與方向", "html": "目標與方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "teacher", "name": "teacher確實不能更新", "html": "teacher確實不能更新", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "範例的公平範圍", "html": "範例的公平範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "怎麼擴成真正比較", "html": "怎麼擴成真正比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "61-tabular-project", "group": "projects", "title": "專題一：非線性表格分類的完整實驗", "summary": "從已知生成規則到模型選擇，讀懂資料、指標與每次權重更新的責任。", "tags": ["project", "tabular", "MLP", "validation", "baseline"], "example": "41_tabular_project.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">專題一：非線性表格分類的完整實驗</h1>\n<p>從已知生成規則到模型選擇，讀懂資料、指標與每次權重更新的責任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">任務不是一張模糊的表格</h2>\n<p>本專題生成480筆、每筆4個常態特徵，標籤依x1x2+.25x3−.1x4&gt;0。交乘讓它含非線性交互，MLP可學這種表示。因為規則公開，直接計算規則有完美答案；這是教學用oracle，現實未知標籤通常沒有可直接查詢的規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">切分與前處理</h2>\n<p>固定生成器及打散，分成288筆train、96筆validation、96筆test。均值及母體標準差只用train估，再轉換其他集合。保留原始schema與統計，避免交付時用三筆新資料重算scaler，使相同輸入的結果依同批其他資料而變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">模型與訓練協定</h2>\n<p>4→24→24→2的ReLU MLP共有770個參數。batch24、AdamW lr=.02、weight_decay=.001，訓練24epochs。每epoch以validation loss挑最佳快照，再載回最佳state；保存快照使用detach／clone，避免被後續更新覆寫。accuracy為輔助指標，主選擇標準在訓練前就寫好。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat e=\\arg\\min_{e\\in\\{1,\\ldots,24\\}}L_{\\rm val}(\\theta_e),\n\\qquad m_{\\rm test}=m(\\theta_{\\hat e};D_{\\rm test})\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">看懂執行結果</h2>\n<p>第41例真的訓練、評估並回報起始與最佳validation，以及最後test。不要逐epoch查看test或用test選寬度。若改loss為sum，或最後batch大小不同，樣本加權的epoch平均也需一起檢查；現有train與evaluate都依實際樣本數統計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">可獨立完成的延伸</h2>\n<p>先建不含交互項的linear baseline，再加入已知x1x2人工特徵，與MLP比較。這可以辨認收益來自函數表示還是其他訓練條件。保持split與評估一致；若你看過test後又調整，換新的保留集作最終驗收。第42例再把整套前處理與模型包成推論artifact。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>validation最佳在第17epoch，但第24epoch train loss最低，交付哪一份？依本協定交付第17epoch快照。為何不把test最高的epoch交付？因為這會讓test參與選擇，原本的最終估計就失去保留意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/41_tabular_project.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A nonlinear tabular MLP with train-only scaling and best-validation selection.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tabular&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;last_epoch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;history&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;synthetic nonlinear rule; test evaluates the validation-selected model&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_9\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">Dataset與DataLoader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">模組狀態保存</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.optim.AdamW.html\">AdamW參數</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 專題一：非線性表格分類的完整實驗\n\n從已知生成規則到模型選擇，讀懂資料、指標與每次權重更新的責任。\n\n## 任務不是一張模糊的表格\n\n本專題生成480筆、每筆4個常態特徵，標籤依x1x2+.25x3−.1x4>0。交乘讓它含非線性交互，MLP可學這種表示。因為規則公開，直接計算規則有完美答案；這是教學用oracle，現實未知標籤通常沒有可直接查詢的規則。\n\n## 切分與前處理\n\n固定生成器及打散，分成288筆train、96筆validation、96筆test。均值及母體標準差只用train估，再轉換其他集合。保留原始schema與統計，避免交付時用三筆新資料重算scaler，使相同輸入的結果依同批其他資料而變。\n\n## 模型與訓練協定\n\n4→24→24→2的ReLU MLP共有770個參數。batch24、AdamW lr=.02、weight_decay=.001，訓練24epochs。每epoch以validation loss挑最佳快照，再載回最佳state；保存快照使用detach／clone，避免被後續更新覆寫。accuracy為輔助指標，主選擇標準在訓練前就寫好。\n\n$$\n\\hat e=\\arg\\min_{e\\in\\{1,\\ldots,24\\}}L_{\\rm val}(\\theta_e),\n\\qquad m_{\\rm test}=m(\\theta_{\\hat e};D_{\\rm test})\n$$\n\n## 看懂執行結果\n\n第41例真的訓練、評估並回報起始與最佳validation，以及最後test。不要逐epoch查看test或用test選寬度。若改loss為sum，或最後batch大小不同，樣本加權的epoch平均也需一起檢查；現有train與evaluate都依實際樣本數統計。\n\n## 可獨立完成的延伸\n\n先建不含交互項的linear baseline，再加入已知x1x2人工特徵，與MLP比較。這可以辨認收益來自函數表示還是其他訓練條件。保持split與評估一致；若你看過test後又調整，換新的保留集作最終驗收。第42例再把整套前處理與模型包成推論artifact。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nvalidation最佳在第17epoch，但第24epoch train loss最低，交付哪一份？依本協定交付第17epoch快照。為何不把test最高的epoch交付？因為這會讓test參與選擇，原本的最終估計就失去保留意義。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/41_tabular_project.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A nonlinear tabular MLP with train-only scaling and best-validation selection.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom course_core import experiment\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    run=experiment('tabular')\n    result={'initial_validation':run['initial_validation'],'best_validation':run['best_validation'],\n            'test':run['test'],'last_epoch':run['history'][-1],\n            'scope':'synthetic nonlinear rule; test evaluates the validation-selected model'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Dataset與DataLoader](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [模組狀態保存](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n- [AdamW參數](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.optim.AdamW.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "專題一：非線性表格分類的完整實驗", "html": "專題一：非線性表格分類的完整實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "任務不是一張模糊的表格", "html": "任務不是一張模糊的表格", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "切分與前處理", "html": "切分與前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "模型與訓練協定", "html": "模型與訓練協定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "看懂執行結果", "html": "看懂執行結果", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "可獨立完成的延伸", "html": "可獨立完成的延伸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "62-image-project", "group": "projects", "title": "專題二：CNN學到方向，還是記住位置", "summary": "用合成亮帶資料建立可解釋的影像實驗，明確拆開架構能力與資料捷徑。", "tags": ["project", "CNN", "image", "shortcut learning"], "html": "<h1 id=\"cnn\">專題二：CNN學到方向，還是記住位置</h1>\n<p>用合成亮帶資料建立可解釋的影像實驗，明確拆開架構能力與資料捷徑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先把影像任務規格寫成文字</h2>\n<p>每張影像1×8×8，有水平或垂直的兩像素寬亮帶，疊加小幅常態噪音，位置在1至5之間。180張固定切成108／36／36。它不代表真實物體辨識，沒有顏色、遮擋、語意或自然背景；得到高正確率只支持在此生成機制的方向分類。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">簡單方法先回答問題</h2>\n<p>可以用行和與列和的最大值差作方向啟發式，或把64像素攤平成線性分類。公開規則可幫助我們發現資料錯誤，不能用它冒充學得的泛化能力。比較啟發式與CNN時，將各自假設寫清楚，尤其是否依賴亮帶的位置或固定亮度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shape\">從shape驗算網路</h2>\n<p>第23例使用Conv1→6、3×3padding1，第二層Conv6→8、3×3stride2padding1。空間8×8到4×4，攤平8×4×4=128再分類。第二層對輸入的理論感受野是5、jump為2，並不自動代表每個像素有相同重要性。想復習完整程式，回到第34章執行同一入口，而非另維護一份略有差異的訓練器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">驗收時要看哪些錯誤</h2>\n<p>固定test只在選定模型後使用一次，保存混淆情形、按位置分組的正確率，以及噪音較大時的錯誤。平均分數可能很好，邊界位置卻特別差；這時應檢查padding與資料覆蓋，而非直接加深網路。只有36張test，分組後更少，需呈現分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">下一輪實驗怎麼改</h2>\n<p>預先規劃一輪位置外推實驗：train只看中間位置、validation沿用開發範圍、另建外側位置測試。保持方向標籤不變，記錄新的切分規則。這與原來隨機切分是不同問題，不可將兩個數字直接當作架構進退。若加入旋轉90度增強，必須同步交換標籤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型把影像攤平後輸入Linear(8,2)，為何失敗？攤平後每張是64個數，Linear的in_features要對上64；CNN範例則是128。若改用<code>view(-1,8)</code>湊shape，會把單張拆成多筆，形狀雖能對上，樣本語意和標籤數卻已錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html\">Conv2d輸出與參數</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html\">卷積網路原理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 專題二：CNN學到方向，還是記住位置\n\n用合成亮帶資料建立可解釋的影像實驗，明確拆開架構能力與資料捷徑。\n\n## 先把影像任務規格寫成文字\n\n每張影像1×8×8，有水平或垂直的兩像素寬亮帶，疊加小幅常態噪音，位置在1至5之間。180張固定切成108／36／36。它不代表真實物體辨識，沒有顏色、遮擋、語意或自然背景；得到高正確率只支持在此生成機制的方向分類。\n\n## 簡單方法先回答問題\n\n可以用行和與列和的最大值差作方向啟發式，或把64像素攤平成線性分類。公開規則可幫助我們發現資料錯誤，不能用它冒充學得的泛化能力。比較啟發式與CNN時，將各自假設寫清楚，尤其是否依賴亮帶的位置或固定亮度。\n\n## 從shape驗算網路\n\n第23例使用Conv1→6、3×3padding1，第二層Conv6→8、3×3stride2padding1。空間8×8到4×4，攤平8×4×4=128再分類。第二層對輸入的理論感受野是5、jump為2，並不自動代表每個像素有相同重要性。想復習完整程式，回到第34章執行同一入口，而非另維護一份略有差異的訓練器。\n\n## 驗收時要看哪些錯誤\n\n固定test只在選定模型後使用一次，保存混淆情形、按位置分組的正確率，以及噪音較大時的錯誤。平均分數可能很好，邊界位置卻特別差；這時應檢查padding與資料覆蓋，而非直接加深網路。只有36張test，分組後更少，需呈現分母。\n\n## 下一輪實驗怎麼改\n\n預先規劃一輪位置外推實驗：train只看中間位置、validation沿用開發範圍、另建外側位置測試。保持方向標籤不變，記錄新的切分規則。這與原來隨機切分是不同問題，不可將兩個數字直接當作架構進退。若加入旋轉90度增強，必須同步交換標籤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型把影像攤平後輸入Linear(8,2)，為何失敗？攤平後每張是64個數，Linear的in_features要對上64；CNN範例則是128。若改用`view(-1,8)`湊shape，會把單張拆成多筆，形狀雖能對上，樣本語意和標籤數卻已錯。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Conv2d輸出與參數](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.Conv2d.html)\n- [卷積網路原理](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/convnets.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cnn", "name": "專題二：CNN學到方向，還是記住位置", "html": "專題二：CNN學到方向，還是記住位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先把影像任務規格寫成文字", "html": "先把影像任務規格寫成文字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "簡單方法先回答問題", "html": "簡單方法先回答問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "shape", "name": "從shape驗算網路", "html": "從shape驗算網路", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "驗收時要看哪些錯誤", "html": "驗收時要看哪些錯誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "下一輪實驗怎麼改", "html": "下一輪實驗怎麼改", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "63-sequence-project", "group": "projects", "title": "專題三：變長序列、最後token與有效長度", "summary": "把padding、packed sequence與任務規則連成可測試的序列分類流程。", "tags": ["project", "GRU", "packed sequence", "padding", "length"], "html": "<h1 id=\"token\">專題三：變長序列、最後token與有效長度</h1>\n<p>把padding、packed sequence與任務規則連成可測試的序列分類流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"baseline\">任務與一個很強的baseline</h2>\n<p>240筆序列，長度2至7，token為1至8，標籤為最後有效token是否至少5。切成144／48／48。直接讀最後有效token就能100%符合生成規則，所以GRU在此是流程教學，不是比規則更好的方法。當你知道真實問題有這種可靠規則，通常應先使用規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">批次不等於同樣長度</h2>\n<p>collate將一批補到其中最大長度，PAD保留為0，長度另以CPU long tensor保存。Embedding有9個ID、維度8、padding_idx=0；GRU hidden12，最後hidden接Linear2。pack_padded_sequence會依有效長度排除尾端padding，enforce_sorted=False允許批次未預先排序。此例全為非空序列，不能用長度0偷渡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">為何不是拿最後一欄</h2>\n<p>對不同長度直接用output[:,-1]，短序列可能讀到padding後狀態。即使PAD embedding為零，RNN還有偏置與recurrent轉換，走過一個零向量仍可能改hidden。可以用正確length索引最後有效輸出，或如本例採packed sequence並取對應最後hidden。雙向或多層網路還要另外理解hidden的層／方向維度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">驗證不變性</h2>\n<p>先用相同有效token但不同額外尾端padding，比較預測，長度都保持原有效值。再只改早期token，檢查模型是否近似遵守最後token規則；這不是任何參數都保證成立，但可作為學習行為的測試。最後改最後token，確認標籤與預測能跟著變。資料生成規則提供我們清楚的期望。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">從本課走向真實序列</h2>\n<p>真實資料需先決定序列邊界、時間順序、同一個體是否跨split，以及缺值與事件間隔如何編碼。文本還有tokenizer、詞彙外與截斷政策。不可因本例使用Embedding就視為已經完成自然語言理解；任務資訊和表示仍非常簡化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>長度為[2,4]、張量寬度4，第一筆最後有效索引是多少？答案：1，因索引從0開始。若所有padding都設attention mask，能否取代GRU的pack？不能；GRU沒有自動讀Attention mask參數，必須使用其支援的長度處理或手動選取有效狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.utils.rnn.pack_padded_sequence.html\">Packed sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html\">GRU輸入與hidden</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 專題三：變長序列、最後token與有效長度\n\n把padding、packed sequence與任務規則連成可測試的序列分類流程。\n\n## 任務與一個很強的baseline\n\n240筆序列，長度2至7，token為1至8，標籤為最後有效token是否至少5。切成144／48／48。直接讀最後有效token就能100%符合生成規則，所以GRU在此是流程教學，不是比規則更好的方法。當你知道真實問題有這種可靠規則，通常應先使用規則。\n\n## 批次不等於同樣長度\n\ncollate將一批補到其中最大長度，PAD保留為0，長度另以CPU long tensor保存。Embedding有9個ID、維度8、padding_idx=0；GRU hidden12，最後hidden接Linear2。pack_padded_sequence會依有效長度排除尾端padding，enforce_sorted=False允許批次未預先排序。此例全為非空序列，不能用長度0偷渡。\n\n## 為何不是拿最後一欄\n\n對不同長度直接用output[:,-1]，短序列可能讀到padding後狀態。即使PAD embedding為零，RNN還有偏置與recurrent轉換，走過一個零向量仍可能改hidden。可以用正確length索引最後有效輸出，或如本例採packed sequence並取對應最後hidden。雙向或多層網路還要另外理解hidden的層／方向維度。\n\n## 驗證不變性\n\n先用相同有效token但不同額外尾端padding，比較預測，長度都保持原有效值。再只改早期token，檢查模型是否近似遵守最後token規則；這不是任何參數都保證成立，但可作為學習行為的測試。最後改最後token，確認標籤與預測能跟著變。資料生成規則提供我們清楚的期望。\n\n## 從本課走向真實序列\n\n真實資料需先決定序列邊界、時間順序、同一個體是否跨split，以及缺值與事件間隔如何編碼。文本還有tokenizer、詞彙外與截斷政策。不可因本例使用Embedding就視為已經完成自然語言理解；任務資訊和表示仍非常簡化。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n長度為[2,4]、張量寬度4，第一筆最後有效索引是多少？答案：1，因索引從0開始。若所有padding都設attention mask，能否取代GRU的pack？不能；GRU沒有自動讀Attention mask參數，必須使用其支援的長度處理或手動選取有效狀態。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Packed sequence](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.utils.rnn.pack_padded_sequence.html)\n- [GRU輸入與hidden](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.nn.GRU.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "token", "name": "專題三：變長序列、最後token與有效長度", "html": "專題三：變長序列、最後token與有效長度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "baseline", "name": "任務與一個很強的baseline", "html": "任務與一個很強的baseline", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "批次不等於同樣長度", "html": "批次不等於同樣長度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "為何不是拿最後一欄", "html": "為何不是拿最後一欄", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "驗證不變性", "html": "驗證不變性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "從本課走向真實序列", "html": "從本課走向真實序列", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "64-generative-project", "group": "projects", "title": "專題四：用低維生成實驗檢驗你的理解", "summary": "比較AE、VAE、GAN、Diffusion與Flow Matching實際做的運算及各自的驗收條件。", "tags": ["project", "generative models", "DDPM", "flow matching", "evaluation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">專題四：用低維生成實驗檢驗你的理解</h1>\n<p>比較AE、VAE、GAN、Diffusion與Flow Matching實際做的運算及各自的驗收條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">五個入口，各有不同問題</h2>\n<p>第34至38例各自執行AE、β-VAE、GAN、1D DDPM與1D Flow Matching。AE／VAE用二維曲線資料；GAN用二維平移Gaussian；DDPM用一維雙峰；Flow用一維目標Gaussian。這些資料並不相同，不能直接把各例loss排成排行榜。目的是看清目標、梯度及採樣如何連接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">先驗證不依賴「好看」的契約</h2>\n<p>AE重建loss應有限並在固定資料上下降；VAE的KL在μ=0、logvar=0時應為0；GAN的D step不更新G、G step能穿過D對G求導。Diffusion檢查alpha_bar乘積、q_sample閉式公式和每步posterior variance；Flow檢查端點、target velocity與Euler步進。這些都可用已知值測試，比肉眼挑好看的樣本更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">採樣必須真的執行</h2>\n<p>DDPM例真的從Gaussian逐步反向去噪，Flow例真的以學得速度場做30步Euler積分。它們的CPU小網路、有限步數與訓練預算都有限制。DDPM最後alpha_bar仍非精確0，將其視為近似standard normal起點是模型協定的近似之一。不能把一個平滑動畫當作已訓練的生成器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"probe\">固定probe與新樣本</h2>\n<p>比較訓練前後noise prediction時，固定clean、time與noise，避免每次換題造成假改善。另用新noise評估持出資料，查看生成分布的均值、散布、模式覆蓋與種子間差異。雙峰分布只生成中間點，也可能有相同均值，所以必須看分布。採樣步數對品質和成本的影響應另作實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">自己建立一份生成報告</h2>\n<p>寫出資料分布、目標公式、訓練樣本與步數、sampler及噪音排程，再列可證明的測試和無法證明的品質。若改動β、GAN更新比例或Flow coupling，先更改單一因素。不要把VAE deterministic mean reconstruction的MSE叫作ELBO，也不要把GAN loss有限叫作收斂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>Flow的target分布平均2，採樣平均也約2，是否足以驗收？不夠。還要檢查變異、分位數或分布距離，以及固定預算下重跑差異。若所有樣本都等於2，平均正確但分布明顯不對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239\">DDPM原始方法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747\">Flow Matching原始方法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114\">VAE原始方法</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 專題四：用低維生成實驗檢驗你的理解\n\n比較AE、VAE、GAN、Diffusion與Flow Matching實際做的運算及各自的驗收條件。\n\n## 五個入口，各有不同問題\n\n第34至38例各自執行AE、β-VAE、GAN、1D DDPM與1D Flow Matching。AE／VAE用二維曲線資料；GAN用二維平移Gaussian；DDPM用一維雙峰；Flow用一維目標Gaussian。這些資料並不相同，不能直接把各例loss排成排行榜。目的是看清目標、梯度及採樣如何連接。\n\n## 先驗證不依賴「好看」的契約\n\nAE重建loss應有限並在固定資料上下降；VAE的KL在μ=0、logvar=0時應為0；GAN的D step不更新G、G step能穿過D對G求導。Diffusion檢查alpha_bar乘積、q_sample閉式公式和每步posterior variance；Flow檢查端點、target velocity與Euler步進。這些都可用已知值測試，比肉眼挑好看的樣本更可靠。\n\n## 採樣必須真的執行\n\nDDPM例真的從Gaussian逐步反向去噪，Flow例真的以學得速度場做30步Euler積分。它們的CPU小網路、有限步數與訓練預算都有限制。DDPM最後alpha_bar仍非精確0，將其視為近似standard normal起點是模型協定的近似之一。不能把一個平滑動畫當作已訓練的生成器。\n\n## 固定probe與新樣本\n\n比較訓練前後noise prediction時，固定clean、time與noise，避免每次換題造成假改善。另用新noise評估持出資料，查看生成分布的均值、散布、模式覆蓋與種子間差異。雙峰分布只生成中間點，也可能有相同均值，所以必須看分布。採樣步數對品質和成本的影響應另作實驗。\n\n## 自己建立一份生成報告\n\n寫出資料分布、目標公式、訓練樣本與步數、sampler及噪音排程，再列可證明的測試和無法證明的品質。若改動β、GAN更新比例或Flow coupling，先更改單一因素。不要把VAE deterministic mean reconstruction的MSE叫作ELBO，也不要把GAN loss有限叫作收斂。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nFlow的target分布平均2，採樣平均也約2，是否足以驗收？不夠。還要檢查變異、分位數或分布距離，以及固定預算下重跑差異。若所有樣本都等於2，平均正確但分布明顯不對。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [DDPM原始方法](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239)\n- [Flow Matching原始方法](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747)\n- [VAE原始方法](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6114)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "專題四：用低維生成實驗檢驗你的理解", "html": "專題四：用低維生成實驗檢驗你的理解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "五個入口，各有不同問題", "html": "五個入口，各有不同問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "先驗證不依賴「好看」的契約", "html": "先驗證不依賴「好看」的契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "採樣必須真的執行", "html": "採樣必須真的執行", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "probe", "name": "固定probe與新樣本", "html": "固定probe與新樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "自己建立一份生成報告", "html": "自己建立一份生成報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "65-model-choice", "group": "projects", "title": "選模型與寫模型卡：把假設留給下一位使用者", "summary": "整理任務、資料、架構與限制，讓結果可以被理解、比較與接手。", "tags": ["model selection", "model card", "inductive bias", "budget"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">選模型與寫模型卡：把假設留給下一位使用者</h1>\n<p>整理任務、資料、架構與限制，讓結果可以被理解、比較與接手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先選問題，再選架構</h2>\n<p>小型表格資料可先用線性／樹模型；局部圖像模式適合先試CNN；變長序列可比較pooling、RNN與Attention。這些是起點假設，並非架構與領域的一對一規則。資料量、標籤品質、部署資源和已知不變性，往往比追逐較大的名稱更直接影響選擇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一份能接手的模型卡</h2>\n<p>用文字記錄輸入schema、目標定義、適用範圍、資料生成／來源、切分單位、前處理、架構、訓練版本及選擇規則。再寫總體與分組評估、baseline、成本與已知失敗。若資料是合成的，就把它放在第一段，不要讓讀者誤認為是真實場域成績。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">比較需要對齊哪些條件</h2>\n<p>模型A跑10epochs、模型B跑100epochs，不一定能把差異歸因於架構。固定epoch也不保證計算量相同，所以應同時列訓練步數、實測時間與搜尋預算。參數量、FLOPs、記憶體和延遲不是同一量；更小的模型也可能因算子與裝置支援而較慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">不同指標代表不同決策</h2>\n<p>若漏判成本較高，accuracy可能不足；若需要可信機率，就加NLL或Brier；若部署有延遲上限，就先篩掉超時模型。指標與門檻要在最終test之前決定。多個目標常形成取捨，不必用任意加權成一個神秘分數掩蓋它們。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">本課的模型卡範例</h2>\n<p>表格MLP：原始輸入[N,4]有限浮點數，類別0／1；只對指定合成分布驗證。train統計內嵌artifact，2.15.0 CPU、seed7、24epochs、validation loss選快照。未測試真實資料、GPU效能、跨版本重載與分布外可靠性。這樣的限制可以讓下一位使用者知道該補哪些證據，而非猜測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>假設兩個模型準確率相同，B的NLL較低但延遲超過需求，應選誰？答案取決於事先明定的使用條件；若延遲為硬限制，B不能直接上線。可以再探索蒸餾或其他模型，但要重新以相同協定驗證，不能只報最有利的一欄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html\">學習與模型選擇背景</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/benchmark_utils.html\">PyTorch基準量測工具</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 選模型與寫模型卡：把假設留給下一位使用者\n\n整理任務、資料、架構與限制，讓結果可以被理解、比較與接手。\n\n## 先選問題，再選架構\n\n小型表格資料可先用線性／樹模型；局部圖像模式適合先試CNN；變長序列可比較pooling、RNN與Attention。這些是起點假設，並非架構與領域的一對一規則。資料量、標籤品質、部署資源和已知不變性，往往比追逐較大的名稱更直接影響選擇。\n\n## 一份能接手的模型卡\n\n用文字記錄輸入schema、目標定義、適用範圍、資料生成／來源、切分單位、前處理、架構、訓練版本及選擇規則。再寫總體與分組評估、baseline、成本與已知失敗。若資料是合成的，就把它放在第一段，不要讓讀者誤認為是真實場域成績。\n\n## 比較需要對齊哪些條件\n\n模型A跑10epochs、模型B跑100epochs，不一定能把差異歸因於架構。固定epoch也不保證計算量相同，所以應同時列訓練步數、實測時間與搜尋預算。參數量、FLOPs、記憶體和延遲不是同一量；更小的模型也可能因算子與裝置支援而較慢。\n\n## 不同指標代表不同決策\n\n若漏判成本較高，accuracy可能不足；若需要可信機率，就加NLL或Brier；若部署有延遲上限，就先篩掉超時模型。指標與門檻要在最終test之前決定。多個目標常形成取捨，不必用任意加權成一個神秘分數掩蓋它們。\n\n## 本課的模型卡範例\n\n表格MLP：原始輸入[N,4]有限浮點數，類別0／1；只對指定合成分布驗證。train統計內嵌artifact，2.15.0 CPU、seed7、24epochs、validation loss選快照。未測試真實資料、GPU效能、跨版本重載與分布外可靠性。這樣的限制可以讓下一位使用者知道該補哪些證據，而非猜測。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n假設兩個模型準確率相同，B的NLL較低但延遲超過需求，應選誰？答案取決於事先明定的使用條件；若延遲為硬限制，B不能直接上線。可以再探索蒸餾或其他模型，但要重新以相同協定驗證，不能只報最有利的一欄。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [學習與模型選擇背景](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/ml.html)\n- [PyTorch基準量測工具](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/benchmark_utils.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "選模型與寫模型卡：把假設留給下一位使用者", "html": "選模型與寫模型卡：把假設留給下一位使用者", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先選問題，再選架構", "html": "先選問題，再選架構", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一份能接手的模型卡", "html": "一份能接手的模型卡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "比較需要對齊哪些條件", "html": "比較需要對齊哪些條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "不同指標代表不同決策", "html": "不同指標代表不同決策", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "本課的模型卡範例", "html": "本課的模型卡範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "66-artifacts", "group": "projects", "title": "交付模型：前處理、權重與推論契約一起保存", "summary": "實作可重載的完整推論artifact，並區分它與可精確續訓的checkpoint。", "tags": ["artifact", "checkpoint", "inference", "serialization", "schema"], "example": "42_checkpoint.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">交付模型：前處理、權重與推論契約一起保存</h1>\n<p>實作可重載的完整推論artifact，並區分它與可精確續訓的checkpoint。</p>\n<h2 id=\"state_dict\">一個state_dict還少了什麼</h2>\n<p>權重需要配對架構、特徵順序、類別意義與前處理。第42例將格式版本、kind、seed、epoch數、完整Torch build字串、state、train均值／尺度、schema與歷史放在同一artifact。MLP架構由kind對應到程式建構；要分享時也需附上對應程式與需求檔，不能只傳.pt。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">兩條真的可執行的路徑</h2>\n<p>不加參數時，程式訓練後在暫存資料夾save／load，完成比對後清除暫存檔。若要留下模型，用新檔名：<code>python deep-learning/examples/42_checkpoint.py --output .qa/dl-model.pt</code>。程式會拒絕覆蓋既有檔案；從下載ZIP執行時，將路徑改為<code>python examples/42_checkpoint.py --output model.pt</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">推論輸入是原始特徵</h2>\n<p>JSON fixture依<code>__file__</code>定位，從其他工作目錄也能讀取。predict_tabular要求非空[N,4]且所有值有限，使用artifact內train統計轉換，eval加inference_mode回傳機率與標籤。若只輸入三個特徵，應立即拒絕而非補零猜測。特徵單位及語意仍須由外部schema管理，四個數字不代表一定輸入正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"round-trip\">round-trip應驗證什麼</h2>\n<p>相同原始輸入在存檔前後應有一致預測；本課測試確認最大誤差為0。loader使用weights_only=True與CPU map_location，且檢查格式及Torch版本。這是教學用嚴格同版本協定，並非PyTorch要求所有state_dict一律同版本；真實升級應有相容性測試。仍只載入可信來源，不把選項視為任意不可信檔案的安全承諾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">為何不是精確續訓</h2>\n<p>目前payload沒有optimizer動量、scheduler狀態、RNG與sampler位置，epochs也是訓練設定而非完整進度游標。它足以做推論，不能聲稱下一step與原訓練逐位相同。要做續訓、GPU、AMP、效能、API與部署，接到PyTorch實作工程課，並針對完整狀態另設驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>同一筆資料單獨推論和放在三筆batch中結果不同，先查什麼？答案：eval模式、是否誤用新batch重新fit前處理，以及是否存在刻意跨樣本計算。本課MLP沒有BatchNorm且沿用train統計，應在合理浮點誤差內一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python deep-learning/examples/42_checkpoint.py</code>。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Actual save/load and raw-feature prediction from an independent complete artifact.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">prediction_rows</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">predict_tabular</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;--output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span> <span class=\"ow\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exists</span><span class=\"p\">():</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;Choose a new output filename&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tabular&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">payload</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">];</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">prediction_rows</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">predict_tabular</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">payload</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">payload</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loaded</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model.pt&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">payload</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"n\">loaded</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;temporary directory, removed after demonstration&#39;</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">predict_tabular</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">loaded</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">rows</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;torch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">loaded</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;torch_version&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;initial_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;predictions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_roundtrip_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">right</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">left</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">right</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n            <span class=\"s1\">&#39;saved_to&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;inference artifact; not an exact-resume checkpoint&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">序列化語意</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.load.html\">torch.load選項</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">模組狀態</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 交付模型：前處理、權重與推論契約一起保存\n\n實作可重載的完整推論artifact，並區分它與可精確續訓的checkpoint。\n\n## 一個state_dict還少了什麼\n\n權重需要配對架構、特徵順序、類別意義與前處理。第42例將格式版本、kind、seed、epoch數、完整Torch build字串、state、train均值／尺度、schema與歷史放在同一artifact。MLP架構由kind對應到程式建構；要分享時也需附上對應程式與需求檔，不能只傳.pt。\n\n## 兩條真的可執行的路徑\n\n不加參數時，程式訓練後在暫存資料夾save／load，完成比對後清除暫存檔。若要留下模型，用新檔名：`python deep-learning/examples/42_checkpoint.py --output .qa/dl-model.pt`。程式會拒絕覆蓋既有檔案；從下載ZIP執行時，將路徑改為`python examples/42_checkpoint.py --output model.pt`。\n\n## 推論輸入是原始特徵\n\nJSON fixture依`__file__`定位，從其他工作目錄也能讀取。predict_tabular要求非空[N,4]且所有值有限，使用artifact內train統計轉換，eval加inference_mode回傳機率與標籤。若只輸入三個特徵，應立即拒絕而非補零猜測。特徵單位及語意仍須由外部schema管理，四個數字不代表一定輸入正確。\n\n## round-trip應驗證什麼\n\n相同原始輸入在存檔前後應有一致預測；本課測試確認最大誤差為0。loader使用weights_only=True與CPU map_location，且檢查格式及Torch版本。這是教學用嚴格同版本協定，並非PyTorch要求所有state_dict一律同版本；真實升級應有相容性測試。仍只載入可信來源，不把選項視為任意不可信檔案的安全承諾。\n\n## 為何不是精確續訓\n\n目前payload沒有optimizer動量、scheduler狀態、RNG與sampler位置，epochs也是訓練設定而非完整進度游標。它足以做推論，不能聲稱下一step與原訓練逐位相同。要做續訓、GPU、AMP、效能、API與部署，接到PyTorch實作工程課，並針對完整狀態另設驗證。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n同一筆資料單獨推論和放在三筆batch中結果不同，先查什麼？答案：eval模式、是否誤用新batch重新fit前處理，以及是否存在刻意跨樣本計算。本課MLP沒有BatchNorm且沿用train統計，應在合理浮點誤差內一致。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python deep-learning/examples/42_checkpoint.py`。下載包內含共用實作、合成資料、需求檔與測試，請保留完整資料夾。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Actual save/load and raw-feature prediction from an independent complete artifact.\"\"\"\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup,emit\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport argparse,tempfile\nfrom course_core import experiment,prediction_rows,predict_tabular,save_artifact,load_artifact\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    setup()\n    parser=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);parser.add_argument('--output',type=Path)\n    args=parser.parse_args(argv)\n    if args.output and args.output.exists():parser.error('Choose a new output filename')\n    run=experiment('tabular');payload=run['artifact'];rows=prediction_rows()\n    before=predict_tabular(payload,rows)\n    if args.output:\n        save_artifact(args.output,payload);loaded=load_artifact(args.output);saved=str(args.output)\n    else:\n        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as folder:\n            path=Path(folder)/'model.pt';save_artifact(path,payload);loaded=load_artifact(path)\n        saved='temporary directory, removed after demonstration'\n    after=predict_tabular(loaded,rows)\n    result={'torch':loaded['torch_version'],'initial_validation':run['initial_validation'],\n            'best_validation':run['best_validation'],'test':run['test'],'predictions':after,\n            'maximum_roundtrip_error':max(abs(a-b) for left,right in zip(before['probabilities'],after['probabilities']) for a,b in zip(left,right)),\n            'saved_to':saved,'scope':'inference artifact; not an exact-resume checkpoint'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__==\"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [序列化語意](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n- [torch.load選項](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/generated/torch.load.html)\n- [模組狀態](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "交付模型：前處理、權重與推論契約一起保存", "html": "交付模型：前處理、權重與推論契約一起保存", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "state_dict", "name": "一個state_dict還少了什麼", "html": "一個state_dict還少了什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "兩條真的可執行的路徑", "html": "兩條真的可執行的路徑", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "推論輸入是原始特徵", "html": "推論輸入是原始特徵", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "round-trip", "name": "round-trip應驗證什麼", "html": "round-trip應驗證什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "為何不是精確續訓", "html": "為何不是精確續訓", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "67-experimentation", "group": "synthesis", "title": "研究式實驗：讓每個改動回答一個問題", "summary": "學會baseline、消融、配對重跑及結果紀錄，將「感覺有效」變成可核對的觀察。", "tags": ["experiment design", "ablation", "baseline", "learning curves"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">研究式實驗：讓每個改動回答一個問題</h1>\n<p>學會baseline、消融、配對重跑及結果紀錄，將「感覺有效」變成可核對的觀察。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先寫預測，再執行</h2>\n<p>例如「加入非線性後，應比同資料上的linear模型更能擬合交互規則」。先寫主指標、資料切分、預算、seed及失敗判準，再跑實驗。若結果不符合預期，也保留它；這可能透露資料太少、最佳化失敗、特徵已含交互或原先假設不成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"baseline\">baseline需要足夠強</h2>\n<p>常數分類、簡單規則、線性與小MLP都可以是baseline。用明顯未訓練好的模型襯托新方法沒有資訊價值。第63章的最後token規則本來就完美，所以GRU專題的貢獻是工程與表示流程，不能寫成在此任務擊敗規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">消融不是任意刪功能</h2>\n<p>改掉Dropout時保持其餘條件，觀察train／validation差距與seed間變動；移除殘差時盡量對齊寬度、層數及訓練預算。若刪功能同時減少一半參數，結論就同時含容量改變。消融回答的問題需符合實際改動，必要時再補參數量接近的對照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">三種曲線各有用途</h2>\n<p>epoch learning curve看訓練過程；資料量曲線看更多資料是否有幫助；成本—品質曲線看預算取捨。validation波動可能來自集合小，不能每次尖峰都當成真改善。事先定義最佳快照與停止政策；頻繁增加搜尋次數，也會逐步過度適應validation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">結果表的最少欄位</h2>\n<p>記錄run ID、假設、程式版本、資料／split、架構與參數、loss、optimizer、lr、epochs、seed、最佳epoch、validation主指標、成本及備註。最終test結果單獨封存，避免所有探索都逐次填入test。失敗的run保留原因，例如無效mask或非有限loss，而非從表中消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>A比B高1個百分點，但每種只跑一次，能宣布勝出嗎？答案：只能陳述這兩次觀察。先確認測試分母、seed變動、是否同split與同搜尋預算，再設計需要的重跑；不要以固定seed當作沒有變異的證明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html\">重現性與變動控制</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/optimization.html\">深度模型最佳化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 研究式實驗：讓每個改動回答一個問題\n\n學會baseline、消融、配對重跑及結果紀錄，將「感覺有效」變成可核對的觀察。\n\n## 先寫預測，再執行\n\n例如「加入非線性後，應比同資料上的linear模型更能擬合交互規則」。先寫主指標、資料切分、預算、seed及失敗判準，再跑實驗。若結果不符合預期，也保留它；這可能透露資料太少、最佳化失敗、特徵已含交互或原先假設不成立。\n\n## baseline需要足夠強\n\n常數分類、簡單規則、線性與小MLP都可以是baseline。用明顯未訓練好的模型襯托新方法沒有資訊價值。第63章的最後token規則本來就完美，所以GRU專題的貢獻是工程與表示流程，不能寫成在此任務擊敗規則。\n\n## 消融不是任意刪功能\n\n改掉Dropout時保持其餘條件，觀察train／validation差距與seed間變動；移除殘差時盡量對齊寬度、層數及訓練預算。若刪功能同時減少一半參數，結論就同時含容量改變。消融回答的問題需符合實際改動，必要時再補參數量接近的對照。\n\n## 三種曲線各有用途\n\nepoch learning curve看訓練過程；資料量曲線看更多資料是否有幫助；成本—品質曲線看預算取捨。validation波動可能來自集合小，不能每次尖峰都當成真改善。事先定義最佳快照與停止政策；頻繁增加搜尋次數，也會逐步過度適應validation。\n\n## 結果表的最少欄位\n\n記錄run ID、假設、程式版本、資料／split、架構與參數、loss、optimizer、lr、epochs、seed、最佳epoch、validation主指標、成本及備註。最終test結果單獨封存，避免所有探索都逐次填入test。失敗的run保留原因，例如無效mask或非有限loss，而非從表中消失。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nA比B高1個百分點，但每種只跑一次，能宣布勝出嗎？答案：只能陳述這兩次觀察。先確認測試分母、seed變動、是否同split與同搜尋預算，再設計需要的重跑；不要以固定seed當作沒有變異的證明。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [重現性與變動控制](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html)\n- [深度模型最佳化](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/contents/optimization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "研究式實驗：讓每個改動回答一個問題", "html": "研究式實驗：讓每個改動回答一個問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先寫預測，再執行", "html": "先寫預測，再執行", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "baseline", "name": "baseline需要足夠強", "html": "baseline需要足夠強", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "消融不是任意刪功能", "html": "消融不是任意刪功能", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "三種曲線各有用途", "html": "三種曲線各有用途", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "結果表的最少欄位", "html": "結果表的最少欄位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "68-architecture-map", "group": "synthesis", "title": "架構地圖：從CNN、Transformer到圖與生成模型", "summary": "以資料結構、訊息交換方式與訓練目標整理架構，而非把所有名稱排成新舊名次。", "tags": ["architecture", "CNN", "ViT", "GNN", "Transformer", "generative"], "html": "<h1 id=\"cnntransformer\">架構地圖：從CNN、Transformer到圖與生成模型</h1>\n<p>以資料結構、訊息交換方式與訓練目標整理架構，而非把所有名稱排成新舊名次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">兩個不同的分類軸</h2>\n<p>CNN、RNN、Transformer描述計算與連接方式；對比學習、分類、重建、去噪描述訓練目標。同一Transformer可做分類、對比或生成；Diffusion的denoiser也可採不同骨幹。因此看到模型名稱，先問它的輸入、主幹、目標及推論流程，避免把架構等同於應用能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"patch-attention\">卷積與patch Attention</h2>\n<p>CNN用局部共享權重處理規則網格，天然帶有某些位置結構；ViT把影像切成patch，映射成token，結合位置資訊與Attention。ViT不是「把像素丟給聊天模型」，CNN也未被所有任務淘汰。資料、預訓練、解析度、預算與歸納偏置共同影響結果，本課不宣稱任何架構是2026所有任務的最佳解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"attention\">遞迴、Attention與長度成本</h2>\n<p>RNN以狀態逐步壓縮歷史，標準dense self-attention則建立token兩兩互動。前者有逐步依賴，後者的注意力矩陣對長度是平方規模；具體效能仍受實作、記憶體與硬體影響。位置編碼、mask與cache改變使用方式，不能只看一個大O就宣布實機速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">圖神經網路的起點</h2>\n<p>節點與邊表達不規則關係，message passing聚合鄰居訊息再更新節點。要考慮節點順序不應改變圖的語意、邊方向、聚合方式與多跳範圍。典型GCN以正規化鄰接矩陣聚合特徵；它不是將圖表圖片送進CNN，也不是LangGraph工作流程節點的同義詞。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nH^{(l+1)}=\\sigma\\!\\left(\\widetilde D^{-1/2}\\widetilde A\n\\widetilde D^{-1/2}H^{(l)}W^{(l)}\\right)\n$$</div>\n<p>此為加入self-loop後的典型GCN形式；不是所有GNN都使用這個公式。本課僅建立閱讀入口，沒有宣稱已實作完整圖學習課程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">生成模型與表示學習的交會</h2>\n<p>AE／VAE壓縮表示、對比學習塑造相似性、Diffusion和Flow學動態變換，彼此可組合但目標不同。更複雜的系統常同時含encoder、生成主幹與後處理。閱讀新論文時，把新模組放回資料—表示—目標—最佳化—評估這條線，會比背縮寫更有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>「用了Transformer，所以是自回歸LLM」哪裡有問題？答案：主幹不能決定訓練目標、token種類或mask。它也可能是影像分類器、雙向encoder或去噪網路；需查看資料、loss與推論流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.11929\">ViT原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907\">GCN原始論文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\">Transformer原始論文</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 架構地圖：從CNN、Transformer到圖與生成模型\n\n以資料結構、訊息交換方式與訓練目標整理架構，而非把所有名稱排成新舊名次。\n\n## 兩個不同的分類軸\n\nCNN、RNN、Transformer描述計算與連接方式；對比學習、分類、重建、去噪描述訓練目標。同一Transformer可做分類、對比或生成；Diffusion的denoiser也可採不同骨幹。因此看到模型名稱，先問它的輸入、主幹、目標及推論流程，避免把架構等同於應用能力。\n\n## 卷積與patch Attention\n\nCNN用局部共享權重處理規則網格，天然帶有某些位置結構；ViT把影像切成patch，映射成token，結合位置資訊與Attention。ViT不是「把像素丟給聊天模型」，CNN也未被所有任務淘汰。資料、預訓練、解析度、預算與歸納偏置共同影響結果，本課不宣稱任何架構是2026所有任務的最佳解。\n\n## 遞迴、Attention與長度成本\n\nRNN以狀態逐步壓縮歷史，標準dense self-attention則建立token兩兩互動。前者有逐步依賴，後者的注意力矩陣對長度是平方規模；具體效能仍受實作、記憶體與硬體影響。位置編碼、mask與cache改變使用方式，不能只看一個大O就宣布實機速度。\n\n## 圖神經網路的起點\n\n節點與邊表達不規則關係，message passing聚合鄰居訊息再更新節點。要考慮節點順序不應改變圖的語意、邊方向、聚合方式與多跳範圍。典型GCN以正規化鄰接矩陣聚合特徵；它不是將圖表圖片送進CNN，也不是LangGraph工作流程節點的同義詞。\n\n$$\nH^{(l+1)}=\\sigma\\!\\left(\\widetilde D^{-1/2}\\widetilde A\n\\widetilde D^{-1/2}H^{(l)}W^{(l)}\\right)\n$$\n\n此為加入self-loop後的典型GCN形式；不是所有GNN都使用這個公式。本課僅建立閱讀入口，沒有宣稱已實作完整圖學習課程。\n\n## 生成模型與表示學習的交會\n\nAE／VAE壓縮表示、對比學習塑造相似性、Diffusion和Flow學動態變換，彼此可組合但目標不同。更複雜的系統常同時含encoder、生成主幹與後處理。閱讀新論文時，把新模組放回資料—表示—目標—最佳化—評估這條線，會比背縮寫更有用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n「用了Transformer，所以是自回歸LLM」哪裡有問題？答案：主幹不能決定訓練目標、token種類或mask。它也可能是影像分類器、雙向encoder或去噪網路；需查看資料、loss與推論流程。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [ViT原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.11929)\n- [GCN原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907)\n- [Transformer原始論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cnntransformer", "name": "架構地圖：從CNN、Transformer到圖與生成模型", "html": "架構地圖：從CNN、Transformer到圖與生成模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "兩個不同的分類軸", "html": "兩個不同的分類軸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "patch-attention", "name": "卷積與patch Attention", "html": "卷積與patch Attention", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "attention", "name": "遞迴、Attention與長度成本", "html": "遞迴、Attention與長度成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "圖神經網路的起點", "html": "圖神經網路的起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "生成模型與表示學習的交會", "html": "生成模型與表示學習的交會", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "69-course-bridges", "group": "synthesis", "title": "接下來怎麼學：從深度學習走向各個獨立領域", "summary": "依目前缺少的能力選擇下一門課，並保留各領域足夠獨立的完整性。", "tags": ["learning path", "PyTorch", "embedding", "RAG", "ML"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">接下來怎麼學：從深度學習走向各個獨立領域</h1>\n<p>依目前缺少的能力選擇下一門課，並保留各領域足夠獨立的完整性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">數學與實作可以來回讀</h2>\n<p>如果反向傳播公式懂、但不知道怎麼整理Dataset、裝置、儲存與推論，接著讀<a href=\"../pytorch/index.html\">PyTorch實作工程</a>。如果訓練器已能寫，卻無法解釋CE梯度、初始化或mask，就回來手算並用本課已知值例子校對。重讀的目標是找到具體缺口，不需要把全部頁面依序再看一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">資料與評估不只屬於深度學習</h2>\n<p><a href=\"../machine-learning/index.html\">機器學習</a>補上資料切分、交叉驗證、線性／樹模型、指標與選擇協定。深網不會免除這些要求；小型表格常值得先試傳統方法。當你只會調層數，卻還沒建立baseline與保留test，先補實驗設計通常更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">想做語意表示與檢索</h2>\n<p><a href=\"../embedding/index.html\">Embedding</a>深入向量、相似度、表示品質與索引；<a href=\"../rag/index.html\">RAG</a>再處理文件、切塊、檢索、重排、引用與評估。本課的InfoNCE只是表示學習的一個起點，不等於已完成生產用檢索系統。向量正確、索引正確與回答可信，是不同層的驗收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"agent\">想用模型服務與Agent</h2>\n<p><a href=\"../llm/index.html\">LLM服務與AI Agents</a>介紹服務介面與工具能力，<a href=\"../langgraph/index.html\">LangGraph</a>處理有狀態的工作流程。Agent通常是系統與控制問題，未必需要自己訓練神經網路；深度學習則讓你理解模型內部可學習的部分。兩者都重要，但能力邊界不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">還有哪些獨立課程</h2>\n<p>Transformer／LLM原理、完整影像辨識、模型微調、強化學習等保留在課程清單中，之後可各自展開資料、方法與專題。本課的CNN、Attention與生成橋接會先讓你能讀懂基本運算，不把尚未實作的專門課列為已完成，也不建立不存在的連結。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">自我檢核與解答</h2>\n<p>若你要把公司文件做問答，第一步一定要訓練Transformer嗎？不一定。先定義資料、存取、檢索及評估，很多需求可以用既有模型服務完成。若接下來需要改進特定表示或自己訓練，再帶著明確問題回到深度學習、Embedding或微調課程。能選擇需要的工具，本身也是學習成果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html\">PyTorch完整文件入口</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.deeplearningbook.org/\">深度學習教材目錄</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 接下來怎麼學：從深度學習走向各個獨立領域\n\n依目前缺少的能力選擇下一門課，並保留各領域足夠獨立的完整性。\n\n## 數學與實作可以來回讀\n\n如果反向傳播公式懂、但不知道怎麼整理Dataset、裝置、儲存與推論，接著讀[PyTorch實作工程](../pytorch/index.html)。如果訓練器已能寫，卻無法解釋CE梯度、初始化或mask，就回來手算並用本課已知值例子校對。重讀的目標是找到具體缺口，不需要把全部頁面依序再看一次。\n\n## 資料與評估不只屬於深度學習\n\n[機器學習](../machine-learning/index.html)補上資料切分、交叉驗證、線性／樹模型、指標與選擇協定。深網不會免除這些要求；小型表格常值得先試傳統方法。當你只會調層數，卻還沒建立baseline與保留test，先補實驗設計通常更有效。\n\n## 想做語意表示與檢索\n\n[Embedding](../embedding/index.html)深入向量、相似度、表示品質與索引；[RAG](../rag/index.html)再處理文件、切塊、檢索、重排、引用與評估。本課的InfoNCE只是表示學習的一個起點，不等於已完成生產用檢索系統。向量正確、索引正確與回答可信，是不同層的驗收。\n\n## 想用模型服務與Agent\n\n[LLM服務與AI Agents](../llm/index.html)介紹服務介面與工具能力，[LangGraph](../langgraph/index.html)處理有狀態的工作流程。Agent通常是系統與控制問題，未必需要自己訓練神經網路；深度學習則讓你理解模型內部可學習的部分。兩者都重要，但能力邊界不同。\n\n## 還有哪些獨立課程\n\nTransformer／LLM原理、完整影像辨識、模型微調、強化學習等保留在課程清單中，之後可各自展開資料、方法與專題。本課的CNN、Attention與生成橋接會先讓你能讀懂基本運算，不把尚未實作的專門課列為已完成，也不建立不存在的連結。\n\n## 自我檢核與解答\n\n若你要把公司文件做問答，第一步一定要訓練Transformer嗎？不一定。先定義資料、存取、檢索及評估，很多需求可以用既有模型服務完成。若接下來需要改進特定表示或自己訓練，再帶著明確問題回到深度學習、Embedding或微調課程。能選擇需要的工具，本身也是學習成果。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [PyTorch完整文件入口](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html)\n- [深度學習教材目錄](https://www.deeplearningbook.org/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "接下來怎麼學：從深度學習走向各個獨立領域", "html": "接下來怎麼學：從深度學習走向各個獨立領域", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "數學與實作可以來回讀", "html": "數學與實作可以來回讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "資料與評估不只屬於深度學習", "html": "資料與評估不只屬於深度學習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "想做語意表示與檢索", "html": "想做語意表示與檢索", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "agent", "name": "想用模型服務與Agent", "html": "想用模型服務與Agent", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "還有哪些獨立課程", "html": "還有哪些獨立課程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "自我檢核與解答", "html": "自我檢核與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "70-math-exercises", "group": "synthesis", "title": "數學習題詳解：用數字檢查你是否真的理解", "summary": "從鏈式法則、CE、參數量到Attention與生成公式，逐題列出可檢核解法。", "tags": ["exercises", "derivation", "backpropagation", "attention", "solutions"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">數學習題詳解：用數字檢查你是否真的理解</h1>\n<p>從鏈式法則、CE、參數量到Attention與生成公式，逐題列出可檢核解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">題一：鏈式法則</h2>\n<p>z=wx+b、a=sigmoid(z)、L=.5(a−y)²，求w導數。答案為(a−y)a(1−a)x。若x=2、w=0、b=0、y=1，則a=.5，導數為−.25。梯度下降w'=w−η∂L/∂w，因此w增加；這符合把輸出往1推近的方向。漏掉x會在此得到錯一倍的更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ce\">題二：多類別CE</h2>\n<p>單筆logits全為0、三類標籤為類別1，softmax是各1/3。CE對logits梯度為[1/3,−2/3,1/3]。若是N筆平均loss，每列還需除N；若是加權或忽略標籤，則依實際分母，不可固定除batch大小。三個梯度加總0反映logits一起加常數不改機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">題三：參數與初始化</h2>\n<p>4→24→24→2全連接含bias參數為(4×24+24)+(24×24+24)+(24×2+2)=770。He初始化若fan_in=4，常態權重變異數為2/4=.5，不是標準差.5。若對稱零均值z經ReLU，E[ReLU(z)²]=E[z²]/2；中心變異數還要減掉非零均值平方，二者不相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">題四：卷積與感受野</h2>\n<p>兩層kernel3，stride先1再2，dilation1。從r0=1、j0=1開始，r1=3、j1=1，r2=5、j2=2。第三層kernel3、stride1則r3=9、j3=2。注意stride更新影響後續層的步距，本層新增範圍用前一層jump。輸出位置在邊界時，部分理論範圍可能對到padding。</p>\n<h2 id=\"attention\">題五：Attention與遮罩</h2>\n<p>某query的允許key分數都為0，共兩個key，權重各.5。V=[2,6]則輸出4。若第二key被禁止，權重為[1,0]、輸出2。縮放除以sqrt(dk)改變softmax前的尺度，但不能替代mask。若整列都禁止，數學上的softmax沒有合法分布；應在資料／mask設計處避免，不依賴後端特殊行為。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vae\">題六：VAE與加噪</h2>\n<p>一維μ=0、logvar=0，KL=.5(μ²+exp(logvar)−1−logvar)=0。μ=1、logvar=0則KL=.5。若alpha_bar=.64、x0=2、ε=−1，xt=.8×2+.6×(−1)=1。這裡.64與.36是訊號／噪音的條件尺度平方，不能直接把任意非單位變異資料的總變異當成1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flow\">題七：蒸餾與Flow</h2>\n<p>student與teacher分布相同，KL=0，但hard CE可非零。Flow直線路徑z=−1、x1=3，t=.25時xt=0，速度4。模型只接xt,t，訓練目標來自配對端點；推論時沒有權限直接讀取未知x1，必須用學到的速度場積分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">如何用範例自我校正</h2>\n<p>先手算再跑03、04、08、22、30、35、37、38例，解釋每個誤差的來源。有限差分使用double及合適步長；浮點微小誤差不等於公式錯誤，整體符號、shape或倍數不對則需要回查reduction與記號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html\">自動微分與梯度檢查</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.init.html\">初始化定義</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762\">Attention原論文</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 數學習題詳解：用數字檢查你是否真的理解\n\n從鏈式法則、CE、參數量到Attention與生成公式，逐題列出可檢核解法。\n\n## 題一：鏈式法則\n\nz=wx+b、a=sigmoid(z)、L=.5(a−y)²，求w導數。答案為(a−y)a(1−a)x。若x=2、w=0、b=0、y=1，則a=.5，導數為−.25。梯度下降w'=w−η∂L/∂w，因此w增加；這符合把輸出往1推近的方向。漏掉x會在此得到錯一倍的更新。\n\n## 題二：多類別CE\n\n單筆logits全為0、三類標籤為類別1，softmax是各1/3。CE對logits梯度為[1/3,−2/3,1/3]。若是N筆平均loss，每列還需除N；若是加權或忽略標籤，則依實際分母，不可固定除batch大小。三個梯度加總0反映logits一起加常數不改機率。\n\n## 題三：參數與初始化\n\n4→24→24→2全連接含bias參數為(4×24+24)+(24×24+24)+(24×2+2)=770。He初始化若fan_in=4，常態權重變異數為2/4=.5，不是標準差.5。若對稱零均值z經ReLU，E[ReLU(z)²]=E[z²]/2；中心變異數還要減掉非零均值平方，二者不相等。\n\n## 題四：卷積與感受野\n\n兩層kernel3，stride先1再2，dilation1。從r0=1、j0=1開始，r1=3、j1=1，r2=5、j2=2。第三層kernel3、stride1則r3=9、j3=2。注意stride更新影響後續層的步距，本層新增範圍用前一層jump。輸出位置在邊界時，部分理論範圍可能對到padding。\n\n## 題五：Attention與遮罩\n\n某query的允許key分數都為0，共兩個key，權重各.5。V=[2,6]則輸出4。若第二key被禁止，權重為[1,0]、輸出2。縮放除以sqrt(dk)改變softmax前的尺度，但不能替代mask。若整列都禁止，數學上的softmax沒有合法分布；應在資料／mask設計處避免，不依賴後端特殊行為。\n\n## 題六：VAE與加噪\n\n一維μ=0、logvar=0，KL=.5(μ²+exp(logvar)−1−logvar)=0。μ=1、logvar=0則KL=.5。若alpha_bar=.64、x0=2、ε=−1，xt=.8×2+.6×(−1)=1。這裡.64與.36是訊號／噪音的條件尺度平方，不能直接把任意非單位變異資料的總變異當成1。\n\n## 題七：蒸餾與Flow\n\nstudent與teacher分布相同，KL=0，但hard CE可非零。Flow直線路徑z=−1、x1=3，t=.25時xt=0，速度4。模型只接xt,t，訓練目標來自配對端點；推論時沒有權限直接讀取未知x1，必須用學到的速度場積分。\n\n## 如何用範例自我校正\n\n先手算再跑03、04、08、22、30、35、37、38例，解釋每個誤差的來源。有限差分使用double及合適步長；浮點微小誤差不等於公式錯誤，整體符號、shape或倍數不對則需要回查reduction與記號。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [自動微分與梯度檢查](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html)\n- [初始化定義](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.init.html)\n- [Attention原論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "數學習題詳解：用數字檢查你是否真的理解", "html": "數學習題詳解：用數字檢查你是否真的理解", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "題一：鏈式法則", "html": "題一：鏈式法則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "ce", "name": "題二：多類別CE", "html": "題二：多類別CE", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "題三：參數與初始化", "html": "題三：參數與初始化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "題四：卷積與感受野", "html": "題四：卷積與感受野", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "attention", "name": "題五：Attention與遮罩", "html": "題五：Attention與遮罩", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "vae", "name": "題六：VAE與加噪", "html": "題六：VAE與加噪", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "flow", "name": "題七：蒸餾與Flow", "html": "題七：蒸餾與Flow", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "如何用範例自我校正", "html": "如何用範例自我校正", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "71-implementation-exercises", "group": "synthesis", "title": "實作挑戰詳解：讓錯誤在測試中暴露", "summary": "以資料、梯度、mask、狀態與artifact設計具體挑戰，附驗收方式與解題方向。", "tags": ["exercises", "testing", "invariants", "implementation", "solutions"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">實作挑戰詳解：讓錯誤在測試中暴露</h1>\n<p>以資料、梯度、mask、狀態與artifact設計具體挑戰，附驗收方式與解題方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">挑戰一：抓出偷看資料的前處理</h2>\n<p>建立train與validation不同均值的資料，故意用全部資料算scaler，再修成train-only。驗收是改validation的值時，train均值／尺度不變。解答：先split、以train fit、其他集合只transform；只比較最後accuracy可能看不出洩漏，所以要直接測統計來源。本課核心的tabular生成器已採這個邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">挑戰二：證明遮罩禁止未來</h2>\n<p>固定Q、K與mask，僅大幅改最後token的V，檢查較早位置輸出不變。解答見第31例：上三角future為禁止位置；MHA bool True表示禁止，SDPA bool True表示允許，兩個API不可照搬同一個bool張量。驗收同時看完整shape及允許key權重，並避免全禁止列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">挑戰三：辨認凍結的三個意思</h2>\n<p>將模型分為backbone與head，要求backbone參數不更新，但head可學。解答：設定backbone requires_grad=False，optimizer只收head，若backbone含BatchNorm／Dropout還需決定其模式與buffer政策。只檢查weight不變，不能證明running statistics不變。第25例特別使用隨機backbone，不把這叫作預訓練效益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">挑戰四：最後小批次的梯度累積</h2>\n<p>將10筆分成4、4、2，要求與一次10筆mean loss相同梯度。解答：每microbatch mean loss乘其樣本數／10後backward，最後才step；不可一律除3，否則最後兩筆權重過大。若原loss有weighted CE或其他分母，需重新計算正確權重。第16例包含此已知值驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gan\">挑戰五：GAN的梯度邊界</h2>\n<p>D step前後比較G參數；G step前後比較D參數，並確認G有非零更新。解答：D訓練使用G(z).detach，G訓練時凍結D參數但保留經D輸入到G的梯度。把整個D forward放進no_grad會切斷G需要的路徑。僅看loss印得出來，無法證明更新對象正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">挑戰六：交付往返</h2>\n<p>用第42例保存到新檔名，換工作目錄後重載，輸入同一份原始特徵。驗收預測一致、shape錯誤及非有限值被拒、既有檔案不覆寫、版本不合明確失敗。解答核心在artifact的schema／前處理／state同步，而非單獨測torch.save是否產生檔案。這是推論交付，不是精確resume。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">如何跑既有測試</h2>\n<p>在專案根目錄執行<code>python -m unittest discover -s deep-learning/examples -p test_examples.py -v</code>。目前55項CPU測試涵蓋數學、最佳化、序列Attention、生成與專題，包含42入口從不同cwd實跑且封鎖socket網路。測試數不是品質的充分條件；它們支持所列契約，沒有覆蓋真實資料效果、GPU效能或所有硬體。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">額外練習與解答</h2>\n<p>為何不把每個print字串都寫成測試？因為那只鎖住顯示格式，無法驗證學習行為。優先測已知數學結果、參數更新範圍、資料邊界、mask不變性和save／load一致性，再為必要介面加精準格式驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd計算與凍結</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">模組參數與buffer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">序列化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 實作挑戰詳解：讓錯誤在測試中暴露\n\n以資料、梯度、mask、狀態與artifact設計具體挑戰，附驗收方式與解題方向。\n\n## 挑戰一：抓出偷看資料的前處理\n\n建立train與validation不同均值的資料，故意用全部資料算scaler，再修成train-only。驗收是改validation的值時，train均值／尺度不變。解答：先split、以train fit、其他集合只transform；只比較最後accuracy可能看不出洩漏，所以要直接測統計來源。本課核心的tabular生成器已採這個邊界。\n\n## 挑戰二：證明遮罩禁止未來\n\n固定Q、K與mask，僅大幅改最後token的V，檢查較早位置輸出不變。解答見第31例：上三角future為禁止位置；MHA bool True表示禁止，SDPA bool True表示允許，兩個API不可照搬同一個bool張量。驗收同時看完整shape及允許key權重，並避免全禁止列。\n\n## 挑戰三：辨認凍結的三個意思\n\n將模型分為backbone與head，要求backbone參數不更新，但head可學。解答：設定backbone requires_grad=False，optimizer只收head，若backbone含BatchNorm／Dropout還需決定其模式與buffer政策。只檢查weight不變，不能證明running statistics不變。第25例特別使用隨機backbone，不把這叫作預訓練效益。\n\n## 挑戰四：最後小批次的梯度累積\n\n將10筆分成4、4、2，要求與一次10筆mean loss相同梯度。解答：每microbatch mean loss乘其樣本數／10後backward，最後才step；不可一律除3，否則最後兩筆權重過大。若原loss有weighted CE或其他分母，需重新計算正確權重。第16例包含此已知值驗證。\n\n## 挑戰五：GAN的梯度邊界\n\nD step前後比較G參數；G step前後比較D參數，並確認G有非零更新。解答：D訓練使用G(z).detach，G訓練時凍結D參數但保留經D輸入到G的梯度。把整個D forward放進no_grad會切斷G需要的路徑。僅看loss印得出來，無法證明更新對象正確。\n\n## 挑戰六：交付往返\n\n用第42例保存到新檔名，換工作目錄後重載，輸入同一份原始特徵。驗收預測一致、shape錯誤及非有限值被拒、既有檔案不覆寫、版本不合明確失敗。解答核心在artifact的schema／前處理／state同步，而非單獨測torch.save是否產生檔案。這是推論交付，不是精確resume。\n\n## 如何跑既有測試\n\n在專案根目錄執行`python -m unittest discover -s deep-learning/examples -p test_examples.py -v`。目前55項CPU測試涵蓋數學、最佳化、序列Attention、生成與專題，包含42入口從不同cwd實跑且封鎖socket網路。測試數不是品質的充分條件；它們支持所列契約，沒有覆蓋真實資料效果、GPU效能或所有硬體。\n\n## 額外練習與解答\n\n為何不把每個print字串都寫成測試？因為那只鎖住顯示格式，無法驗證學習行為。優先測已知數學結果、參數更新範圍、資料邊界、mask不變性和save／load一致性，再為必要介面加精準格式驗證。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [Autograd計算與凍結](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [模組參數與buffer](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n- [序列化](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "實作挑戰詳解：讓錯誤在測試中暴露", "html": "實作挑戰詳解：讓錯誤在測試中暴露", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "挑戰一：抓出偷看資料的前處理", "html": "挑戰一：抓出偷看資料的前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "挑戰二：證明遮罩禁止未來", "html": "挑戰二：證明遮罩禁止未來", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "挑戰三：辨認凍結的三個意思", "html": "挑戰三：辨認凍結的三個意思", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "挑戰四：最後小批次的梯度累積", "html": "挑戰四：最後小批次的梯度累積", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gan", "name": "挑戰五：GAN的梯度邊界", "html": "挑戰五：GAN的梯度邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "挑戰六：交付往返", "html": "挑戰六：交付往返", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "如何跑既有測試", "html": "如何跑既有測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "額外練習與解答", "html": "額外練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "72-reference", "group": "synthesis", "title": "術語、公式與版本速查：把整門課收進一張地圖", "summary": "整理使用時最常混淆的概念、官方來源與可執行基準，方便回來查閱。", "tags": ["reference", "glossary", "version", "PyTorch", "quick reference"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">術語、公式與版本速查：把整門課收進一張地圖</h1>\n<p>整理使用時最常混淆的概念、官方來源與可執行基準，方便回來查閱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">版本與實測基準</h2>\n<p>查核日期2026-10-30，採官方最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0，實測Python3.11、torch2.15.0+cpu。需求檔固定torch==2.15.0，CPU安裝使用官方CPU index；+cpu為build標記。首次安裝需要網路，安裝完成後42個Python入口只用自產資料或包內fixture，不下載模型或資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一眼分清楚的術語</h2>\n<p>parameter是optimizer可更新的模型狀態，buffer如BatchNorm running statistics也會存進state_dict但不是可訓練參數。train／eval控制模組行為，no_grad／inference_mode控制梯度紀錄。logits是未正規化分數，probabilities才是正規化機率。embedding是向量表示，不一定來自大型語言模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">常用公式與分母</h2>\n<p>row-batch Linear為Z=XWᵀ+b，PyTorch Linear.weight shape為[out,in]。無權重、無忽略標籤的mean CE對logits梯度為(P−Y)/N；weighted CE須看實際分母。SGD更新θ−ηg，AdamW另有decoupled decay。KL非負但不對稱；β-VAE的β不等於1時，目標不再直接是標準ELBO負號。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\operatorname{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\n\\operatorname{softmax}\\!\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}+M\\right)V\n$$</div>\n<p>此M是加法mask：允許0、禁止負無限，不等於任一API的bool慣例。Dropout與其他參數也未包含在這個簡式內。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">生成模型速查</h2>\n<p>AE學重建但沒有自動定義可採樣prior；VAE加latent分布及KL；GAN用對抗目標；DDPM學噪音預測並用指定反向鏈採樣；Flow Matching學速度場並解ODE。它們都可能輸出資料，但loss、採樣成本與評估方法不同，不可跨方法直接比較數值大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">課程檔案怎麼找</h2>\n<p>72章原稿在chapters，目錄在course.json，42入口、獨立course_core、fixture、requirements與55項測試在examples。examples.zip包含完整依賴程式，不要只抽出某一個入口。網頁的六個互動實驗使用JavaScript計算數值，沒有在瀏覽器中執行Torch；Python例子才是實際框架訓練。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">能力邊界與下一次更新</h2>\n<p>所有實跑範例是CPU小型合成資料，不以其成績承諾真實場域能力。課程未驗證GPU、分散式訓練或部署效能，這些接到工程課。日後版本更新時應先查官方穩定版、讀相關API變更、在新隔離環境實跑測試，再更新日期與基準；不只替換頁面上的版本字串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">自我驗收與解答</h2>\n<p>你能說清楚一個模型的輸入、表示、目標、梯度、選擇規則及交付契約嗎？若少一項，就回到相應章節用小例子驗證。完成閱讀不是唯一終點；能指出結果支持什麼、還缺什麼證據，才能把這些原理帶到下一個任務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">原始論文與官方來源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0\">PyTorch2.15.0正式發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/\">PyPI2.15.0套件資料</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html\">PyTorch2.15完整文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html\">可重現性限制</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 術語、公式與版本速查：把整門課收進一張地圖\n\n整理使用時最常混淆的概念、官方來源與可執行基準，方便回來查閱。\n\n## 版本與實測基準\n\n查核日期2026-10-30，採官方最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0，實測Python3.11、torch2.15.0+cpu。需求檔固定torch==2.15.0，CPU安裝使用官方CPU index；+cpu為build標記。首次安裝需要網路，安裝完成後42個Python入口只用自產資料或包內fixture，不下載模型或資料。\n\n## 一眼分清楚的術語\n\nparameter是optimizer可更新的模型狀態，buffer如BatchNorm running statistics也會存進state_dict但不是可訓練參數。train／eval控制模組行為，no_grad／inference_mode控制梯度紀錄。logits是未正規化分數，probabilities才是正規化機率。embedding是向量表示，不一定來自大型語言模型。\n\n## 常用公式與分母\n\nrow-batch Linear為Z=XWᵀ+b，PyTorch Linear.weight shape為[out,in]。無權重、無忽略標籤的mean CE對logits梯度為(P−Y)/N；weighted CE須看實際分母。SGD更新θ−ηg，AdamW另有decoupled decay。KL非負但不對稱；β-VAE的β不等於1時，目標不再直接是標準ELBO負號。\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\n\\operatorname{softmax}\\!\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}+M\\right)V\n$$\n\n此M是加法mask：允許0、禁止負無限，不等於任一API的bool慣例。Dropout與其他參數也未包含在這個簡式內。\n\n## 生成模型速查\n\nAE學重建但沒有自動定義可採樣prior；VAE加latent分布及KL；GAN用對抗目標；DDPM學噪音預測並用指定反向鏈採樣；Flow Matching學速度場並解ODE。它們都可能輸出資料，但loss、採樣成本與評估方法不同，不可跨方法直接比較數值大小。\n\n## 課程檔案怎麼找\n\n72章原稿在chapters，目錄在course.json，42入口、獨立course_core、fixture、requirements與55項測試在examples。examples.zip包含完整依賴程式，不要只抽出某一個入口。網頁的六個互動實驗使用JavaScript計算數值，沒有在瀏覽器中執行Torch；Python例子才是實際框架訓練。\n\n## 能力邊界與下一次更新\n\n所有實跑範例是CPU小型合成資料，不以其成績承諾真實場域能力。課程未驗證GPU、分散式訓練或部署效能，這些接到工程課。日後版本更新時應先查官方穩定版、讀相關API變更、在新隔離環境實跑測試，再更新日期與基準；不只替換頁面上的版本字串。\n\n## 自我驗收與解答\n\n你能說清楚一個模型的輸入、表示、目標、梯度、選擇規則及交付契約嗎？若少一項，就回到相應章節用小例子驗證。完成閱讀不是唯一終點；能指出結果支持什麼、還缺什麼證據，才能把這些原理帶到下一個任務。\n\n## 原始論文與官方來源\n\n- [PyTorch2.15.0正式發布](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0)\n- [PyPI2.15.0套件資料](https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/)\n- [PyTorch2.15完整文件](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html)\n- [可重現性限制](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "術語、公式與版本速查：把整門課收進一張地圖", "html": "術語、公式與版本速查：把整門課收進一張地圖", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "版本與實測基準", "html": "版本與實測基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一眼分清楚的術語", "html": "一眼分清楚的術語", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "常用公式與分母", "html": "常用公式與分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "生成模型速查", "html": "生成模型速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "課程檔案怎麼找", "html": "課程檔案怎麼找", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "能力邊界與下一次更新", "html": "能力邊界與下一次更新", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "自我驗收與解答", "html": "自我驗收與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "原始論文與官方來源", "html": "原始論文與官方來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}]};
